  <data key="d2">Research laboratory at FST of Tangier, Abdelmalek Essaadi University, Tetouan, Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory at the FST of Tangier, Abdelmalek Essaadi University, Tetouan, Morocco, to which all four authors are affiliated.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory at the Faculty of Science and Technology of Tangier, Abdelmalek Essaadi University, Tetouan, Morocco, with which the authors are affiliated.&lt;SEP&gt;Research laboratory with members including Abdellah Azmani and Monir Azmani.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory at FST of Tangier, Abdelmalek Essaâdi University, Tetouan, Morocco, with which the authors are affiliated.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory at FST of Tangier, Abdelmalek Essaadi University, in Tetouan, Morocco. The authors are affiliated with it.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory at the FST of Tangier, Abdelmalek Essaadi University, Tetouan, Morocco.</data>
