<node id="Feature Importance">
  <data key="d0">Feature Importance</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Interpretation technique used to explain the machine learning models' predictions for machine selection.&lt;SEP&gt;Interpretability insight provided by Random Forest. SHAP analysis shows that mold characteristics such as weight, height, length and width are the primary contributors to predictions.</data>
