</node>
<node id="Injection Molding">
  <data key="d0">Injection Molding</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Injection Molding is an industrial manufacturing process for plastics, polymers, and their composites, and it is also applied to other materials. The process melts polymer material using a press machine and tooling, then injects it into a mold cavity under high pressure, typically from hundreds to thousands of bars. The material cools and solidifies there, taking the shape of the mold to form the finished part. The machine has two main units, a clamping unit and an injection unit, which together melt the raw plastic and force it into the mold. The scope of the process includes thermoplastic injection. H. Fu et al. (2020) reviewed it as a polymer and composite processing technology.

Injection Molding is widely used because it produces high-quality, precise, and complex components at moderate cost. Its main markets include the automotive, consumer electronics, and medical device industries. One studied example is the production of connector cables for the automotive sector, and cited works also cover drug delivery applications. The molding cycle has several phases: dosing and plasticizing, injection (filling), packing, cooling, and ejection. More broadly, the overall manufacturing process includes mold design, mold making, and injection itself, stages that have traditionally been managed separately.

The process faces several technical and practical challenges. These include managing material flow, cooling rates, mold design, and product quality. Part quality and dimensional consistency depend strongly on process parameters such as the melt cushion. Quality defects and maintenance-related anomalies must be detected early to reduce scrap and downtime. Choosing the right machine for a new product is also difficult and requires extensive knowledge and experience. Injection Molding is the domain of a machine selection study and of cited work on cost-effective design.

Injection Molding is the central application domain and case study of most of the cited references, including references 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 10, and 11. These works address its technology, machines, clamping mechanisms, parameter setting, process control, defects, optimization, energy monitoring, quality prediction, simulation correction, process monitoring, and anomaly detection. Injection Molding, including plastic injection molding, is also the target of a Digital Twin framework and related digital twin studies. These studies seek to improve process stability and product quality through digital-twin-based smart manufacturing. Within this framework, the process is modeled with an LSTM (Long Short-Term Memory) neural network.&lt;SEP&gt;Manufacturing process for plastic parts whose quality defects are the focus of This Paper and several cited studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic manufacturing process in which each plastic part is treated as unique.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic manufacturing process addressed by several cited works on fault detection, defect detection, quality optimization and quality prediction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56015fdaac28ae50466d3ddc4439d39b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-007</data>
