<node id="Injection Molding Machine Selection">
  <data key="d0">Injection Molding Machine Selection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Injection Molding Machine Selection is the problem of identifying the most appropriate injection molding machine, also called an injection press, for a given product. It is widely regarded as a challenging task that demands considerable expertise and experience. The choice depends on several interrelated factors, including product or part characteristics, material properties, mold specifications and the required production rate. Because the decision directly affects company profitability and flexibility, it is considered a critical strategy for increasing productivity, improving cost-effectiveness and maintaining performance standards in production workshops.

Traditionally, Injection Molding Machine Selection has been addressed through theoretical calculations, such as clamping force determination, together with mold evaluations and practical trial runs. These conventional approaches are time-consuming, costly and highly dependent on expert knowledge. Despite the potential benefits, few studies have applied machine learning techniques to this problem.

Injection Molding Machine Selection is also framed as a multi-criteria decision problem. In this framing, the goal is to choose the optimal machine from among several technically validated alternatives, based on production performance, productivity cost and historical data. In one specific formulation, the selection is made among three alternative machines and is guided by eleven sub-criteria grouped under five main criteria: investment cost, quality rate, performance rate, availability rate and operating cost. The aim of this decision process is to achieve optimal production and maximize profitability.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-017</data>
