<node id="FST of Tangier">
  <data key="d0">FST of Tangier</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">FST of Tangier, the Faculty of Sciences and Techniques (FST) of Tangier, is an academic institution in Morocco. It belongs to Abdelmalek Essaâdi University (also written Abdelmalek Essaadi University), which is headquartered in Tetouan. The faculty is a scientific and technical teaching and research body within the university system.

The FST of Tangier hosts the Intelligent Automation and BioMedGenomics Laboratory, whose name also appears as "Intelligent Automation and BioMed Genomics Laboratory" or "Intelligent Automation and Biomed Genomics Laboratory." These variants are spelling differences for the same research unit. The laboratory is the institutional affiliation of researchers who have written scholarly work, including a paper on hybrid sales forecasting. Through this laboratory, the FST of Tangier is the academic base for the authors of that research.&lt;SEP&gt;Faculty of Sciences and Techniques of Tangier, part of Abdelmalek Essaadi University. It hosts the Intelligent Automation and BioMed Genomics Laboratory.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56015fdaac28ae50466d3ddc4439d39b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-000</data>
