<node id="Classification Metrics">
  <data key="d0">Classification Metrics</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Accuracy, F1-score, Precision and Recall, used to evaluate the SVM and Random Forest machine selection models.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard metrics including accuracy, precision, recall and F1-score used to evaluate the classification model.</data>
