  <data key="d0">Clamping Force Calculation</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Traditional engineering calculation used in injection molding machine selection to ensure proper clamping force and mold integration. It is followed by mechanical mold evaluations and trial runs.&lt;SEP&gt;Theoretical calculation that is part of the conventional, time-consuming and costly approach to injection molding machine selection.</data>
