<node id="Machine Learning Can Reduce Time and Cost of Machine Selection">
  <data key="d0">Machine Learning Can Reduce Time and Cost of Machine Selection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Primary contribution stated by the paper: applying machine learning algorithms can significantly reduce the time and cost of selecting the right injection molding machine.</data>
