<node id="Machine Learning for Industrial Manufacturing: A Case Study">
  <data key="d0">Machine Learning for Industrial Manufacturing: A Case Study</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Article by F. Tayalati et al. that applies Random Forest and SVM models to help manufacturers select the appropriate injection molding machine for a given product. It finds that Random Forest with 700 estimators, max depth 30 and bootstrapping achieves 81% accuracy, 85% precision, 81% recall and 78% F1-score.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being read, by F. Tayalati et al.; applies Random Forest and Support Vector Machine to select injection molding machines (presses) using data from an automotive workshop in Morocco, followed by correlation and SHAP analyses.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being read. It is a case study applying machine learning to industrial manufacturing. Its future perspectives include adding more models such as deep learning, expanding the dataset, and exploring more hyperparameters. It was funded through the Smart DLSP Project of the AL KHAWARIZMI IA-PROGRAM in Morocco.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">978-3-031-75329-9_31.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791420960</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="F. Tayalati">
  <data key="d0">F. Tayalati</data>
  <data key="d1">author</data>
  <data key="d2">F. Tayalati is a researcher who applies machine learning and artificial intelligence to industrial manufacturing, with a particular focus on plastic injection molding. Tayalati is affiliated with the Intelligent Automation and BioMed Genomics Laboratory at the Faculty of Sciences and Techniques (FST) of Tangier, Abdelmalek Essaadi University.

Tayalati is the first author of many cited works on AI and machine learning for plastic injection molding, sometimes cited as "F. Tayalati et al." These include "Machine Learning for Industrial Manufacturing: A Case Study," a 2022 review of the AI-based plastic injection process, and a study on supervised machine learning for injection molding. Other studies address using AI and machine learning to set injection process parameters. These works appear under different numbers in various reference lists, including references 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 8, 11, 17, and 19. Tayalati is also the first and lead author of "Hybrid Approach Integrating Deep Learning-Autoencoder With SPC Chart," which combines deep learning autoencoders with statistical process control charts.

Tayalati's research also covers decision-making methods for selecting injection molding machines. As first, lead, and corresponding author, Tayalati proposed a combined AHP-TOPSIS model (Analytic Hierarchy Process and Technique for Order of Preference by Similarity to Ideal Solution) for this purpose. The article was published in IJE Transactions B: Applications, Vol. 38, No. 02, in February 2025, and is cited as reference [45] in at least one source. This paper builds on Tayalati's earlier work on artificial intelligence and machine learning for the plastic injection molding process.

Beyond injection molding, Tayalati co-authored a paper on hybrid sales forecasting. This work shows the breadth of Tayalati's interest in data-driven methods for industrial applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Author of references [1], [2] and [5] on injection molding and AI.&lt;SEP&gt;First author of the 2022 review on AI-based plastic injection process parameter setting and monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-01