  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Multi-criteria decision method (AHP) used for machine selection.&lt;SEP&gt;AHP; a framework for structuring and analyzing complex decisions that integrates mathematical principles and psychological factors; involves subjective ranking that may introduce bias.</data>
