<node id="Machine Clamping Force">
  <data key="d0">Machine Clamping Force</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Machine clamping size measured in kN and recorded as a feature in the dataset. Fig. 4 analyzes its correlation with the other dataset features.&lt;SEP&gt;Output variable of the dataset representing machine size in KN; strongly correlated with mold width (0.98), mold weight (0.79), mold height (0.76), mold length (0.75), and part weight (0.61).&lt;SEP&gt;The target parameter for machine size. It is grouped into five classes: Class 1 (150 t), Class 2 (200 t), Class 3 (250 t), Class 4 (320 t) and Class 5 (400 t). The distribution is roughly normal and centered on 200 t and 250 t.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-005</data>
