</node>
<node id="Clamping Unit">
  <data key="d0">Clamping Unit</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Mechanical structure of the injection molding machine that maintains the mold's closure under pressure, with the mold mounted on a fixed platen and a movable platen linked to a hydraulic system.&lt;SEP&gt;Machine component holding the fixed and moved sides of the mold together under pressure during injection and cooling; consists of a mold mounted on a fixed platen and a movable platen typically connected to a hydraulic system.&lt;SEP&gt;Unit holding the fixed and moving mold halves together under pressure during injection and cooling; consists of a mold mounted on a fixed platen and a movable platen typically connected to a hydraulic system.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-002</data>
