<node id="Data Availability">
  <data key="d0">Data Availability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Primary limitation of the study, because real-world datasets are difficult to obtain.&lt;SEP&gt;A constraint on machine learning and artificial intelligence algorithms caused by limited data availability and accessibility. GANs have emerged as a promising solution to this constraint.</data>
