<node id="Ministry of Higher Education, Scientific Research and Innovation">
  <data key="d0">Ministry of Higher Education, Scientific Research and Innovation</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Ministry of Higher Education, Scientific Research and Innovation is a Moroccan government ministry that provided support for the research presented in the paper. Its backing is acknowledged as an important contribution to the work described in the article.

The ministry supported this research through the Smart DLSP Project, which is part of the AL KHAWARIZMI IA-PROGRAM. This initiative funds and promotes research in artificial intelligence and related fields in Morocco, and the study discussed in the paper was carried out within its framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Moroccan ministry supporting the research.&lt;SEP&gt;Moroccan ministry that supported the FSMicroGenerator research.&lt;SEP&gt;Moroccan ministry that supports the research.</data>
