<node id="Mold Characteristics">
  <data key="d0">Mold Characteristics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mold weight, height, length and width. SHAP identifies them as the primary contributors to Random Forest predictions, which is consistent with the importance of mold assembly and part geometry in injection molding.&lt;SEP&gt;Mold dimensions such as thickness, width, length, height, and weight. These are pivotal in assessing whether the tool can be mounted on the machine. A mold that exceeds the machine's specified dimensions may require allocation to a larger press.</data>
