<node id="10.1007/s13748-024-00318-z">
  <data key="d0">10.1007/s13748-024-00318-z</data>
  <data key="d1">identifier</data>
  <data key="d2">10.1007/s13748-024-00318-z is the Digital Object Identifier (DOI) of a 2024 research paper by Tayalati et al. The paper addresses the prediction of cooling time in injection molding using supervised machine learning techniques. This DOI serves as a persistent identifier that allows the study to be located and cited across the scholarly literature.

The DOI appears as a citation in multiple documents, where the same paper is assigned different reference numbers depending on the citing work. It has been listed as reference 1, reference [2], reference 3 (explicitly attributed to Tayalati et al., 2024), reference 5, reference [11], and reference [17], the last of which is described specifically as the supervised machine learning cooling time prediction paper. These varying reference positions do not indicate distinct entities. They reflect the citation ordering of different publications that cite the same 2024 cooling time prediction study, which suggests the work is regularly referenced in research on injection molding process optimization and machine learning applications in manufacturing.&lt;SEP&gt;DOI of reference [1].</data>
