<node id="Taguchi Experimental Design">
  <data key="d0">Taguchi Experimental Design</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Experimental design method. Reference 10 combines it with fuzzy quality evaluation to optimize injection molding.&lt;SEP&gt;Experimental design combined with AHP to select the best experiment for quality in plastic molding.&lt;SEP&gt;Experimental design methodology used in combination with AHP and fuzzy AHP for injection molding optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;Experimental design method (TED). AlKaabneh, Barghash and Mishael combine it with AHP to set plastic injection molding process parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;Experimental design method used for injection molding process optimization and EDM optimization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-016</data>
