<node id="Machine Selection">
  <data key="d0">Machine Selection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Machine Selection is an industrial decision problem in manufacturing. It involves choosing appropriate production equipment and assigning products, parts, or molds to the most suitable machine. The problem is consistently framed as a multi-criteria decision-making (MCDM) problem, in which machine alternatives are evaluated, ranked, and compared to identify the best one. In the literature, Machine Selection is addressed by references 5, 8 and 9.

A prominent application of Machine Selection is in plastics processing. There, it concerns selecting and allocating the most suitable injection molding machine or press, including electric molding machines, for a given part or mold. In this setting, the task involves assigning plastic molding parts and their molds to injection molding machines of an appropriate size, expressed as clamping force classes. The selection considers a range of parameters related to the machine, the material, the mold and the part. Beyond classical multi-criteria analysis, Machine Selection for molds and parts has also been addressed with machine learning approaches.

As a multi-criteria decision problem, Machine Selection relies on weighted criteria and sub-criteria to rank alternatives and find the optimal choice. Key evaluation criteria include:
- investment cost
- quality rate
- performance rate
- availability rate
- operating cost

Other descriptions emphasize quality, reliability and costs more broadly, as well as performance, cost-effectiveness and compatibility with production requirements. A specific instance of the problem involves choosing among three machine alternatives, ARB250T, ARB200T and HAIT320T, based on these multiple criteria.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-013</data>
