<node id="Fuzzy-Bayesian Approach">
  <data key="d0">Fuzzy-Bayesian Approach</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">The Fuzzy-Bayesian Approach (FB approach) is a hybrid predictive method that combines Bayesian networks with fuzzy logic. Bayesian networks contribute probabilistic reasoning, and fuzzy logic contributes the handling of imprecise and uncertain information. Together, these let the approach anticipate and assess risks in complex, uncertain environments.

In the work that proposes it, the Fuzzy-Bayesian Approach is used to model and predict risks that affect Quality of Service (QoS) in Vehicular Ad Hoc Networks (VANETs), and a QoS model is implemented within it. The approach is also applied to anticipate accident risks in vehicular contexts. It has been used to model delivery delay risk as well. The literature cites prior studies that used it for predictive analysis of delivery delay risk, identified as reference [8] in one source and reference [39] in another. These citations may point to the same study numbered differently across documents, or to separate works.

Methodologically, the Fuzzy-Bayesian Approach follows a five-stage process for building the conditional probability tables of the Bayesian network:

1. Data collection and variable definition
2. Construction of fuzzy rule sets
3. Fuzzy conversion
4. Development of the inference mechanism
5. Subsequent steps that complete the modeling

This structured process allows expert knowledge and imprecise data to be turned into probabilistic relationships for risk prediction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">10.2478_acss-2022-0011.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
