<node id="Vehicular Ad-hoc Network">
  <data key="d0">Vehicular Ad-hoc Network</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">VANET; a subclass of MANET enabling V2V, V2I and I2I communication, considered one of the most important ITS developments, but vulnerable to problems affecting service availability.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">10.2478_acss-2022-0011.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791421303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
