<node id="Vehicle-to-Vehicle Communication">
  <data key="d0">Vehicle-to-Vehicle Communication</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">V2V; a communication mode that VANET aims to support between vehicles, increasing route awareness and enabling real-time traffic event acquisition.&lt;SEP&gt;Communication between vehicles, for which VANET is regarded as the main platform.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-006</data>
