<node id="Ref [7]">
  <data key="d0">Ref [7]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">"Ref [7]" is a citation label that appears across several unrelated source documents. The descriptions do not refer to a single work. They describe multiple distinct cited references that share the same bracketed number in their respective documents, so each is summarized separately below.

In the context of vehicular networking, Ref [7] is a cited work about the difficulty of designing routing protocols for Vehicular Ad Hoc Networks (VANETs) that keep routes stable. It also examines how selfish nodes, which do not cooperate in forwarding traffic, degrade overall network performance.

In the context of mobile ad hoc networking, Ref [7] is a cited work that provides classifications of attacks in Mobile Ad Hoc Networks (MANETs). It is referenced as a source for organizing and categorizing the security threats these networks face. This reference may be related to the VANET work above, since both concern ad hoc network reliability and node misbehavior, but the descriptions do not confirm that they are the same publication.

In a mechanical or vehicle-dynamics context, Ref [7] is cited for the observation that uneven road surfaces amplify seat wobbles during acceleration.

In a business and marketing context, Ref [7] is a cited work stating that the cost of acquiring new customers exceeds the cost of retaining existing ones. It is used to stress the importance of customer loyalty.

In a machine learning context, Ref [7] is cited on feature selection. It describes how removing irrelevant and redundant features helps prevent overfitting and improves model accuracy.

In a decision-analysis context, Ref [7] is a cited work describing the TOPSIS (Technique for Order of Preference by Similarity to Ideal Solution) method. It explains how TOPSIS ranks alternatives using an overall index derived from their distances to the ideal and anti-ideal solutions.

In a software engineering context, Ref [7] is a reference on Model-Driven Engineering (MDE). It covers model-to-text transformations and Template-Based Code Generation (TBCG), presenting TBCG as a bridge between modeling and programming.&lt;SEP&gt;Work cited as [7] for chatbots being promising tools to address challenges in understanding legal documentation and drafting contracts.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited study proposing an economical accident prevention embedded system based on an obstacle detection IR sensor, with lane detection and controlling.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [7]; a work describing Hyperledger Fabric's permissioned architecture, modular components, private data exchange and fine-grained identity management.&lt;SEP&gt;Related work on choosing the best routing protocol, using the metrics throughput, delivery ratio and energy consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;A cited comparative study of existing VANET routing protocols and algorithms. It aims to select an efficient protocol that improves QoS parameters such as delay, jitter, throughput and packet loss ratio across network scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c6cf0e7751b1667f02411ba9fa2e2995-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26549e3ff493405b55b221c1d804516e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">10.2478_acss-2022-0011.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;7561-ArticleText-31951-37131-10-20251228.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;25293-55764-1-PB.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;CIST_174.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;document.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Microservices-Driven_Automation_in_Full-Stack_Deve.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;poster_nihad.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
