<node id="Confidentiality">
  <data key="d0">Confidentiality</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A security requirement that keeps the content of safety and non-safety messages inaccessible to non-authenticated users.&lt;SEP&gt;Security input parameter of the causal graph. It is the mechanism that ensures only authorized users can access the data.&lt;SEP&gt;Security goal satisfied by the proposed authentication method.&lt;SEP&gt;Security requirement satisfied by encrypting all node requests with admin public keys to keep identification credentials private.&lt;SEP&gt;A fundamental MANET security concept. Passive attacks compromise it, and [19] combines it with authentication.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-001</data>
