</node>
<node id="Data Integrity">
  <data key="d0">Data Integrity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A VANET security service that ensures data precision and accuracy during transmission.&lt;SEP&gt;A fundamental MANET security concept. Under the integrity service, only authorized nodes can originate, edit or delete packets. Blockchain ensures it by signing transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Assurance that vehicle data remains accurate and unaltered, ensured by the proposed blockchain architecture.</data>
