<node id="Big Data">
  <data key="d0">Big Data</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A complementary technology that helps process the massive data generated by VANET.&lt;SEP&gt;Technology incorporated, together with AI, into the HRM theme for decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;Incorporated with AI into HRM's evolution for decision-making, customer satisfaction, and employee performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Technological advancement (BD) that drives P4 medicine alongside AI and IoT.&lt;SEP&gt;Increased availability of data that, together with computing power advances, contributed to the recovery of AI research.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">10.2478_acss-2022-0011.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;acs_25_66701.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Paper.pdf</data>
