  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ref [29]">
  <data key="d0">Ref [29]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited work improving VANET performance by removing useless or unused packets to avoid packet queues and decreased service rate.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [29] regarding RAG response quality and as a source for the DPR document retriever.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited work describing Retrieval-Augmented Generation, cross-attention integration, and its success on knowledge-intensive NLP tasks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
