  <data key="d2">Cited work defining a Bayesian Network as a pair (G, O), where G is a directed acyclic graph encoding a joint probability distribution over categorical variables.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [31] regarding establishing document-tuple associations via human annotations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
