<node id="Ref [48]">
  <data key="d0">Ref [48]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited work [48] on implementing Fuzzy Logic for generating conditional probabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Work cited as [48] describing LIME as a Post-Hoc and Model-Agnostic method that offers localized explanations for specific predictions.&lt;SEP&gt;Work cited as [48] for computing outcome probabilities by multiplying branch probabilities in an event tree.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [48] for the limitation of conventional Autoencoders in capturing temporal patterns of time series data.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited work [48]. It concerns driver behavior as a major source of traffic accidents.&lt;SEP&gt;Article stating that driver behavior while driving is a major source of traffic accidents.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-004</data>
