<node id="Device Resources">
  <data key="d0">Device Resources</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Data processing input parameter of the causal graph. These are vehicle resources and components that allow the vehicle to act as a mobile provider of sensing, storage, relaying, computing, infotainment and localization services.</data>
