</node>
<node id="Data Processing">
  <data key="d0">Data Processing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Intermediate effect in the causal graph. It is the process of collecting data and converting it into usable information interpreted by computers using AI algorithms, and it represents the quality of data processing in the VANET.&lt;SEP&gt;Bayesian network variable for the performance of data processing in the edge box, with linguistic values bad, medium, and good.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-005</data>
