  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bayesian Network node with states good, medium, bad; a parent of QoS in VANET and example variable for the Gaussian membership function.&lt;SEP&gt;Antecedent variable of QoS in VANET with states bad, medium and good.&lt;SEP&gt;Major MANET issue; problems with routing protocols are among the characteristics that expose MANETs to attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;MANET routing problem addressed by Ghasemnezhad and Ghaffari with FRRP.&lt;SEP&gt;An aspect of QoS in VANET that several related works address, for example by choosing, evaluating or optimizing routing protocols and routes.&lt;SEP&gt;Bayesian network variable with linguistic values bad, medium, and good.</data>
