  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Aggregation operator used to combine the triggered conclusions of the activated fuzzy rules.&lt;SEP&gt;Aggregation operator used to combine the conclusions of activated fuzzy rules into a single value through the union of all triggered conclusions.&lt;SEP&gt;Operator used to aggregate activation degrees of active rules concluding the same output label.&lt;SEP&gt;Operator used to aggregate the conclusions of the activated fuzzy rules into a single value through their union.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-005</data>
