<node id="Fuzzy Bayesian Model">
  <data key="d0">Fuzzy Bayesian Model</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">FB model proposed by the article combining a Bayesian Network that evaluates causal relations between nodes with Fuzzy Logic used to generate all conditional probabilities; it predicts QoS in VANET as a function of multiple criteria.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">10.2478_acss-2022-0011.pdf</data>
