<node id="Multi-Criteria QoS Prediction Model">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Criteria QoS Prediction Model</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Approach proposed by the paper that predicts QoS in VANET from multiple criteria by integrating all of the factors that influence QoS. The absence of some variables can affect the efficacy of its prediction.</data>
