  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Understanding Network Congestion Effects on Performance - Articles Review">
  <data key="d0">Understanding Network Congestion Effects on Performance - Articles Review</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [44]. Written by N. Mohamed, S. Sahib, N. Suryana and B. Hussin and published in the Journal of Theoretical and Applied Information Technology in 2016. The paper reviews the effects of network congestion on performance.</data>
