  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [45]. Written by R. Chen, Z. Sheng, Z. Zhong, M. Ni, D. G. Michelson and V. C. Leung and presented at IWCMC 2015 in Dubrovnik, Croatia. The paper analyzes VANET connectivity performance under user behavior.</data>
