  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [46]. Written by R. K. Aswed and M. A. Abdala and published in the International Journal of Enhanced Research in Science, Technology &amp; Engineering in November 2014. The paper addresses end-to-end delay in VANET using AODV.</data>
