  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [47]. Written by S. Renooij and published in The Knowledge Engineering Review in 2001. The paper discusses probability elicitation for belief networks.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [71]. Written by Renooij S. Published in The Knowledge Engineering Review, 2001, 16(3):255-269. It discusses issues in probability elicitation for belief networks.</data>
