</node>
<node id="Smart Wound Hydration Monitoring Using Biosensors and Fuzzy Inference System">
  <data key="d0">Smart Wound Hydration Monitoring Using Biosensors and Fuzzy Inference System</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [48]. Written by H. Sattar, I. S. Bajwa et al. and published in Wireless Communications and Mobile Computing in 2019. The paper presents wound hydration monitoring using biosensors and a fuzzy inference system.&lt;SEP&gt;Paper by Sattar, Bajwa, ul Amin, Muhammad, Mushtaq, Kazmi, Akram, Ashraf and Shafi (2019) in Wireless Communications and Mobile Computing, 2019, 1–15. It monitors wound hydration using biosensors and a fuzzy inference system.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [90]. Sattar H, Bajwa IS, ul Amin R et al., Wireless Communications and Mobile Computing 2019, pp. 1-15. The paper monitors wound hydration using biosensors and a fuzzy inference system.&lt;SEP&gt;Reference 19. By H. Sattar, I.S. Bajwa, R. ul Amin and others, published in Wireless Communications and Mobile Computing in 2019, article 8059629.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">10.2478_acss-2022-0011.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;4597JPB.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501552</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hybrid Solution Combining Kalman Filtering with Takagi-Sugeno Fuzzy Inference System for Online Car-Following Model Calibration">
