<node id="International Journal of Advanced Computer Science and Applications">
  <data key="d0">International Journal of Advanced Computer Science and Applications</data>
  <data key="d1">venue</data>
  <data key="d2">The International Journal of Advanced Computer Science and Applications (IJACSA), also abbreviated as Int. J. Adv. Comput. Sci. Appl., is a scholarly journal covering computer science and its applications. It is accessible online at www.ijacsa.thesai.org.

The descriptions identify IJACSA as the venue for articles in two different issues. Most describe it as publishing an article in Volume 15, Issue No. 7, 2024, and specifically name a fuzzy-Bayesian study on vehicle accident risk as appearing there. One description instead places the article under discussion in Volume 16, Issue No. 2, 2025. This difference most likely reflects two separate articles from different source documents, both published in the same journal, rather than an error about a single paper.

IJACSA is also cited repeatedly in reference lists as the publisher of several earlier works, including those listed as references [45] and [56]. These works include:
- "Classification Model Evaluation Metrics" (2021).
- "Using a Fuzzy-Bayesian Approach for Predictive Analysis of Delivery Delay Risk" by Bouhadi et al. (2022).
- A 2022 paper applying the AHP-TOPSIS method to the social economy.
- Further fuzzy-Bayesian research by Benallou et al. (2023).

Taken together, these publications show the journal's sustained coverage of applied computational methods. These include fuzzy logic and Bayesian modeling for risk prediction, multi-criteria decision-making techniques such as AHP-TOPSIS, and the evaluation of machine learning classification models. The journal has served as a recurring outlet for a connected line of fuzzy-Bayesian risk analysis research, ranging from delivery delay risk to vehicle accident risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal, abbreviated Int. J. Adv. Comput. Sci. Appl., where reference [39] was published in 2022.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal that published Yadav et al. (2024).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-014</data>
