<node id="Bayesian Networks">
  <data key="d0">Bayesian Networks</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Bayesian Networks are probabilistic graphical models that combine probability theory and graph theory. They are built on dependence relations between variables, represented as nodes. These nodes may be input, intermediate or output variables. Bayesian Networks support decision-making under uncertainty and are regarded as a machine learning-based probabilistic tool for exploring interrelations between variables. They are powerful, but their effectiveness is limited by sample and data size.

In the context of occupational health research, Bayesian Networks are integrated with fuzzy logic in a proposed hybrid methodology for assessing burnout risk. Within this fuzzy Bayesian approach, the probabilistic graphical modelling technique is used together with fuzzy logic to explore the contributing factors of burnout. This pairing allows uncertain and imprecise information to be handled within a structured probabilistic framework.

More broadly, Bayesian Networks appear as a theme intertwined with deep learning in risk management. There they are used alongside artificial intelligence (AI) approaches to address occupational risks and support accident prevention.&lt;SEP&gt;Supervised learning method identified as a current trend in AI oncology research.&lt;SEP&gt;Supervised learning method identified as a current trending topic in AI cancer research.&lt;SEP&gt;Probabilistic graphical models, abbreviated BNs, used to model intricate causal dependencies among system parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;Probabilistic modeling approach that This Paper suggests integrating for root cause analysis of detected anomalies.&lt;SEP&gt;Probabilistic causal graph approach used to identify factors influencing QoS in a VANET.&lt;SEP&gt;Classical probabilistic approach used to learn and sample joint distributions for synthetic data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-001</data>
