<node id="Employee Burnout">
  <data key="d0">Employee Burnout</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Increasingly prevalent workplace phenomenon threatening employee well-being and organizational success; influenced by workload, work environment, psychology, communication and obstacles.&lt;SEP&gt;Phenomenon of burnout among employees, modeled in the paper through Bayesian networks and fuzzy logic.</data>
