  <data key="d0">Communication</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Workplace factor whose weakness, combined with other factors, affects burnout levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Workplace factor influencing burnout levels in the modelled scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Flow of information and directives from management down to employees through formal channels. It also covers the quality of connections among employees and their freedom to express opinions.&lt;SEP&gt;An input variable with linguistic values Weak, Medium and High.</data>
