<node id="Bibliometric Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Bibliometric Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Bibliometric Analysis (BA) is a well-established, systematic, data-driven method for the quantitative and statistical analysis of scientific literature. It applies mathematical and statistical techniques to large volumes of bibliographic data to find patterns, trends, and connections in published research. Discussions of the method date back to the 1950s. It combines descriptive statistics with the scientific mapping of bibliographic data and draws on both quantitative and qualitative analysis.

Bibliometric Analysis examines:
- publications, citations, and impact
- geographic distribution
- productivity and research quality
- research hotspots and community sentiment

Researchers use it to summarize large bodies of scientific data, explore how a field evolves, define its intellectual structure, identify emerging trends, and trace the growth, development, and impact of a body of literature. The process typically begins with selecting a database and applying filtering criteria. The term also often appears among the keywords of studies that use it, so it is both a research topic and the analytical approach behind those studies.

Its techniques are generally grouped into performance analysis, science mapping, and network analysis. Core methods include:
- citation analysis
- co-authorship and collaboration network analysis
- keyword co-occurrence mapping and word frequency analysis
- network visualization

Further components cover publication metrics such as annual scientific output, author productivity, and institutional affiliations. They also include assessing scientific production by sources, affiliations, countries, and authors, with total citation count used as a measure of impact. Social structure assessment and thematic evolution analysis are additional components. Donthu et al. (2021) provide methodological guidelines for conducting Bibliometric Analysis, and Torres-Salazar et al. (2024) used it as a statistical analysis of the scientific literature.

Bibliometric Analysis has been applied in many research contexts:
- **Burnout research:** it traced the growth of burnout-related articles in Scopus from 1979 to 2023.
- **Feature selection research:** it examined research trends and the development and impact of feature selection techniques across 2,079 documents published between 2014 and 2024.
- **AI in oncology:** it studied AI for cancer detection and AI applications in oncology from 1992 to 2022, analyzing publication productivity, trends, and co-authorship networks through bibliometric and network visualization approaches.
- **AI in market analysis:** it examined how research on AI in market analysis has evolved and what impact it has had, covering scientific production and collaboration networks.
- **AI in human resource management (HRM):** it mapped the intellectual structure of research on AI in HRM, and more broadly the intersection of HRM and new technologies, through analyses of scientific production, citations, collaboration maps, word frequency, and thematic evolution.
- **Other areas:** applications include social impact research, as in "Mapping Social Impact: A Bibliometric Analysis," and cited works on HR training, social innovation, and AI and society.&lt;SEP&gt;Analysis method focusing on the quantitative evolution of a research field.&lt;SEP&gt;A form of literature analysis for which bibliographic databases are commonly used to collect historical papers.&lt;SEP&gt;Quantitative analysis of literature using databases such as Web of Science and Scopus, discussed in references [22]-[24].&lt;SEP&gt;Literature analysis method applied using merged data sources in reference [1].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8153b8d12e35b15bf93bd763cdd0b2f2-chunk-000</data>
