<node id="Biblioshiny">
  <data key="d0">Biblioshiny</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Biblioshiny is an R-based bibliometric analysis platform that serves as the web-based graphical user interface of the bibliometrix R package (cited as [28]). Some descriptions refer to Biblioshiny itself as an R package. These accounts are consistent: Biblioshiny is the interactive, browser-accessible front end of the bibliometrix package, which lets researchers run bibliographic analyses without writing code directly. Users can upload data files to it, such as Excel files, to carry out their analyses.

Biblioshiny is used in research to analyze bibliographic datasets and to generate tables and figures for publication. In one study, it was used to analyze 132 articles exported from the Scopus database. Its outputs cover a range of bibliometric techniques. These include tree maps, such as one visualizing research on employees' burnout, factorial analyses for mapping conceptual structures, and distributions based on Lotka's law to assess author productivity.

The tool is widely adopted across disciplines. It has been used in several oncology bibliometric studies, as well as in the work of Karger &amp; Kureljusic (2023), which reflects its established role as a standard instrument for bibliographic and scientometric research.&lt;SEP&gt;A web-based R library that provides a user-friendly interface for bibliometric analysis using the bibliometrix package. It is used for systematic reviews and meta-analyses.&lt;SEP&gt;Bibliometric analysis tool used to generate the author productivity plot and to build clusters of documents, authors and sources.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-005</data>
