<node id="Obstacles reduce engagement in healthy lifestyles">
  <data key="d0">Obstacles reduce engagement in healthy lifestyles</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "When it is very high, it could create a lack of engagement in adopting healthy lifestyles (Lopes et al., 2023; Mazzola et al., 2017)"</data>
