  <data key="d2">Alternative membership function to which the Gaussian function is compared.&lt;SEP&gt;Membership function alternative that the paper considers less smooth and more prone to approximation error than Gaussian membership functions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-003</data>
