  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Quality of organizational communication that moderates the relationship between communication overload and burnout; weak communication is associated with higher burnout.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">4597JPB.pdf</data>
