<node id="Employee Productivity">
  <data key="d0">Employee Productivity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Outcome expected to increase when organizations create supportive and healthy work environments that reduce burnout.&lt;SEP&gt;Productivity of employees, which AI can improve through enhanced feedback quality, though AI disclosure poses challenges; also enhanced by temporal and geographic flexibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Outcome that AI and robotics affect. AI performance feedback can enhance productivity, but disclosing that the feedback comes from AI may reduce it.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">4597JPB.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ministry of Higher Education, Scientific Research, and Innovation">
  <data key="d0">Ministry of Higher Education, Scientific Research, and Innovation</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Ministry of Higher Education, Scientific Research, and Innovation is a Moroccan government ministry that funded and supported the research described in the associated work. Its support was provided mainly through the Smart DLSP Project, which is part of the AL KHAWARIZMI AI-PROGRAM (also written as the Al Khawarizmi IA-Program). The ministry supported the burnout research in particular, as well as the broader project and the study presented in the paper.

The descriptions differ in how they characterize the extent of the ministry's role. Some say it supported the research or project directly. Others say it partly supported the work or provided additional support. Taken together, they suggest the ministry was a key institutional sponsor, likely alongside other funding sources, rather than the sole financier. Through this backing, the ministry helped advance Moroccan scientific research and innovation in artificial intelligence and related fields.&lt;SEP&gt;Moroccan ministry that partly supported the work.&lt;SEP&gt;Moroccan ministry that supported the review's research under the Smart DLSP Project - AL KHAWARIZMI IA-PROGRAM.&lt;SEP&gt;Moroccan ministry that provides support for the research.&lt;SEP&gt;Moroccan ministry that supported the research.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26549e3ff493405b55b221c1d804516e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-038</data>
