<node id="Symbiotic Combination of a Bayesian Network and Fuzzy Logic to Quantify the QoS in a VANET: Application in Logistic 4.0">
  <data key="d0">Symbiotic Combination of a Bayesian Network and Fuzzy Logic to Quantify the QoS in a VANET: Application in Logistic 4.0</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Khalfaoui, Azmani, Farchane and Safi (2023), Computers 12(2), 40. Combines a Bayesian network with fuzzy logic to quantify quality of service in a VANET for Logistics 4.0.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being read, published in Computers 2023, 12, 40 (MDPI) on 14 February 2023. It proposes a model combining a Bayesian network and fuzzy logic to calculate QoS in a VANET as a function of multiple criteria, provides a database for determining the risk of QoS degradation, and uses the outcome in an event tree analysis to assess security mechanisms. It is part of the Smart DLSP project.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">4597JPB.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Computers">
  <data key="d0">Computers</data>
  <data key="d1">venue</data>
  <data key="d2">Computers is an academic journal published by MDPI. It is the venue in which the primary article under discussion, referred to as "This Paper," was published. Its citation is Computers 2023, volume 12, issue 2, article 40. That article concerns quality of service (QoS) in vehicular ad hoc networks (VANETs) and combines Bayesian networks with fuzzy logic. It is also cited as reference [28] in related literature.

Beyond this 2023 article, Computers has published several other works cited in the same body of research. In 2016 it published the work cited as reference 29. In 2020 it published reference [18] and the GeoQoE-Vanet paper, which addresses quality of experience in vehicular networks. In 2023 it also published "Convolutional Neural Networks: A Survey." More recently, in 2025, it published a paper by Khan et al.

Taken together, these publications show that Computers is a recurring outlet for research on vehicular networking, QoS and QoE assessment, intelligent decision-making methods, and machine learning topics such as convolutional neural networks.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal that published Algar-Fernandez et al.'s 2026 benchmarking paper.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal where the benchmarking study of post-quantum signatures and KEMs was published in 2026.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-040</data>
