<node id="Internet of Things">
  <data key="d0">Internet of Things</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The name "Internet of Things" refers to two distinct entities: a scholarly journal and a technological domain.

**Internet of Things (journal):** Internet of Things is an academic journal that publishes research on IoT-related topics. In 2023 it published a tutorial on Bayesian network data mining for agricultural IoT, appearing in volume 22 as article 100738. It also published the work cited as reference [21] in 2024.

**Internet of Things (technology domain):** The Internet of Things (IoT) is a technological paradigm of interconnected devices and connected objects. It drives P4 medicine (predictive, preventive, personalized, and participatory) alongside artificial intelligence and big data. The fusion of IoT technologies with advanced digital concepts gave rise to the Smart Industry paradigm. A key challenge in this area is integrating digital twins with diverse IoT infrastructure.

IoT is also a significant application domain for blockchain technology. Reference [9] describes a decentralized blockchain-based authentication system designed for IoT environments. In addition, IoT is a real-world application domain that relies on ad hoc communication. In logistics settings, connected IoT objects deployed in warehouses generate data that is managed by edge boxes, showing the role of edge computing in IoT data handling.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccc87fb659a572e9c9db17272d2f6955-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">4597JPB.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;acs_25_66701.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Configuration_Driven_Performance_Analysis_of_Hyper.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Paper (1).pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501560</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
