<node id="Springer International Publishing">
  <data key="d0">Springer International Publishing</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Springer International Publishing is an academic publisher based in Cham, Switzerland. It publishes scholarly books, edited volumes, and conference proceedings, mainly in computer science, information systems, and data analysis. Its output includes major series such as Lecture Notes in Computer Science and Communications in Computer and Information Science.

Its book publications include the 2016 book *Unsupervised Learning Algorithms*. In 2022 it published the edited volume *Smart Applications and Data Analysis* (Vol. 1677), which contains the proceedings of the International Conference on Smart Applications and Data Analysis. That same year it also published a Communications in Computer and Information Science volume containing a cited work (reference [5]). This may be the same 2022 volume, given the overlap in year and series context, but the descriptions do not confirm it.

Springer International Publishing has also published proceedings from several other conferences:
- The ICCSA 2014 proceedings, as Lecture Notes in Computer Science vol. 8582, which contain a cited work (reference [28]).
- The Embedded Computer Systems: Architectures, Modeling, and Simulation proceedings in 2019.
- The BDCC 2018 proceedings, which appeared in 2020.
- The 2020 International Conference on Advanced Information Systems Engineering proceedings.

Together, these publications span 2014 to 2022 and show Springer International Publishing's role as a frequent publisher of computing and data science research.&lt;SEP&gt;Publisher of the Declarative Programming and Knowledge Management volume (Vol. 12057) that contains Krings et al. (2020).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c6cf0e7751b1667f02411ba9fa2e2995-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-013</data>
