<node id="International Journal of Professional Business Review">
  <data key="d0">International Journal of Professional Business Review</data>
  <data key="d1">venue</data>
  <data key="d2">The International Journal of Professional Business Review is an academic journal based in Miami. It publishes research on business and professional topics, including studies of workplace and organizational phenomena such as burnout.

In 2024, the International Journal of Professional Business Review published a burnout article written by Bouhsaien and Azmani. The article appeared in volume 9, issue 4, with the article identifier e04597, and occupies pages 01–21. All available accounts consistently link the journal to this burnout publication. This makes the journal the publication venue for that research contribution.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal that published Bouhsaien and Azmani's 2024 article on burnout.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal that published Boukrouh and Azmani (2024) on AI applications in e-commerce.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal that published reference 4 in 2024.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-013</data>
