  <data key="d0">Obukhov et al. [18]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [18]; proposes a model monitoring musculoskeletal rehabilitation exercises by classifying user movements; multilayered neural networks, KNN and Random Forest gave good results.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c6cf0e7751b1667f02411ba9fa2e2995-chunk-001</data>
