  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [19]; proposes a machine learning classifier for monitoring driving positions considered a leading cause of MSDs in sedentary workers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c6cf0e7751b1667f02411ba9fa2e2995-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">7561-ArticleText-31951-37131-10-20251228.pdf</data>
