  <data key="d0">Aliabadi et al. [20]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [20]; uses linear regression and Random Forest to investigate musculoskeletal discomfort in mining truck drivers, finding Random Forest more accurate and highlighting posture, vibration and age.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c6cf0e7751b1667f02411ba9fa2e2995-chunk-001</data>
