  <data key="d0">Hanumegowda and Gnanasekaran [26]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [26]; develops decision tree, random forest and naïve Bayes models to predict work-related MSDs in bus drivers using MNMQ-based questionnaire data and direct observations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c6cf0e7751b1667f02411ba9fa2e2995-chunk-001</data>
