<node id="Raza et al. [27]">
  <data key="d0">Raza et al. [27]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [27]. Study investigating the prevalence of musculoskeletal disorders in truck drivers and office workers using decision tree, random forest and naïve Bayes; found truck drivers more vulnerable to MSDs and emphasized ergonomic workplace conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [27]; investigates MSD prevalence in truck drivers and office workers using decision tree, random forest and naïve Bayes, finding truck drivers more vulnerable.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c6cf0e7751b1667f02411ba9fa2e2995-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c6cf0e7751b1667f02411ba9fa2e2995-chunk-002</data>
