<node id="Naïve Bayes">
  <data key="d0">Naïve Bayes</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Machine learning algorithm used by Raza et al. to study MSD prevalence.&lt;SEP&gt;Probabilistic classifier used to predict MSDs in bus and truck drivers.&lt;SEP&gt;Probabilistic classifier combined with evolutionary computation for telecom customer churn prediction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c6cf0e7751b1667f02411ba9fa2e2995-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c6cf0e7751b1667f02411ba9fa2e2995-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-010</data>
