<node id="Deep neural networks outperform non-radiologists in wrist fracture diagnosis">
  <data key="d0">Deep neural networks outperform non-radiologists in wrist fracture diagnosis</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "The results showed that the performance of the proposed model in diagnosing wrist fractures in radiology is significantly higher than that of non-radiologists."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c6cf0e7751b1667f02411ba9fa2e2995-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">7561-ArticleText-31951-37131-10-20251228.pdf</data>
