<node id="Professional Drivers Dataset">
  <data key="d0">Professional Drivers Dataset</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">Data collected through interviews with 277 professional drivers (taxis, trucks, buses, service vehicles), covering demographic, physiological and occupational variables such as age, BMI, driving experience, weekly driving time, heavy lifting, physical activity, vehicle ergonomics and road conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Generated dataset of professional drivers with variables Age, BMI, WHW, EXP, FLHO, WEH, ST, STR, ARM, TRP and RD; originally 277 observations, later simplified and expanded to 1,385 rows.&lt;SEP&gt;Dataset of professional drivers with features such as workload, heavy lifting frequency, weekly physical activity and working conditions score; cluster group labels are assigned to each driver (Table 9).&lt;SEP&gt;Final dataset (Table 9) of professional drivers with variables Age, BMI, WHW, EXP, FLHO, WEH, WCS and an assigned cluster label (Low, Medium, High risk).</data>
