<node id="Abdelmalek Essaâdi University">
  <data key="d0">Abdelmalek Essaâdi University</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Abdelmalek Essaâdi University is a Moroccan university headquartered in Tetouan, Morocco. Most descriptions place the university in Tetouan. One source describes it as located in Tangier, which likely reflects the location of one of its constituent faculties rather than the university's main seat. The university has a presence across the Tetouan–Tangier region through its affiliated institutions.

One of the university's principal components is the Faculty of Sciences and Technologies of Tangier, commonly abbreviated as FST of Tangier. This faculty also appears under the variant names "Faculty of Sciences and Technology in Tangier" and "Faculty of Sciences and Techniques of Tangier." It belongs to Abdelmalek Essaâdi University and serves as an academic and degree-granting body. For example, it awarded Mohammed Said Boukhryss his Master's degree.

Through the FST of Tangier, the university hosts the Intelligent Automation and BioMedGenomics unit, also written as Intelligent Automation and BioMed Genomics and abbreviated as IABL. Some sources describe this unit as a Department and others as a Laboratory. The designation as a laboratory, reflected in the acronym IABL, appears most frequently. This unit is cited as the institutional affiliation of the authors of associated research work. Through it, Abdelmalek Essaâdi University is connected to research activity in intelligent automation and biomedical genomics.&lt;SEP&gt;Moroccan university in Tetouan that hosts the Intelligent Automation and Biomed Genomics Laboratory at the FST of Tangier.&lt;SEP&gt;University whose Faculty of Sciences and Technologies of Tangier granted degrees to Ikhlass Boukrouh (2021) and Loubna Bouhsaien (2022).&lt;SEP&gt;Moroccan university to which the Faculty of Sciences and Technologies of Tangier belongs.&lt;SEP&gt;University in Tetouan, Morocco, hosting the Faculty of Science and Technology of Tangier.&lt;SEP&gt;University in Tetouan, Morocco, hosting the Faculty of Sciences and Technologies of Tangier.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-44e660d542a189a6d2b6161acf6e6b98-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ef486f441df72175f968e398ffdd23d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-000</data>
