<node id="Customer Loyalty">
  <data key="d0">Customer Loyalty</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Plays an important role in the economic success of companies and provides a continuous generation of revenue.&lt;SEP&gt;The degree to which customers keep buying from a business. Reducing churn through targeted interventions is expected to increase it, and it is the topic of reference [2].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-008</data>
