<node id="Explainable Artificial Intelligence">
  <data key="d0">Explainable Artificial Intelligence</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Explainable Artificial Intelligence (XAI), also referred to as Explainable AI or interpretable machine learning, is a research field and set of techniques dedicated to making artificial intelligence systems understandable to humans. It focuses on interpreting complex models and explaining both AI models and the predictions they generate, with particular emphasis on understanding how models arrive at their predictions and which features most strongly influence those outcomes. The core goals of XAI include trustworthiness, causality, transferability, confidence, fairness, accessibility, and interactivity.

As a field of study, XAI has grown rapidly in recent years. It first appeared in the Scopus database in 2018, and research activity peaked in 2023 with 510 published studies. The topic has been surveyed, defined, and applied across numerous cited works, including references [32] and [33], and it is also directly addressed by the article in which it is discussed.

In practice, XAI encompasses a range of methods used to elucidate machine learning models, notably SHAP (SHapley Additive exPlanations) and LIME (Local Interpretable Model-agnostic Explanations). Within the referenced paper, these XAI techniques are applied to customer churn prediction models in the e-commerce domain, where they serve to identify the dominant features driving churn predictions. This application is notable because the use of XAI for churn modeling in e-commerce has so far been explored only to a limited extent, highlighting a gap that the paper seeks to address.&lt;SEP&gt;Keyword of the injection molding machine selection study.&lt;SEP&gt;XAI; the field of techniques for explaining ML model predictions, of which LIME is a prominent technique.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">25293-55764-1-PB.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425013</data>
