<node id="Faculty of Sciences and Technologies of Tangier">
  <data key="d0">Faculty of Sciences and Technologies of Tangier</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Faculty of Sciences and Technologies of Tangier, also known as FST Tangier, is a faculty of Abdelmalek Essaâdi University (sometimes written Abdelmalek Essaadi University) in Tangier, Morocco. Most sources give its address as Km. 10, Old Airport Road, Tangier. One description instead places the Old Airport Road, Km. 10 address in Tetouan. This is likely an error or reflects the university's wider presence in the Tangier-Tetouan region, since the faculty's name and most descriptions identify Tangier as its location.

The faculty hosts the Laboratory of Intelligent Automation and BioMedGenomics, also called the Intelligent Automation and BioMedGenomics Laboratory (IABL). It also has a Computer Science Department.

Several researchers are connected to the faculty. Abdellah Azmani is a professor in its computer science department, and Monir Azmani is also a professor there. Ikhlass Boukrouh and Loubna Bouhsaien are both graduates of the faculty.&lt;SEP&gt;Faculty of Abdelmalek Essaâdi University that hosts the Intelligent Automation and BioMedGenomics Laboratory (IABL).&lt;SEP&gt;Faculty of Abdelmalek Essaadi University in Tangier, Morocco. Lechhab Ouadrassi and Boukhryss earned M.S. degrees there, and Azmani is a professor there.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-041</data>
