<node id="Supervised Learning">
  <data key="d0">Supervised Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Supervised Learning is a machine learning paradigm in which a model is trained on a dataset with known target classifications. Models fall into this category when the data contains a target variable. It is a broad family of techniques, including Decision Tree (DT), Random Forest (RF), Naive Bayes (NB), Logistic Regression (LR), Support Vector Machine (SVM), K-Nearest Neighbors (K-NN), Artificial Neural Networks (ANN), Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN), Bayesian networks and extreme learning machines. Decision Tree, Naive Bayes and SVM are explicitly described as supervised learning methods.

Supervised Learning is used in several research contexts. In customer churn prediction, it is the paradigm underlying the classification models, with techniques such as DT, RF, NB, LR, SVM, K-NN and ANN applied to predict churn, and it is listed as a keyword of the corresponding paper. In manufacturing, six supervised learning techniques were tested on a dataset of 70 plastic parts and five machines to predict injection molding machine selection.

In medical research, Supervised Learning is identified as a current trend in breast, lung, brain and skin cancer studies, where it has garnered significant interest. It also served as a search term in a bibliometric query, reflecting its prominence as a research topic.&lt;SEP&gt;Learning on large i.i.d. labeled failure logs. The paper's knowledge-based, scenario-driven evaluation protocol is explicitly contrasted with this approach.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-008</data>
