<node id="Explainable Machine Learning Models Applied to Predicting Customer Churn">
  <data key="d0">Explainable Machine Learning Models Applied to Predicting Customer Churn</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read, by Ikhlass Boukrouh, published in Int J Artif Intell, Vol. 14, No. 1, February 2025, pp. 286-297. It evaluates supervised machine learning models (DT, RF, NB, LR, SVM, K-NN, ANN) for e-commerce customer churn prediction and explains the two most accurate models using SHAP and LIME.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being read, by Ikhlass Boukrouh, published in Int J Artif Intell (ISSN 2252-8938). It compares seven supervised machine learning models (DT, RF, NB, LR, SVM, K-NN, ANN) for predicting customer churn in a marketplace and explains the two best-performing models using XAI techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being read, by Ikhlass Boukrouh, published in Int J Artif Intell Vol. 14, No. 1, February 2025, pp. 286-297; applies machine learning classifiers (NB, LR, SVM, K-NN, ANN) with grid search, performance metrics, and XAI techniques SHAP and LIME to customer churn prediction.&lt;SEP&gt;Article by Ikhlass Boukrouh published in Int J Artif Intell, Vol. 14, No. 1, February 2025, pages 286-297; applies SHAP and LIME explainability methods to ANN and RF models for predicting customer churn.&lt;SEP&gt;Article by Ikhlass Boukrouh published in the International Journal of Artificial Intelligence (ISSN 2252-8938). It compares classification machine learning models (DT, RF, LR, SVM, NB, ANN) for predicting customer churn in e-commerce and applies XAI techniques (SHAP and LIME) to interpret them, finding ANN most accurate at 92.09% and 'complaint' the most influential feature.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being read, authored by Ikhlass Boukrouh and published in Int J Artif Intell (ISSN 2252-8938). It addresses customer churn prediction with explainable machine learning, and its reference list cites works on churn prediction, explainable AI and classification methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">25293-55764-1-PB.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422000</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="2252-8938">
  <data key="d0">2252-8938</data>
  <data key="d1">identifier</data>
  <data key="d2">2252-8938 is the International Standard Serial Number (ISSN) of the journal Int J Artif Intell, the abbreviated title of the International Journal of Artificial Intelligence. It identifies the journal as a publication venue, not any individual article published in it.

The ISSN is printed in the page headers of articles published in the journal. One such article is "Explainable Machine Learning Models Applied to Predicting Customer Churn." The ISSN also appears in the headers of other articles in the journal, including a bibliometric study. In each case, the number refers to the journal as a whole rather than to the specific article.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-012</data>
