<node id="Customer Relationship Management">
  <data key="d0">Customer Relationship Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The proactive understanding and management of customer relations through strategies that fit a business.&lt;SEP&gt;CRM refers to solutions companies use to manage customer requests and relationships. Support ticket systems are described as one of the most critical CRM solutions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ef486f441df72175f968e398ffdd23d-chunk-000</data>
