<node id="Random Forests">
  <data key="d0">Random Forests</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Supervised learning technique (RF) used for churn prediction. It achieved 99.35% accuracy in Baghla and Gupta [5].&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [15]. A 2001 paper by L. Breiman in Machine Learning (vol. 45, no. 1, pp. 5–32). It introduces the Random Forest algorithm.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-007</data>
