<node id="Momin et al. [20]">
  <data key="d0">Momin et al. [20]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [20]. Evaluates supervised classification methods (K-NN, NB, RF, DT, LR, ANN) for churn prediction on IBM Telco data; ANN achieves 82.83% validation accuracy versus 78% for K-NN.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">25293-55764-1-PB.pdf</data>
