<node id="Panjasuchat and Limpiyakorn [21]">
  <data key="d0">Panjasuchat and Limpiyakorn [21]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [21]. Applies the deep Q network (DQN) reinforcement learning model to churn prediction, comparing it to XGBoost, RF and K-NN; DQN excels in accuracy.</data>
