  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [23]. Proposes an adaptive learning approach for telecom customer churn prediction using a Naive Bayes classifier with genetic-algorithm-based feature weighting, evaluated on BigML Telco, IBM Telco and Cell2Cell with accuracies 0.95, 0.97 and 0.98.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-002</data>
