  <data key="d0">Train-Test Split</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Division of the dataset into 80% training data and 20% test data. The training set is used to train the models and the test set evaluates performance on unseen instances.&lt;SEP&gt;Data partitioning with 80% for training (January 2011 to June 7, 2021) and 20% for testing (June 8, 2021 to 2023).&lt;SEP&gt;80/20 partition of data into training and testing sets for unbiased evaluation and to prevent overfitting.&lt;SEP&gt;Experimental procedure in which the six models were trained on 85% of the dataset and tested on the remaining 15%.</data>
