<node id="Grid Search">
  <data key="d0">Grid Search</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Hyperparameter selection approach exploring predefined combinations, evaluated using accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Hyperparameter configuration method used to maximize the accuracy of each model.&lt;SEP&gt;Method used to determine the optimal combination of LSTM, SARIMA, and Holt-Winters models by varying parameters and evaluating forecasting performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprehensive search technique used to find the Holt-Winters coefficients that minimize MAPE.&lt;SEP&gt;Parameter optimization technique recommended to significantly enhance forecasting accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Search over the SARIMA parameters (p, d, q, P, D, Q) performed with the auto-arima function to minimize AIC values and identify the appropriate configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;Hyperparameter optimization algorithm cited as future work; it was not used in the study.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-012</data>
