  <data key="d2">Cited as [8]. Paper by A. K. Ahmad, A. Jafar and K. Aljoumaa, published in the Journal of Big Data, vol. 6, no. 1, December 2019. It predicts telecom customer churn with machine learning on a big data platform.</data>
