  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [9]. Paper by I. Ullah, B. Raza, A. K. Malik, M. Imran, S. U. Islam and S. W. Kim, published in IEEE Access, vol. 7, pp. 60134–60149, 2019. It proposes a random forest churn prediction model and analyzes factors behind churn in the telecom sector.</data>
