<node id="Genetic Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Genetic Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">An optimization algorithm used in reference [38] together with SMOTE.&lt;SEP&gt;Used in BSAP to generate fittest offspring and overcome shortcomings of biometrics.&lt;SEP&gt;Optimization technique used as one of three security levels in the biometric stationed authentication protocol [11].&lt;SEP&gt;Optimization method. Reference [11] uses it to extract descriptive rules from police case files, and reference [13] uses it to identify significant factors in fatal-injury highway crashes.&lt;SEP&gt;Optimization method combined with fuzzy logic to improve DBSCAN.</data>
