<node id="Intelligent Automation and BioMedGenomics Laboratory">
  <data key="d0">Intelligent Automation and BioMedGenomics Laboratory</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Intelligent Automation and BioMedGenomics Laboratory (IABL) is a research laboratory within the Faculty of Sciences and Technologies (FST) of Tangier, part of Abdelmalek Essaâdi University (also written Abdelmalek Essaadi University) in Tetouan, Morocco.

The laboratory was co-founded by Abdellah Azmani, who also serves as its director. Researchers affiliated with it include Abdellah Azmani and Loubna Bouhsaien. It has served as the shared institutional affiliation for the authors of collaborative research papers, all of whom were associated with the laboratory.&lt;SEP&gt;Research laboratory at the Faculty of Sciences and Technique of Tangier, Abdelmalek Essaadi University, Tetouan, Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory at the Faculty of Science and Technology of Tangier, Abdelmalek Essaâdi University, Tetouan, Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory directed by Abdellah Azmani.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory that Abdellah Azmani co-founded and directs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8153b8d12e35b15bf93bd763cdd0b2f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-041</data>
  <data key="d4">25293-55764-1-PB.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Comprehensive_Framework_for_Supplier_Selection_Using_Subjective_Objective_and_Hybrid_Multi-Criteria_Decision-Making_Techniques_With_Sensitivity_Analysis_F (1).pdf&lt;SEP&gt;ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;CIST_174.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;document.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Configuration_Driven_Performance_Analysis_of_Hyper.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;M3A_24_Book_of_Abstracts-31.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Microservices-Driven_Automation_in_Full-Stack_Deve.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Toward_Quantum-Safe_Permissioned_Blockchains_Evalu.pdf</data>
