<node id="Predictive Analytics">
  <data key="d0">Predictive Analytics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Research interest of Ikhlass Boukrouh.&lt;SEP&gt;An analytical approach that the Digital Twin uses together with real-time data to enhance efficiency, quality and responsiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Predictive analysis and decision-making support provided by the LSTM model integrated into the digital twin ecosystem. It is performed in real time on edge computing during simulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Research interest of Yousra Bouassab and Nihad Lechhab Ouadrassi, and of the author described in the partially visible biography.&lt;SEP&gt;Research interest of Loubna Bouhsaien and a co-author.&lt;SEP&gt;Analytics in manufacturing supported by a microservice architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Planned future development: the authors intend to incorporate AI for predictive analytics.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26549e3ff493405b55b221c1d804516e-chunk-000</data>
