<node id="Risk Assessment">
  <data key="d0">Risk Assessment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Research interest of Ikhlass Boukrouh.&lt;SEP&gt;A financial-sector application of feature selection, together with insurance optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;Problem of evaluating failure and accident risks. Several cited works address it, covering marine nuclear platforms, ship steering gear, excavation collapse and gas transmission stations.&lt;SEP&gt;Evaluation of financial risk, addressed alongside financial market simulation by Kwon &amp; Lee (44).&lt;SEP&gt;Research interest of Loubna Bouhsaien and a co-author.</data>
