  <data key="d2">Field of Ikhlass Boukrouh's Ph.D., together with artificial intelligence, applied to the e-commerce sector.&lt;SEP&gt;Field of Ikhlass Boukrouh's Ph.D. studies, together with artificial intelligence, applied to the e-commerce sector.&lt;SEP&gt;Field of study, together with artificial intelligence, in Ikhlass Boukrouh's Ph.D.&lt;SEP&gt;Field mentioned in a partially visible author biography, which focuses on applications in the information technology sector. Also the field of Yousra Bouassab's B.Sc. in statistics and data science and her M.Sc. in mathematical modeling and data science.&lt;SEP&gt;Field of Loubna Bouhsaien's Ph.D. studies, combined with artificial intelligence and applied to human resources management.</data>
