<node id="Int J Artif Intell">
  <data key="d0">Int J Artif Intell</data>
  <data key="d1">venue</data>
  <data key="d2">Int J Artif Intell is the abbreviated title of the International Journal of Artificial Intelligence, also known as the IAES International Journal of Artificial Intelligence. The journal is identified by ISSN 2252-8938 and publishes research in artificial intelligence and related computational fields. It is cited as the publication venue for several articles, and the sources show at least two issues of Volume 14, both from 2025.

In Volume 14, Issue No. 1, published in February 2025, the journal included the article "Explainable machine learning models applied to predicting customer churn," on pages 286–297. That paper addresses customer churn prediction using explainable artificial intelligence (XAI), with a focus on making machine learning model predictions interpretable. The same issue also contains another article on pages 270–285. Several other descriptions refer only generally to an article or paper appearing in this February 2025 issue, without giving further detail.

In Volume 14, Issue No. 6, published in December 2025, the journal included a bibliometric analysis of feature selection techniques authored by Oumaima Semmar, on pages 4403–4414.

Some descriptions identify Int J Artif Intell only as the journal with ISSN 2252-8938 in which a given article or paper appears, without naming the volume, issue, or pages.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-015</data>
