<node id="A Bibliometric Analysis of Feature Selection Techniques: Trends, Innovations, and Future Directions">
  <data key="d0">A Bibliometric Analysis of Feature Selection Techniques: Trends, Innovations, and Future Directions</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read; a 2025 bibliometric analysis in IAES International Journal of Artificial Intelligence (Vol. 14, No. 6, pp. 4403-4414). It analyzes 2,079 documents published between 2014 and 2024 on feature selection techniques using merged Scopus and Web of Science data, citation analysis, co-authorship networks and keyword co-occurrence mapping.</data>
