<node id="Predictive Maintenance">
  <data key="d0">Predictive Maintenance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Predictive Maintenance (PdM) is a proactive maintenance strategy that anticipates system failures and degradation before they occur, so that potential issues are caught before they cause downtime or outages. Its aims are to estimate and minimize the risk of failures, maintain operational efficiency, reduce operational costs, optimize performance, minimize service interruptions, and improve system reliability. By anticipating failures, PdM allows maintenance actions to be triggered at the right time. This optimizes maintenance schedules and prolongs equipment lifespan. In practice, it relies on the continuous collection and analysis of metrics such as memory usage, CPU load, response time, and HTTP error rates to detect latent problems early.

Predictive Maintenance is the central research topic of the article in question and of many of the works it cites. The article applies PdM to critical IT components and IT systems. It treats PdM as the problem of anticipating failures in these components and addresses it with fuzzy Bayesian networks (FBN). In this context, PdM rests on probabilistic prediction of system state, which supports maintenance planning, incident triage, and risk-based prioritization. The Bayesian network (BN) model supports the strategy by anticipating risks of system failure. PdM is also the overarching goal of a pipeline that combines FBN inference with Event Tree Analysis for IT components. In the event tree for low Quality of Service (QoS) in VANET, Predictive Maintenance appears as an intermediate event and security barrier. It is also identified as a downstream application targeted for future evaluation of the framework's impact.

Within IT infrastructure, Predictive Maintenance faces notable challenges. Failure data is scarce, and privacy concerns limit data sharing. High-quality datasets remain difficult to obtain because failures and rare events are under-represented.

More broadly, Predictive Maintenance is an application of artificial intelligence to anticipating maintenance needs across various domains. Soulaimane Idiri's research applies it to vehicles, and Faouzi Tayalati's work explores AI in maintenance management. Hosni (2025) addressed the secure, prediction-based maintenance of industrial systems. In manufacturing, PdM is recognized as an application of feature selection techniques and as an area where LSTM models have been explored, for example by Essien and Giannetti.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-013</data>
