<node id="Asia leads feature selection research output">
  <data key="d0">Asia leads feature selection research output</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "Asia accounts for the majority of contributions (1,437 publications), reflecting the continent's growing investment in artificial intelligence research." China leads with 696 publications and 8,751 citations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_bibliometric_analysis_of_feature_selection_techn.pdf</data>
