  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "The results show a steady rise in publication output for China, India, and the USA between 2014 and 2024." By contrast, Saudi Arabia and Canada show only moderate growth. Data for the final months of 2024 are missing because the study concluded in September 2024.</data>
