  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "Figure 9 illustrates clusters of co-authors working together, with authors Wang [33], [40]–[45], Wang [46], [47], and Wang [33], [48]–[50] having the largest number of collaborators in producing documents on feature selection techniques."</data>
