<node id="Expert Systems with Applications">
  <data key="d0">Expert Systems with Applications</data>
  <data key="d1">venue</data>
  <data key="d2">Expert Systems with Applications (abbreviated Expert Syst. Appl.) is a scholarly journal that has published a wide range of research spanning multi-criteria decision-making methods and machine learning applications, particularly in financial forecasting. It appears as the publication venue for numerous cited references across multiple years, from 2012 through 2024.

In multi-criteria decision analysis, Expert Systems with Applications published a 2012 state-of-the-art survey of TOPSIS applications, a 2016 paper presenting a simple additive weighting metamodel (volume 54, pages 155–161), and a 2020 review of fuzzy AHP. It is also identified as the journal in which reference [35] appeared in 2020, and it published reference [8] in 2024.

The journal has also served as a significant outlet for research on stock market prediction and computational finance. It published Mostafa (2013), Chong et al. (2017) on deep learning for stock market prediction, Picasso et al. (2019), and a 2021 survey on deep neural networks for the stock market.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal that published references [29] and [32].&lt;SEP&gt;Journal that published Kaya and Yet's 2019 paper on DEMATEL-based Bayesian networks.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal that published the 2017 paper on selecting defuzzification methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal that published Echeverria et al. (2025).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-012</data>
