  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Taxonomy that the International Journal of Artificial Intelligence uses to recognize individual author contributions, reduce authorship disputes, and facilitate collaboration. Its roles include conceptualization, methodology, software, validation, formal analysis, investigation, resources, data curation, writing, visualization, supervision, project administration and funding acquisition.</data>
