<node id="Pattern Recognition">
  <data key="d0">Pattern Recognition</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Journal that published the paper comparing handcrafted and non-handcrafted features in 2017.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal that published reference [47] in 2024.&lt;SEP&gt;Task for which Random Forest is considered a crucial ML algorithm, mainly because of its cost-effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Class of problems, such as face and speech recognition, that are easy for humans but hard to articulate. AI research shifted toward these problems over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Technique applied in reference [19] to road traffic accident severity in Korea.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b9912ddab6105f96b8cd8cb51d46ee9-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-015</data>
