<node id="A Comprehensive Framework for Supplier Selection: Using Subjective, Objective, and Hybrid Multi-Criteria Decision-Making Techniques With Sensitivity Analysis">
  <data key="d0">A Comprehensive Framework for Supplier Selection: Using Subjective, Objective, and Hybrid Multi-Criteria Decision-Making Techniques With Sensitivity Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read, published in IEEE Access in 2024 (received 12 August 2024, published 16 September 2024). The paper proposes a supplier evaluation framework that uses five MCDM approaches with seven main criteria and twenty-one sub-criteria. It derives criterion weights with subjective (AHP, Fuzzy AHP), objective (Entropy) and hybrid (AHP-Entropy, Fuzzy AHP-Entropy) methods. It ranks suppliers with TOPSIS and validates the results through a sensitivity analysis of 21 scenarios. The findings show that hybrid methods are stable in nineteen scenarios, objective methods in three, and subjective methods in none.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Comprehensive_Framework_for_Supplier_Selection_Using_Subjective_Objective_and_Hybrid_Multi-Criteria_Decision-Making_Techniques_With_Sensitivity_Analysis_F (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422462</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="10.1109/access.2024.3462348">
  <data key="d0">10.1109/access.2024.3462348</data>
  <data key="d1">identifier</data>
  <data key="d2">DOI of the supplier selection framework paper.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Comprehensive_Framework_for_Supplier_Selection_Using_Subjective_Objective_and_Hybrid_Multi-Criteria_Decision-Making_Techniques_With_Sensitivity_Analysis_F (1).pdf</data>
