<node id="Criteria Weighting">
  <data key="d0">Criteria Weighting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The determination of weights for each criterion and sub-criterion (seven main criteria and twenty-one sub-criteria). Weights are derived with subjective, objective and hybrid methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Determination of the weights of supplier selection criteria, performed in This Paper via subjective (AHP, FAHP), objective (Entropy) and combined (AHP-Entropy, FAHP-Entropy) techniques.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-002</data>
