  <data key="d5">1791422462</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Integrating subjective and objective methods is important in decision-making">
  <data key="d0">Integrating subjective and objective methods is important in decision-making</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Conclusion of the paper: "This underscores the importance of integrating both subjective and objective methods in the decision-making process."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Comprehensive_Framework_for_Supplier_Selection_Using_Subjective_Objective_and_Hybrid_Multi-Criteria_Decision-Making_Techniques_With_Sensitivity_Analysis_F (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422462</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MCDM improves decision-making and strengthens relationships">
  <data key="d0">MCDM improves decision-making and strengthens relationships</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "They offer several advantages, such as improving the decision-making process, managing risks more effectively, streamlining operations, and strengthening relationships [3]."</data>
