<node id="DEMATEL">
  <data key="d0">DEMATEL</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Decision-Making Trial and Evaluation Laboratory, a subjective criteria-weighting approach.&lt;SEP&gt;Decision-making trial and evaluation laboratory framework introduced in reference [4].&lt;SEP&gt;Decision-making method used in reference [32] as the basis for building Bayesian networks for multiple criteria decision problems.&lt;SEP&gt;Decision-making method that Kaya and Yet used as the basis for building Bayesian networks for multiple criteria decision problems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-016</data>
