  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FAHP-Entropy">
  <data key="d0">FAHP-Entropy</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">A hybrid weighting method that combines Fuzzy AHP and Entropy.&lt;SEP&gt;Method merging subjective FAHP weights with objective Entropy weights.&lt;SEP&gt;Combined weighting method that integrates FAHP and Entropy.&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid weighting method that combines FAHP subjective weights with entropy objective weights to compute combined weights.&lt;SEP&gt;Combined weighting method that integrates FAHP weights with entropy weights. It ranks C3 as the most significant criterion (0.2959) and C4 as the least significant (0.0059).&lt;SEP&gt;Combined fuzzy-subjective and objective weighting method that generated the most probable ranking across all four alternatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Combined approach merging FAHP subjective weights with Entropy objective weights; yielded ranking A1 &gt; A2 &gt; A4 &gt; A3 and stable results across sensitivity scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Comprehensive_Framework_for_Supplier_Selection_Using_Subjective_Objective_and_Hybrid_Multi-Criteria_Decision-Making_Techniques_With_Sensitivity_Analysis_F (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422462</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="COPRAS">
  <data key="d0">COPRAS</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Complex Proportional Assessment, a ranking technique.&lt;SEP&gt;Complex proportional assessment MCDM method. Reference [3] combines it with interval-valued Pythagorean fuzzy AHP for supplier selection.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Comprehensive_Framework_for_Supplier_Selection_Using_Subjective_Objective_and_Hybrid_Multi-Criteria_Decision-Making_Techniques_With_Sensitivity_Analysis_F (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422462</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="VIKOR">
  <data key="d0">VIKOR</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">A multi-criteria optimization and compromise solution ranking technique.&lt;SEP&gt;Multicriteria optimization and compromise ranking method described in Opricovi's 1998 technical report.&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-criteria ranking method. Demir et al. combine it with fuzzy AHP to select a bank investment location.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Comprehensive_Framework_for_Supplier_Selection_Using_Subjective_Objective_and_Hybrid_Multi-Criteria_Decision-Making_Techniques_With_Sensitivity_Analysis_F (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422462</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PROMETHEE">
  <data key="d0">PROMETHEE</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Preference Ranking Organization Method for Enrichment Evaluation, a ranking technique.&lt;SEP&gt;Outranking method for selecting and ranking projects, presented by Brans, Vincke and Mareschal (1986).&lt;SEP&gt;Preference Ranking Organization Method for Enrichment Evaluation; MCDM method.&lt;SEP&gt;Outranking-based multiple criteria decision analysis method.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-015</data>
