  <data key="d0">Weber Supplier Selection Literature Review</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [16]. Comprehensive literature review by Weber of 74 articles published between 1966 and 1990, underscoring the enduring relevance of Dickson's criteria with shifts in relative significance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Comprehensive_Framework_for_Supplier_Selection_Using_Subjective_Objective_and_Hybrid_Multi-Criteria_Decision-Making_Techniques_With_Sensitivity_Analysis_F (1).pdf</data>
