<node id="Online Retail Sector">
  <data key="d0">Online Retail Sector</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Rapidly growing industry that has received limited attention in supplier selection research; the application context of This Paper.&lt;SEP&gt;Industry context in which suppliers are evaluated.&lt;SEP&gt;Application domain of the case study in which a single supplier must be chosen for a product or service offer.&lt;SEP&gt;The industry context of the supplier selection case study.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-007</data>
