</node>
<node id="FAHP-Entropy-TOPSIS">
  <data key="d0">FAHP-Entropy-TOPSIS</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Approach proposed by This Paper as the most robust and effective, combining FAHP expert judgments under uncertainty, Entropy objectivity and TOPSIS ranking.&lt;SEP&gt;Method that exhibited the shortest average Euclidean distance to scenario scores, suggesting best alignment with the scenarios' requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Combined method integrating expert judgement, fuzzy logic and objective data; emerged as a particularly effective, balanced and reliable approach to supplier ranking.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Comprehensive_Framework_for_Supplier_Selection_Using_Subjective_Objective_and_Hybrid_Multi-Criteria_Decision-Making_Techniques_With_Sensitivity_Analysis_F (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422477</data>
