<node id="Dickson's criteria remain relevant with shifting significance">
  <data key="d0">Dickson's criteria remain relevant with shifting significance</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "This analysis underscored the enduring relevance of Dickson's criteria from 1966, albeit with some shifts in their relative significance over time."</data>
