<node id="Saaty">
  <data key="d0">Saaty</data>
  <data key="d1">author</data>
  <data key="d2">Referred to only by surname in the text. Saaty introduced the AHP method in 1971, and the scale used to build pairwise comparison matrices is named after Saaty (Saaty's scale). This corrects the earlier entity "Thomas Saaty", whose first name does not appear in the text.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-003</data>
