<node id="Hierarchical Structure">
  <data key="d0">Hierarchical Structure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Step 1 of AHP. It identifies the constituent elements of the problem and typically has three levels: the objective, the criteria and the alternatives. It can include multi-layered criteria such as sub-criteria (Figure 2).</data>
