<node id="Reference [33]">
  <data key="d0">Reference [33]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited work on transforming individual expert judgment matrices into a collective matrix using the geometric mean method.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited study reporting Random Forest precision of 95.86, recall of 95.71, and F1 score of 95.73.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited work, identified as [33], supporting the controlled-overlap criterion for determining the spread of Gaussian membership functions.&lt;SEP&gt;Work cited as [33] in support of the claim that early metric signals reveal latent issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited study [33] that relied on expert insights.&lt;SEP&gt;Work cited regarding attractive VANET services such as Internet access, automatic toll payment, traffic management and location-based services.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [33]; Hyperledger Fabric performance study.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-006</data>
