</node>
<node id="Linguistic Variables">
  <data key="d0">Linguistic Variables</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Variables represented by fuzzy numbers that approximate values within specific contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Variables represented by fuzzy numbers in FAHP, used to approximate human judgments.&lt;SEP&gt;Fuzzy variables whose states are described by natural language expressions (linguistic values or labels). The paper defines them first and lists them in TABLE 2.&lt;SEP&gt;Fuzzy variables represented qualitatively using natural-language expressions, as shown in Table III.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-007</data>
