  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [7]. Work by Shannon in 1948 that adapted entropy to measure uncertainty in information sources.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [7]. Shannon's 1948 work, which adapted the entropy concept to measure uncertainty in information sources.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-006</data>
