  <data key="d0">Uncertainty in Human Opinions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Problem of uncertainty often present in human judgments. FAHP is designed to address it.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-005</data>
