</node>
<node id="Center of gravity function converts fuzzy weights into crisp values">
  <data key="d0">Center of gravity function converts fuzzy weights into crisp values</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The fuzzy criterion weights obtained in the previous step are converted into crisp values using the center of gravity function, as shown in (17) [38].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-005</data>
