</node>
<node id="Fuzzy geometric mean serves as an aggregate measure of pairwise comparisons">
  <data key="d0">Fuzzy geometric mean serves as an aggregate measure of pairwise comparisons</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Initially, the fuzzy geometric mean of each criterion [41], is calculated using (15), is employed as an aggregate measure of pairwise comparisons, followed by applying (16) to determine criterion fuzzy weights based on these geometric means.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Comprehensive_Framework_for_Supplier_Selection_Using_Subjective_Objective_and_Hybrid_Multi-Criteria_Decision-Making_Techniques_With_Sensitivity_Analysis_F (1).pdf</data>
