  <data key="d0">Hwang and Yoon 1981</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [10]. Work by Hwang and Yoon in 1981 that first introduced the TOPSIS approach.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as (25); 1981 work by Hwang and Yoon from which TOPSIS originates.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-003</data>
