<node id="Supplier Selection">
  <data key="d0">Supplier Selection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Supplier Selection is the decision-making process and problem of evaluating and choosing suppliers or vendors. It is considered key to operational success and important for organizations seeking to improve operational efficiency and competitiveness. Choosing the correct supplier requires effective evaluation methods, because selecting unsuitable suppliers exposes organizations to risks that careful evaluation aims to reduce.

Methodologically, Supplier Selection is framed as a multi-criteria decision-making (MCDM) problem. It generally involves defining and selecting criteria and sub-criteria, assigning weights to them, and then evaluating and ranking supplier alternatives according to those weighted criteria.

Supplier Selection is the central topic of the comprehensive framework paper by I. Boukrouh et al. (2024), whose framework is designed to choose among supplier alternatives. The work includes a case study in the online retail sector, where the problem is to choose the best supplier among four candidates (A1, A2, A3, A4) for an offer, using weighted criteria and sub-criteria.

The problem has been studied across many industries, including construction, fashion, dairy, and aerospace and defense. Several referenced works also address supplier or vendor selection in sectors such as clothing, steel pipes, and glass manufacturing, which shows the problem's broad relevance across industrial contexts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-015</data>
