<node id="International Journal of Engineering">
  <data key="d0">International Journal of Engineering</data>
  <data key="d1">venue</data>
  <data key="d2">The International Journal of Engineering (IJE, abbreviated Int. J. Eng.) is a scholarly journal organized into several thematic series: Transactions A: Basics, Transactions B: Applications, and Transactions C: Aspects. Through these sections it publishes research across fundamental and applied engineering.

The journal is closely associated with research on injection molding machine selection. It is identified as the venue where a paper on selecting injection molding machines is to be published, referred to as "This Paper" (2025). It also published a 2024 study that applied a combined AHP-TOPSIS multi-criteria decision-making approach to injection molding machine selection. The descriptions may refer to two related works or to the same paper at different stages of publication.

The International Journal of Engineering is also frequently cited as the source of references in related literature, although the reference numbers differ across citing documents:

- **General references:** references 21, 22 and 25 across its Transactions A and B.
- **2024 references:** references 38, 42 and 43.
- **References by section:** references 10, 17 and 11, published in 2024 in Transactions A: Basics, B: Applications and C: Aspects respectively.
- **Reference [2]:** published in 2024.
- **References [3] and [4]:** published in Transactions B: Applications. Reference [4] appeared in volume 37, issue 9, in 2024.

These citations show that the journal is an active and relevant venue for recent engineering research, particularly in 2024 and 2025.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal (IJE) that published references [74], [75] and [76].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-018</data>
