<node id="Generative AI significantly impacts HRM with benefits and challenges">
  <data key="d0">Generative AI significantly impacts HRM with benefits and challenges</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The rapid evolution of generative AI models like ChatGPT significantly impacts HRM by enhancing productivity and transforming business models while introducing uncertainties about job displacement, ethical dilemmas, bias, misinformation, and privacy, necessitating comprehensive research to explore both their benefits and challenges (Budhwar et al., 2022).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-000</data>
