<node id="Generative AI">
  <data key="d0">Generative AI</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A class of AI models, such as ChatGPT, that enhances productivity and transforms business models. It also raises concerns about job displacement, ethics, bias, misinformation and privacy in HRM.&lt;SEP&gt;GenAI in software development supporting code generation, completion, translation, refinement, summarization and defect detection; prone to errors and security risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Technological revolution whose growing use in the legal sector makes improved chatbot systems more necessary.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
