<node id="AI enhances talent management and recruitment and can reduce bias in HR">
  <data key="d0">AI enhances talent management and recruitment and can reduce bias in HR</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">"The potential of AI in HRM is vast, enhancing talent management by identifying crucial skills and streamlining recruitment through efficient candidate evaluation. AI has the potential to reduce bias in HR processes, though ongoing vigilance is needed to ensure fairness. It also brings ethical and legal considerations, requiring proactive management." (Fernandes França et al., 2023)</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-000</data>
