<node id="Industry 4.0">
  <data key="d0">Industry 4.0</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Industry 4.0, also referred to as Factory 4.0, is the industrial paradigm associated with the fourth industrial revolution. It is characterized by the fusion of Internet of Things (IoT) technologies with advanced digital concepts, and it is closely linked to smart manufacturing and sustainable growth driven by artificial intelligence (AI) and data. Cited works discuss Industry 4.0 in relation to the Industrial Internet of Things (IIoT) and digital twin applications, highlighting its role in connecting physical production systems with digital technologies.

Industry 4.0 has drawn considerable academic attention for its influence on business management and decision-making. It was the subject of a 2024 bibliometric study on business management, in which thematic mapping indicated that it is a theme of declining emphasis within the research landscape. It has also served as the context for job advertisements analyzed through text mining by Pejic-Bach et al., reflecting its implications for workforce skills and labor market demands.

In practical applications, Industry 4.0 provides the industrial context in which AI is implemented to enhance competitiveness, for example in plastic injection molding. This illustrates how the paradigm uses intelligent technologies to improve efficiency, productivity, and competitive advantage in manufacturing sectors.&lt;SEP&gt;Principles leveraged to make control charts more intelligent and adaptable.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56015fdaac28ae50466d3ddc4439d39b-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;M3A_24_Book_of_Abstracts-57.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426614</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
