  <data key="d0">Federated Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">AI-related search keyword used to collect articles on AI in HRM.&lt;SEP&gt;Approach (FL) enabling multi-institutional training without centralizing patient data, preserving privacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Distributed training approach that improves site performance in multicenter deep learning without sharing data.&lt;SEP&gt;Privacy-preserving approach that trains models locally on edge devices without transmitting raw data, preserving data sovereignty and reducing communication overhead.&lt;SEP&gt;Distributed learning approach that Hosni (2025) uses for secure predictive maintenance in industrial systems.</data>
