<node id="Average citations per year fluctuate despite publication growth">
  <data key="d0">Average citations per year fluctuate despite publication growth</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "However, amidst this proliferation of research, there is an intriguing observation of fluctuating trends in average citations per year." The variability suggests the impact of individual studies may not be consistently maintained over time.</data>
