<node id="Collaboration among academia, industry and policymakers is crucial for AI integration in HRM">
  <data key="d0">Collaboration among academia, industry and policymakers is crucial for AI integration in HRM</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Collaborative efforts between academia, industry, and policymakers will be crucial in establishing standardized guidelines and best practices for AI integration in HRM, ensuring that these technologies are used effectively and responsibly."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-005</data>
