<node id="Artificial Intelligence, Robotics, Advanced Technologies and Human Resource Management: A Systematic Review">
  <data key="d0">Artificial Intelligence, Robotics, Advanced Technologies and Human Resource Management: A Systematic Review</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Vrontis et al., 2022; a systematic review on the impact of AI regarding HR replacement with human-robot/AI collaboration in HRM activities. Listed among the most cited references.&lt;SEP&gt;Systematic review by Vrontis, Christofi, Pereira, Tarba, Makrides and Trichina (2022), published in The International Journal of Human Resource Management, 33(6), 1237-1266.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Work-From-Anywhere: The Productivity Effects of Geographic Flexibility">
  <data key="d0">Work-From-Anywhere: The Productivity Effects of Geographic Flexibility</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Choudhury et al., 2021; shows the positive impact of both temporal and geographic flexibility on productivity and employees. Listed among the most cited references.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf</data>
