</node>
<node id="Text Mining of Industry 4.0 Job Advertisements">
  <data key="d0">Text Mining of Industry 4.0 Job Advertisements</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Pejic-Bach et al., 2020; develops two profiles based on publicly available job advertisements according to the type of knowledge. Listed among the most cited references.&lt;SEP&gt;Study by Pejic-Bach, Bertoncel, Meško and Krstić (2020) that applies text mining to Industry 4.0 job advertisements. It was published in the International Journal of Information Management, 50, 416–431.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Automated Action Recognition Using an Accelerometer-Embedded Wristband-Type Activity Tracker">
  <data key="d0">Automated Action Recognition Using an Accelerometer-Embedded Wristband-Type Activity Tracker</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Ryu et al., 2019; explores the feasibility of employing an accelerometer in masonry work through the use of classifiers. Listed among the most cited references.&lt;SEP&gt;Study by Ryu, Seo, Jebelli and Lee (2019) on automated action recognition using an accelerometer-embedded wristband-type activity tracker. It was published in the Journal of Construction Engineering and Management, 145(1).&lt;SEP&gt;Paper by Ryu, Seo, Jebelli and Lee (2019), published in Journal of Construction Engineering and Management, 145(1), 04018114. It addresses automated action recognition using a wristband-type activity tracker with an embedded accelerometer.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Unlocking the Value of Artificial Intelligence in Human Resource Management Through AI Capability Framework">
  <data key="d0">Unlocking the Value of Artificial Intelligence in Human Resource Management Through AI Capability Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Chowdhury et al., 2023; proposes an AI capability framework covering recruitment and selection, training and development, evaluation and motivation, talent management and planning, and change strategies for integrating AI into HRM. Listed among the most cited references.&lt;SEP&gt;Article by Chowdhury, Dey, Joel-Edgar, Bhattacharya, Rodriguez-Espindola, Abadie and Truong (2023) in Human Resource Management Review, 33(1), 100899, proposing an AI capability framework for HRM.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gender Matters in Hospitality">
  <data key="d0">Gender Matters in Hospitality</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Morgan &amp; Pritchard, 2019; discusses the future of hospitality gender research, including women's employment prospects and AI and robotics as key areas for gendered human experiences. Listed among the most cited references.&lt;SEP&gt;Morgan &amp; Pritchard, 2019. Discusses the future of hospitality gender research, including women's employment prospects and AI and robotics as key areas of gendered human experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Article by Morgan and Pritchard (2019) on gender issues in hospitality. It was published in the International Journal of Hospitality Management, 76, 38–44.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-009</data>
