<node id="Accelerometer-Embedded Wristband Activity Tracker">
  <data key="d0">Accelerometer-Embedded Wristband Activity Tracker</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Wristband-type activity tracker with an embedded accelerometer, used with classifiers by Ryu et al. (2019) for automated action recognition in masonry work.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-006</data>
