  <data key="d0">The Janus Face of Artificial Intelligence Feedback: Deployment versus Disclosure Effects on Employee Performance</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Tong et al., 2021. Shows that AI can enhance employee productivity through better performance feedback, but that disclosing AI feedback to employees may lead to negative perceptions and reduce productivity.</data>
