<node id="AI and robotics are key areas for hospitality gender research">
  <data key="d0">AI and robotics are key areas for hospitality gender research</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The future of hospitality gender research involves examining women's employment prospects within the industry, with AI and robotics standing out as key areas for scholars to lead discussions on gendered human experiences.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AI integration across HRM transforms talent management">
  <data key="d0">AI integration across HRM transforms talent management</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The integration of AI across all aspects of HRM, from recruitment to performance analysis and compensation, signifies a comprehensive transformation aimed at optimizing talent management processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Robotization may reduce middle-skilled workers while increasing low- and high-skilled workers">
  <data key="d0">Robotization may reduce middle-skilled workers while increasing low- and high-skilled workers</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">A prediction that middle-skilled workers may decline while low-skilled and high-skilled workers will increase.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Disclosure of AI feedback may reduce employee productivity">
  <data key="d0">Disclosure of AI feedback may reduce employee productivity</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">AI can enhance employee productivity by improving the quality and consistency of performance feedback, but its disclosure to employees may lead to negative perceptions and reduce productivity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Many-Objective Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Model">
  <data key="d0">Many-Objective Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Model</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Flexible workshop planning model from Gong et al. (2019). It integrates numerous objectives, considers energy and labor, and optimizes production costs under volatile electricity prices and wages using tailored algorithms.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
