<node id="A Deep Learning Pipeline for Accurate Road Detection in Satellite Imagery">
  <data key="d0">A Deep Learning Pipeline for Accurate Road Detection in Satellite Imagery</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read, by Mayouche, Boukrouh and Azmani, published in International Journal of Engineering, Transactions C: Aspects, Vol. 39, No. 09, September 2026, pp. 2106-2117. The paper presents a deep-learning pipeline for road extraction from satellite imagery. The pipeline combines road-presence classification (VGG16/VGG19 with transfer learning), data augmentation and DeepLabV3+ semantic segmentation with a ResNet-50 backbone. On DeepGlobe it achieves IoU of about 95.8% and Dice of about 97.9% on road-positive subsets, using about 41M parameters.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422743</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
