<node id="I. Mayouche">
  <data key="d0">I. Mayouche</data>
  <data key="d1">author</data>
  <data key="d2">I. Mayouche is the first and lead author, as well as the corresponding author, of a research article on road extraction from satellite imagery. The article presents a road detection pipeline and was published in IJE Transactions C: Aspects, Vol. 39, No. 09, in September 2026.

I. Mayouche is affiliated with the Intelligent Automation and BioMedGenomics Laboratory at the Faculty of Sciences and Techniques (FST) of Tangier, Abdelmalek Essaâdi University. Correspondence regarding the article is directed to I. Mayouche at ibtihal.mayouche@etu.uae.ac.ma, which indicates that the author's full first name is Ibtihal and suggests student status at the university.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-014</data>
