<node id="Deep learning with CNNs has revolutionized computer vision">
  <data key="d0">Deep learning with CNNs has revolutionized computer vision</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Deep learning, an advanced subset of machine learning, has significantly revolutionized computer vision, especially with the introduction and widespread use of convolutional neural networks (1).</data>
