<node id="Satellite Imagery">
  <data key="d0">Satellite Imagery</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Remote sensing images that the paper processes to extract roads. Deep learning techniques have shown remarkable promise for extracting roads from satellite imagery.&lt;SEP&gt;Satellite and remote sensing images containing diverse terrains and urban environments. Road networks are extracted from these images.&lt;SEP&gt;Remote sensing images from which RoadCT extracts roads.&lt;SEP&gt;Satellite images from which road networks are segmented. These images vary in viewing angle, orientation, resolution and perspective.&lt;SEP&gt;Remote sensing images captured by satellites. In the DeepGlobe Road Extraction Dataset, the images are RGB, 1024 x 1024 pixels, and have a 50 cm pixel resolution. Roads and road networks are automatically extracted from these images.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422750</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Road-Presence Classification">
  <data key="d0">Road-Presence Classification</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Preliminary pipeline stage that uses VGG16/VGG19 with transfer learning to filter out tiles without roads. The stage reduces computation and mitigates false positives.&lt;SEP&gt;Binary classification of whether a satellite image contains roads, performed with VGG16 and VGG19.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422750</data>
