</node>
<node id="Computer Vision">
  <data key="d0">Computer Vision</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Field revolutionized by deep learning and CNNs. Its key tasks include image classification, segmentation and object detection.&lt;SEP&gt;Field addressing image-based problems; it offers promising solutions for defect detection.&lt;SEP&gt;Research field in which Canny edge detection is a popular technique for detecting edges in images.&lt;SEP&gt;Vision-based technique used for quality prediction in multi-material jetting (reference [10]).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-007</data>
