  <data key="d5">1791467085</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Image Classification">
  <data key="d0">Image Classification</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Computer vision task for which CNNs are effective. In the pipeline it is used to detect whether a satellite tile contains roads.&lt;SEP&gt;Preliminary pipeline stage that automatically identifies whether a satellite image contains roads before segmentation, reducing unnecessary computation and false positives.&lt;SEP&gt;Classification stage of the study's pipeline applied to satellite images.&lt;SEP&gt;Task of classifying satellite images as road or non-road, used as the initial phase before segmentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Task performed before segmentation in this paper's pipeline. VGG16 and VGG19 are used for it.&lt;SEP&gt;Task for which CNNs are widely used.&lt;SEP&gt;Task addressed by the CNN models evaluated in the paper.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-005</data>
