  <data key="d0">Road Structure Refined Convolutional Neural Network (RSRCNN)</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">CNN integrating deconvolutional and fusion layers with a road-structure-based loss function to extract structured roads from aerial images.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
