  <data key="d0">Composite Loss Function</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Loss function used to train DRR Net, designed with small object instances in mind.&lt;SEP&gt;Loss function used to train DRR Net to enhance the detection of small object instances.</data>
