  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Building block of DRR Net employing dense convolutions in the encoder and residual connections transmitting combined features to subsequent modules; designed to extract various routes and alleviate class imbalance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
