<node id="Occlusion">
  <data key="d0">Occlusion</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Challenge in road extraction caused by natural and man-made elements obscuring roads, alongside road discriminability and complex backgrounds.&lt;SEP&gt;A challenge inherent in satellite images. The proposed methodology addresses occlusion, and data augmentation enhances robustness to it.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-011</data>
