  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Encoder-decoder segmentation architecture into which attention blocks are incorporated in the Ghandorh et al. approach.&lt;SEP&gt;Encoder-decoder segmentation architecture. Ghandorh et al. augment it with an attention mechanism for road segmentation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-010</data>
