  <data key="d2">Algorithms integrated with semantic segmentation to identify road edges.&lt;SEP&gt;Image processing technique combined with semantic segmentation for road detection by Ghandorh et al. (2022).&lt;SEP&gt;Image processing step performed on the collected images using the Canny filter.&lt;SEP&gt;Computer vision task of detecting edges in images.&lt;SEP&gt;Image processing technique applied to plastic parts in This Paper. It extracts crucial edge characteristics for subsequent CNN analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Image processing problem addressed by references [12], [13], [14] and [15].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-007</data>
