<node id="FCNNs can achieve good road segmentation with hyperparameter tuning">
  <data key="d0">FCNNs can achieve good road segmentation with hyperparameter tuning</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "The results show promising performance, indicating that although FCNNs do not excel at road segmentation by default, they can achieve good results with good hyperparameter tuning."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
