  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SAR road segmentation keeps maps up to date">
  <data key="d0">SAR road segmentation keeps maps up to date</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "Moreover, road segmentation from synthetic aperture radar (SAR) satellite images can keep maps up to date as transportation networks evolve (18)."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CC-Deeplab_v3_plus improves MIoU by 1% over Deeplab_v3_plus">
  <data key="d0">CC-Deeplab_v3_plus improves MIoU by 1% over Deeplab_v3_plus</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "This CC-Deeplab_v3_plus model achieves a 1% improvement in Mean Intersection Over Union (MIUO) compared to Deeplab_v3_plus, demonstrating the effectiveness of this proposed method."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Road sensing technology is significant for traffic monitoring and urban planning">
  <data key="d0">Road sensing technology is significant for traffic monitoring and urban planning</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "The significance of road sensing technology is emphasized by Ghandorh et al. (17) in a number of applications, including traffic monitoring and urban planning."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Integrating semantic segmentation with edge detection improves road boundary identification">
  <data key="d0">Integrating semantic segmentation with edge detection improves road boundary identification</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text about Ghandorh et al. (17): "The suggested approach is assessed using real-world datasets that span substantial areas of Massachusetts and Saudi Arabia, proving its efficacy in precisely identifying road boundaries even in challenging environments."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Specialized road extraction architectures could further improve segmentation quality">
  <data key="d0">Specialized road extraction architectures could further improve segmentation quality</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text about Henry et al. (19): "However, the study suggests that specialized architectures designed specifically for route extraction could further improve segmentation quality, particularly as network depth increases."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transfer learning CNNs achieve 80.0% road quality accuracy from satellite imagery">
  <data key="d0">Transfer learning CNNs achieve 80.0% road quality accuracy from satellite imagery</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text about Brewer et al. (20): "With satellite imagery, they achieve an 80.0% accuracy rate, with 99.4% of predictions falling into the correct or adjacent quality class. Subsequently, the best-performing model, with a 94.0% accuracy rate, is applied to predict road quality in Nigeria."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-branch designs enrich feature representations and improve accuracy">
  <data key="d0">Multi-branch designs enrich feature representations and improve accuracy</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "Farsi et al. (21) proposed a Multi-Path U-Net architecture for multimodal biomedical image segmentation, demonstrating how multi-branch designs can enrich feature representations and improve accuracy across heterogeneous data."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Attention modules enhance segmentation performance on complex scenes">
  <data key="d0">Attention modules enhance segmentation performance on complex scenes</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "Similarly, Sahragard et al. (22) introduced a hierarchical multi-scale feature extraction and channel-based attention mechanism for aerial imagery, showing the potential of attention modules in enhancing segmentation performance on complex scenes."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
