  <data key="d2">Final stage of the pipeline that segments roads in satellite images identified as containing roads.&lt;SEP&gt;Segmentation stage of the study's pipeline used to extract roads from satellite images.&lt;SEP&gt;Computer vision task for which CNNs are widely used.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-003</data>
