  <data key="d5">1791467109</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Satellite Images">
  <data key="d0">Satellite Images</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Images acquired over diverse geographical areas such as urban, rural, desert, or maritime regions, not all of which contain roads.&lt;SEP&gt;Remote sensing imagery from which roads are extracted. Challenges such as occlusion and variability affect road extraction from satellite images.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-011</data>
