</node>
<node id="DeepGlobe Road Extraction Challenge Dataset">
  <data key="d0">DeepGlobe Road Extraction Challenge Dataset</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">Dataset mostly containing satellite images with road annotations, though some contain few or no visible roads; used as a proxy for real-world satellite streams.&lt;SEP&gt;Dataset obtained from the Road Extraction Challenge Track of the DeepGlobe Challenge. It focuses on automatically extracting roads and road networks from satellite images, particularly in disaster areas and developing countries.&lt;SEP&gt;Satellite imagery dataset covering diverse urban, suburban and rural regions; used for the experiments and also used by RoadCT (about 6k images at 50cm resolution).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ImageNet">
  <data key="d0">ImageNet</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">Dataset on which VGG16 and VGG19 were pre-trained before fine-tuning.&lt;SEP&gt;Dataset on which the ResNet50 encoder was pre-trained.&lt;SEP&gt;Dataset whose pretrained weights initialize VGG16, VGG19 and ResNet50. Its statistics are also used for input normalization.&lt;SEP&gt;Dataset whose normalization and pretrained weights are used for input preprocessing and the ResNet50 encoder initialization.&lt;SEP&gt;Complex image dataset used in scaling up GANs with BigGAN.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="False Positives">
  <data key="d0">False Positives</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Erroneous detections that would increase if segmentation were applied directly to every captured image.&lt;SEP&gt;Negative instances incorrectly predicted as positive (FP); a component of the confusion matrix used in accuracy and precision.&lt;SEP&gt;Confusion matrix outcome (FP): cases where the model wrongly identifies a quality defect that is absent.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-004</data>
