<node id="Fine-Tuning">
  <data key="d0">Fine-Tuning</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Procedure of adapting VGG16 and VGG19, pre-trained on ImageNet, to classify road presence in satellite images.&lt;SEP&gt;Transfer-learning procedure in which VGG16 and VGG19 are fine-tuned from ImageNet-pretrained weights for binary road-presence detection. Inputs are resized to 224×224 pixels, and the final fully connected layer is replaced by a binary sigmoid classifier.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Road Presence Classification">
  <data key="d0">Road Presence Classification</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Binary task of automatically identifying whether a satellite image contains roads before it is passed to the segmentation module.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Computational Efficiency">
  <data key="d0">Computational Efficiency</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Avoiding unnecessary computation by not applying segmentation to every captured satellite image, which makes the pipeline more efficient.&lt;SEP&gt;Property of models that improves when the Boruta algorithm retains only relevant features and simplifies the models.&lt;SEP&gt;Efficiency of models in computation, which improves when feature selection simplifies them.&lt;SEP&gt;A focus of future work: optimizing the fuzzy Bayesian Network approach through more efficient algorithms or advanced computational resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-013</data>
