</node>
<node id="Early Stopping">
  <data key="d0">Early Stopping</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Regularization procedure with a patience of 5, used in classification training of up to 30 epochs.&lt;SEP&gt;Training procedure used with patience 5 for classification models and based on validation IoU for the segmentation model.&lt;SEP&gt;Training procedure listed among the documented training configurations, together with batch size, epochs, optimizer, learning rate and scheduler.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sigmoid Activation">
  <data key="d0">Sigmoid Activation</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Activation function used in the binary classifier that replaces the final fully connected layer of VGG16/VGG19, and for binary mask prediction in DeepLabV3+.&lt;SEP&gt;Activation of the single-neuron output layer used for binary classification.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467109</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mask Binarization Threshold">
  <data key="d0">Mask Binarization Threshold</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Preprocessing step that applies a threshold of 128 to grayscale mask images, whose values may not be purely 0 and 255, to convert them into binary road/background labels.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Annotation Imperfection">
  <data key="d0">Annotation Imperfection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Limitation of the dataset annotations caused by inherent challenges in labeling segmentation masks, particularly in rural regions, where small roads within farmlands were intentionally left unannotated.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reproducibility">
  <data key="d0">Reproducibility</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Goal motivating the detailed reporting of training configurations for both the classification stage (VGG16/VGG19) and the segmentation stage (DeepLabV3+).&lt;SEP&gt;Goal supported by depositing all experimental artefacts in an open Zenodo repository.&lt;SEP&gt;Property ensured by a fixed random seed and configuration snapshot, making the baseline fully reproducible.&lt;SEP&gt;Property of generated datasets ensured by formalizing domain rules as explicit exclusion constraints and by supporting reproducible system stress testing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Vol.13.No.7.13.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DeepGlobe Dataset">
  <data key="d0">DeepGlobe Dataset</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">Satellite road extraction benchmark; the paper notes that its segmentation results on a classification-filtered road-positive subset are not directly comparable to benchmark-style results on the full DeepGlobe dataset.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791422754</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
