  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Task of identifying and segmenting roads in satellite imagery, addressed by the classification and segmentation pipeline.&lt;SEP&gt;Task of extracting and categorizing road networks from satellite imagery.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-010</data>
