  <data key="d0">Multimodal Deep Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Including late image-omics fusion, a focus of various studies during 2023; garnered significant interest.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep learning approach integrating histology and genomic data for pan-cancer analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Trending topic, e.g., late image-omics fusion models.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-008</data>
