<node id="Chatbots">
  <data key="d0">Chatbots</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">AI conversational tools that garnered significant interest in oncology research.&lt;SEP&gt;AI technique (including ChatGPT and LLMs) included in this paper's search strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;Conversational AI systems. Research question RQ5 examines how they align with the objectives of P4 medicine.&lt;SEP&gt;Conversational systems whose performance relies on NLU, response generation, and conversation context management.&lt;SEP&gt;Conversational AI systems that provide detailed and coherent responses in dialogue. The text presents them as promising tools for legal understanding and contract drafting.&lt;SEP&gt;AI-powered conversational agents whose development and deployment for tasks such as business support, education and legal advice has increased because of advances in artificial intelligence.&lt;SEP&gt;Conversational agents. They are the central topic of many references in the list ([20]-[28]).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_25_66701.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
