<node id="P4 medicine has evolved enormously in recent years">
  <data key="d0">P4 medicine has evolved enormously in recent years</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Recent years have witnessed an enormous evolution of P4 medicine personalized, preventive, predictive, and participatory healthcare (Hood &amp; Friend, 2011).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-000</data>
