  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Materials used in recent advancements in flexible electronic sensors for wearables.&lt;SEP&gt;Materials with exceptional mechanical properties, conductivity and close resemblance to human tissue. They make flexible electronic sensors suitable for monitoring human health.</data>
