  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Materials used in recent advancements in flexible electronic sensors for wearables.&lt;SEP&gt;Materials with exceptional mechanical properties and conductivity. They make flexible electronic sensors suitable for monitoring human health.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-007</data>
