<node id="Co-Authorship Network">
  <data key="d0">Co-Authorship Network</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Network analysis of author collaboration used in the bibliometric study. In this network, Kather JN held a central position.&lt;SEP&gt;Network of author collaboration, measured using centrality.&lt;SEP&gt;Collaboration network of co-authors who work together, shown in Fig. 11. WANG Y has the highest number of co-authors in this network.</data>
