  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Problem of merging the Scopus, WoS and PubMed datasets despite their different tagging systems (for example, "Author" in Scopus versus "AU" in WoS) and removing duplicate records. CiteSpace resolved the problem, and 1296 papers remained after cleansing.</data>
