<node id="Research output grew 101.05% between 2022 and 2023">
  <data key="d0">Research output grew 101.05% between 2022 and 2023</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The most pronounced increase was observed between 2022-2023, where the growth rate surged to 101.05% suggesting a significant expansion in research output.</data>
