  <data key="d0">A. B. Arrieta</data>
  <data key="d1">author</data>
  <data key="d2">Listed as ARRIETA AB; first author of the 2020 Information Fusion paper on explainable AI, which is the most globally cited document (2817 citations). The text gives only the initials AB, so the full first name is not known. This entry corrects the earlier entity named "Ali Arrieta".</data>
