  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Probabilistic method (CRF) integrated with ResUNet++ to improve generalizability.&lt;SEP&gt;CRF; integrated with ResUNet++ to improve cross-dataset performance in colorectal cancer detection.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-006</data>
