  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Technique (TTA) integrated with ResUNet++ to improve cross-dataset performance.&lt;SEP&gt;TTA; integrated with ResUNet++ to improve cross-dataset performance in colorectal cancer detection.&lt;SEP&gt;Inference technique used together with ResUNet++ for colorectal polyp segmentation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-010</data>
