<node id="ChatDoctor">
  <data key="d0">ChatDoctor</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Adaptation of LLaMA trained on 100,000 anonymized patient-doctor dialogues with self-directed retrieval from Wikipedia and medical databases; improved understanding of patient needs and medical advice accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Large language model mentioned in the context of LLMs in oncology, introduced in contrast to the limitations of ChatGPT and Google Bard (text truncated).&lt;SEP&gt;A medical chat model fine-tuned on LLaMA (Large Language Model Meta-AI) using medical domain knowledge.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-011</data>
