<node id="Data Privacy">
  <data key="d0">Data Privacy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Preservation of patient data privacy, achieved by federated learning through multi-institutional training without centralizing patient data.&lt;SEP&gt;Privacy and confidentiality concerns that limit access to financial and healthcare data; GANs help enhance data privacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Concern in financial data sharing and synthesis; addressed by privacy-preserving generative models such as DGAN and by cGAN-based synthetic transaction data.&lt;SEP&gt;Protection of customer data from privacy attacks, ensured by the PPCCP model while maintaining prediction accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Protection of data and privacy, discussed in big data security work and as a dimension of the tabular data generation survey.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_25_66701.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Vol.13.No.7.13.pdf</data>
