  <data key="d2">In another study, two experienced surgeons found that 86.4% of ChatGPT's responses to 154 head and neck cancer-related questions were accurate and comprehensive, while 11% were partially correct, and 2.6% were mixed, with no entirely incorrect responses (Kuşcu et al., 2023).</data>
