  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">For instance, to predict survival in breast cancer patients, a Multimodal Affinity Fusion Network (MAFN) has demonstrated significant advantages over single-data approaches... (Guo et al., 2021).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-006</data>
