  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">further highlighted the challenges associated with large language models, such as ChatGPT -4, ChatGPT-3.5, and Google Bard, revealing issues of inaccuracy and incompleteness in their responses, even though these models show promise as tools in immuno -oncology (Iannantuono et al., 2024).</data>
