  <data key="d0">Pathfinders in oncology from ancient times to the end of the Middle Ages</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Paper by S. I. Hajdu (2016), published in Cancer, 122(11), 1638–1646. It covers the history of oncology from ancient times to the end of the Middle Ages.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-010</data>
