  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Paper by L. Hood and S. H. Friend (2011), published in Nature Reviews Clinical Oncology, 8(3), 184–187. It describes P4 (predictive, personalized, preventive, participatory) cancer medicine.</data>
