<node id="The Evolution and Impact of Artificial Intelligence in Market Analysis: A Quantitative Bibliometric Exploration of the Past Thirty-Five (35) Years">
  <data key="d0">The Evolution and Impact of Artificial Intelligence in Market Analysis: A Quantitative Bibliometric Exploration of the Past Thirty-Five (35) Years</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Article published in Applied Computer Science 2025, vol. 21, no. 1, pp. 83–96, by Donalson Wilson and Abdellah Azmani. It examines the evolution and impact of AI applications in market analysis through a bibliometric study of 4,051 Scopus documents over 35 years, finding exponential growth in output since 2010, with India, China, and the USA leading.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_AIapplicationinmarketanalysis.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423294</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="10.35784/acs_6590">
  <data key="d0">10.35784/acs_6590</data>
  <data key="d1">identifier</data>
  <data key="d2">DOI of the bibliometric study on AI in market analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_AIapplicationinmarketanalysis.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423294</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Market Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Market Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Research topic studied in combination with AI in the bibliometric analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Study of markets including market trend analysis, market segmentation, consumer behavior, and competitive analysis; traditional techniques have limitations in exploiting hidden information in data.&lt;SEP&gt;A search term family that includes market forecasting, market research, market trends, market segmentation, competitive analysis, consumer behavior and economic forecasting.&lt;SEP&gt;The area of marketing examined in This Paper with respect to AI applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Research domain covering market trend analysis, market segmentation, consumer behavior and competitive analysis, examined for AI applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_AIapplicationinmarketanalysis.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423294</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
