  <data key="d0">AI-Driven Market Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Application of AI techniques to market analysis; research output has grown exponentially since 2010, led by India, China, and the USA.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_AIapplicationinmarketanalysis.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423294</data>
