<node id="AI was first introduced by John McCarthy at the Dartmouth conference in 1955">
  <data key="d0">AI was first introduced by John McCarthy at the Dartmouth conference in 1955</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "First introduced by John McCarthy at the Dartmouth College conference in 1955 (McCarthy et al., 1955; Solomonoff, 1985), the concept of artificial intelligence (AI) has undergone significant evolution."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_AIapplicationinmarketanalysis.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423294</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Researchers' work in machine learning and deep learning drove growing AI application">
  <data key="d0">Researchers' work in machine learning and deep learning drove growing AI application</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "For decades, with technological advancements and the work of numerous researchers such as (Goodfellow et al., 2014; LeCun et al., 1989; McCulloch &amp; Pitts, 1943; Rosenblatt, 1957; Samuel, 2000), and others, particularly in machine learning, deep learning, and other branches of AI, there has been a growing application of AI in almost every field of activity."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_AIapplicationinmarketanalysis.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423294</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
