  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited work by Moher et al. (2009) that introduced the PRISMA method (Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic Reviews and Meta-Analyses), an evidence-based minimal set of items for reporting systematic reviews and meta-analyses with an emphasis on transparency and completeness.</data>
