<node id="Closeness Centrality">
  <data key="d0">Closeness Centrality</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Centrality metric referring to entities with extensive connections within the network.&lt;SEP&gt;Network centrality metric used to rank authors and papers. Vaswani A. scores highest among authors (0.0167), and Blei D.M. 2003 and Chevalier J.A. 2006 score highest among papers (0.2).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-006</data>
