  <data key="d2">Task of stock market analysis and prediction addressed using deep learning networks.&lt;SEP&gt;Problem of forecasting stock market trends, covered by Wen et al. (2019) using high-order time series information and by Thakkar and Chaudhari (2021) in their survey of deep neural networks for the stock market.&lt;SEP&gt;Prediction of stock and broad-index movements such as Dow30 and S&amp;P 500.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-008</data>
