<node id="A small percentage of authors produce most publications">
  <data key="d0">A small percentage of authors produce most publications</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Lotka's Law describes the distribution of scientific productivity among authors, indicating that a small percentage of authors account for a large proportion of the total published works, while a larger percentage of authors contribute fewer articles.</data>
