  <data key="d0">Scientific Production</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Key metric for assessing the evolution of research on AI applications in market analysis; it increased exponentially from 2010 to 2023.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_AIapplicationinmarketanalysis.pdf</data>
