  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Scientific production on AI in market analysis grew exponentially from 2010 to 2023">
  <data key="d0">Scientific production on AI in market analysis grew exponentially from 2010 to 2023</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding stated in the text: "The results of this research demonstrate that scientific production, a key metric for assessing the evolution of research on AI applications in market analysis has increased exponentially from 2010 to 2023."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_AIapplicationinmarketanalysis.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423294</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="India, China and the USA lead AI research in market analysis">
  <data key="d0">India, China and the USA lead AI research in market analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding stated in the text: "Among the countries contributing significantly to the evolution of AI in market analysis, India, China, and the USA are at the forefront."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_AIapplicationinmarketanalysis.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423294</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="First comprehensive bibliometric analysis of AI in market analysis">
  <data key="d0">First comprehensive bibliometric analysis of AI in market analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Assertion made in the text: "To our knowledge, this is the first bibliometric analysis that comprehensively covers various aspects of market analysis, such as market trend analysis, market segmentation, consumer behavior and competitive analysis."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_AIapplicationinmarketanalysis.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423294</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Search keywords may have influenced the Scopus-based results">
  <data key="d0">Search keywords may have influenced the Scopus-based results</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Limitation stated in the text: "Despite the strong findings captured in this study, it is important to note that the keywords used to collect data from the Scopus database may have influenced the results." Future research could use different sets of keywords and multiple databases.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">acs_AIapplicationinmarketanalysis.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423294</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
