  <data key="d0">More Than Words: Social Networks' Text Mining for Consumer Brand Sentiments</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Mostafa (2013), published in Expert Systems with Applications 40(10), 4241-4251. It applies text mining of social network data to consumer brand sentiment.</data>
