<node id="A Hybrid Approach for Sales Forecasting: Combining Deep Learning and Time Series Analysis">
  <data key="d0">A Hybrid Approach for Sales Forecasting: Combining Deep Learning and Time Series Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read, published in International Journal of Engineering, Transactions A: Basics, Vol. 38 No. 04 (April 2025), pp. 859-870. It introduces a hybrid sales forecasting model combining LSTM, SARIMA and Holt-Winters. Under MAPE, the hybrid model outperforms LSTM, SARIMA and Holt-Winters by 9%, 39% and 43%, respectively.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="S. Idiri">
  <data key="d0">S. Idiri</data>
  <data key="d1">author</data>
  <data key="d2">Co-author of the hybrid sales forecasting paper, affiliated with the Intelligent Automation and BioMedGenomics Laboratory, Abdelmalek Essaadi University.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="International Journal of Engineering, Transactions A: Basics">
  <data key="d0">International Journal of Engineering, Transactions A: Basics</data>
  <data key="d1">venue</data>
  <data key="d2">Journal (IJE, homepage www.ije.ir) that published the hybrid sales forecasting paper in Vol. 38 No. 04, April 2025.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
