<node id="Moving Average">
  <data key="d0">Moving Average</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Traditional time series forecasting model listed alongside exponential smoothing, autoregressive and ARIMA models.&lt;SEP&gt;Statistical technique calculating the average of a sliding window of data points to detect shifts or trends in process behavior.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Autoregressive Model">
  <data key="d0">Autoregressive Model</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Traditional time series forecasting model listed among the fundamental models for analyzing and predicting data trends.&lt;SEP&gt;AR(p) model where each observation is predicted as a weighted sum of its previous p observations plus a random error.&lt;SEP&gt;AR(p) model component represented by a polynomial of order p in the backshift operator.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423541</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Seasonal Naïve Method">
  <data key="d0">Seasonal Naïve Method</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Seasonal forecasting technique that Deepa and Raghuram used among their time series forecasting methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423541</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
