<node id="Hybrid Forecasting Model">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Forecasting Model</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Novel hybrid model that integrates LSTM, SARIMA and Holt-Winters for forecasting daily retail sales.&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid model proposed in the article by I. Boukrouh et al. that integrates LSTM, SARIMA and Winters-Holt. The final forecast is computed as Ŷt_final = Ŷt + Êt + R̂t, which adds the LSTM predictions, the SARIMA-modeled residual errors and the predicted adjusted residuals.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-008</data>
