<node id="Forget Gate">
  <data key="d0">Forget Gate</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">LSTM gate that decides how much of the previous cell state is retained, ranging from 0 (complete rejection) to 1 (complete keeping).&lt;SEP&gt;LSTM gate that decides whether to retain or discard the prior cell state using a sigmoid activation over the input and previous hidden state, yielding a value between 0 and 1.&lt;SEP&gt;LSTM gate computing f_t = σ(W_fx x_t + W_fh h_{t-1} + b_f) using the sigmoid function.&lt;SEP&gt;First LSTM cell component; it decides whether to retain or discard the prior cell state c_{t−1}. It processes input x_t and previous hidden state h_{t−1} through a sigmoid to produce f_t.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426328</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cell State">
  <data key="d0">Cell State</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">LSTM internal memory that integrates information by filtering the previous cell state with the forget gate and adding new information via the input gate and cell input activation.&lt;SEP&gt;Internal memory of the LSTM, updated with new information through the input gate and cell input activation.&lt;SEP&gt;Long-term memory state incorporated into LSTM to enhance the short-term memory capacity of recurrent neural networks; the prior cell state c(t-1) is retained or discarded by the forget gate.&lt;SEP&gt;Long-term memory state of the LSTM, c_t, which is updated through the forget and input gates; LSTM adds cell states to RNNs to extend memory.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426328</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
