<node id="Dataset selection depends on availability, confidentiality, and data size">
  <data key="d0">Dataset selection depends on availability, confidentiality, and data size</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "Several criteria must be considered when selecting a dataset for research, such as its availability, data confidentiality, and the size of data (12)."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-008</data>
