  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "This comparison underscores the effectiveness of the hybrid approach in achieving enhanced forecasting accuracy and demonstrates its advantages over existing forecasting models."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-011</data>
