<node id="Hybrid SARIMA-Holt-Winters-LSTM Model">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid SARIMA-Holt-Winters-LSTM Model</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Hybrid model for forecasting daily sales that combines SARIMA, Holt-Winters and LSTM. LSTM captures data complexity, SARIMA and Holt-Winters account for seasonality, and the model gives greater importance to recent values. The paper reports that it achieves better forecast accuracy than the individual models. Its limitations include computational complexity and sensitivity to input data quality.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Retail Sales Data 2011-2023">
  <data key="d0">Retail Sales Data 2011-2023</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">Proprietary e-commerce and retail daily sales dataset covering 2011 to 2023. The paper notes that its limited size is a constraint of the study.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
