  <data key="d0">Evaluation Metrics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Several metrics the paper uses to show that the hybrid model forecasts more accurately than the individual models.&lt;SEP&gt;A key challenge in applying GANs to financial data generation, concerning how the quality of generated data is assessed.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-010</data>
