  <data key="d0">Hybrid model outperforms individual models in sales forecast accuracy</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "the superior forecast accuracy of the hybrid model compared to individual models was demonstrated by using several evaluation metrics."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
