  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hybrid model superiority stems from combining LSTM complexity capture with SARIMA and Holt-Winters seasonality">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid model superiority stems from combining LSTM complexity capture with SARIMA and Holt-Winters seasonality</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "This superiority can be attributed to its ability to encapsulate the complexity of the data using LSTM, account for seasonality using SARIMA and Holt-Winters, and give greater importance to recent values over older ones. The new approach addresses the drawbacks found in each method when used separately."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Forecast shows a sales peak on January 3, 2024">
  <data key="d0">Forecast shows a sales peak on January 3, 2024</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding stated in the text: "The forecasts for the New Year period of 2023-2024 show significant fluctuations, with a particularly high peak on January 3, 2024." Table 4 lists forecasts for N=5 days, from December 31, 2023 to January 04, 2024. It also gives sales for the same dates in each year from 2011 to 2023.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-Day Sales Forecast">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Day Sales Forecast</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Procedure in which the hybrid model predicts sales for the next N days. It is applied with N=5, covering December 31, 2023 to January 04, 2024. The forecasts are compared chronologically with sales for the same dates from 2011 to 2023 (Table 4).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Input Data Quality Sensitivity">
  <data key="d0">Input Data Quality Sensitivity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Limitation of the hybrid model: inaccurate or incomplete input data can significantly reduce forecasting accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dataset Size Limitation">
  <data key="d0">Dataset Size Limitation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Limitation of the study: access to larger datasets was restricted because e-commerce sales data is proprietary. Future work will validate the model on more extensive and diverse datasets, partly through collaboration with industry partners.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cloud-Based Solutions">
  <data key="d0">Cloud-Based Solutions</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Approach planned for future research to reduce the computational demands of the hybrid model.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Missing or Noisy Data Handling">
  <data key="d0">Missing or Noisy Data Handling</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Robust preprocessing methods planned for future research to make the model more resilient and reliable when data is missing or noisy.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Product-Level Sales Forecasting">
  <data key="d0">Product-Level Sales Forecasting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Future research direction: segment the data by product and customize the model for each segment. The aim is to improve demand prediction, inventory management and marketing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="External Sales Factors">
  <data key="d0">External Sales Factors</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Factors such as weather, holidays, promotions and customer demographics. Future research proposes adding them to improve the model's predictive power.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Promotions">
  <data key="d0">Promotions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Promotional activities that should be planned using the forecasts. Promotions are also proposed as an external factor to add to the model.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Demand Prediction">
  <data key="d0">Demand Prediction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Prediction of product demand, which product-level model customization aims to improve.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="E-commerce Data Sharing">
  <data key="d0">E-commerce Data Sharing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Proposed future exploration of ways to make e-commerce data more available and shareable, so the model can be validated more thoroughly.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
