<node id="Hybrid Forecasting Approach">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Forecasting Approach</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">The hybrid sales forecasting model in This Paper. Planned refinements include adding external factors and testing on diverse industry datasets. The paper suggests the approach could apply beyond retail, for example in finance and healthcare.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
