<node id="Market Management">
  <data key="d0">Market Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Management activity that benefits significantly from the hybrid model's improved forecasting accuracy, because the model provides more reliable sales forecasts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Customer Preference Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Customer Preference Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Analysis of customer preferences that sales forecasting enables suppliers to perform, which helps them optimize profit, reduce costs and minimize product returns.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Forecasting Accuracy">
  <data key="d0">Forecasting Accuracy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Accuracy of sales predictions, which the hybrid model improves over its individual components as measured by MAPE.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
