  <data key="d0">IJE Transactions A: Basics</data>
  <data key="d1">venue</data>
  <data key="d2">IJE Transactions A: Basics, formally known as the International Journal of Engineering, Transactions A: Basics, is the academic journal that published the research article authored by I. Boukrouh et al. The article, also referred to as "This Paper," appeared in Volume 38, Issue No. 04, in the April 2025 edition of the journal.

The Boukrouh et al. article occupies pages 859-870 of that issue. IJE Transactions A: Basics therefore serves as the publication venue and bibliographic source for this work, providing the citation details used to reference the article.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-013</data>
