<node id="SARIMA">
  <data key="d0">SARIMA</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">SARIMA (Seasonal Autoregressive Integrated Moving Average) is a classical statistical time series forecasting model from the Box-Jenkins methodology. It generalizes ARMA models to non-stationary processes that show both trend and seasonality, which makes it suited to linear trends, seasonal fluctuations, and cyclic patterns. It is a standard tool for seasonal time series forecasting. It is cited in several works, including references 17 and 21, and reference 39 compares it with LSTM for retail demand forecasting.

In the study described, SARIMA serves two roles in daily sales forecasting. First, it is a traditional baseline applied directly to the sales series, using the specification SARIMA (2, 1, 1)(2, 0, 2)7, where the seasonal period of 7 reflects weekly patterns. Second, it is a component of the proposed hybrid model, where it models the residual errors of LSTM predictions with the specification SARIMA (2, 1, 2)(1, 0, 1)7. In this role it captures the linear trends, seasonality, and cyclic structure left in the LSTM residuals. Both SARIMA models are validated through residual diagnostics.

As a standalone baseline, SARIMA was outperformed by the proposed hybrid model, which achieved a 39% improvement over it. This result shows the benefit of combining SARIMA's handling of seasonality with LSTM's modeling of nonlinear patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;Seasonal ARIMA model from the Box-Jenkins family, used for time series sales forecasting.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-44e660d542a189a6d2b6161acf6e6b98-chunk-000</data>
