<node id="Comparative Studies of the SARIMA and LSTM Models for Sales Forecasting of a Product Category in a Marketplace">
  <data key="d0">Comparative Studies of the SARIMA and LSTM Models for Sales Forecasting of a Product Category in a Marketplace</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read, presented at ICRAMCS 2022 (Casablanca, March 24-26, 2022). It compares Box-Jenkins SARIMA models to LSTM recurrent neural networks for predicting sales of a product category in a marketplace, with and without exogenous variables (sales, holidays, seasons), using RMSE and MAPE to evaluate performance.</data>
