<node id="Ref [11]">
  <data key="d0">Ref [11]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [11]; reference for Boruta-ERT.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [11] for Boruta effectiveness and Boruta-ERT.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [11]; reference on Generative AI capabilities in software development.&lt;SEP&gt;Work cited as [11] for using advancements in artificial intelligence and natural language processing to improve system efficiency and accessibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited work on external and internal attacks, noting internal attacks by selfish nodes are difficult to predict.&lt;SEP&gt;Proposes CBQoS-Vanet, a clustering and artificial bee colony based routing protocol.&lt;SEP&gt;Related work in Table 1 that optimizes routes to improve QoS in VANET. Its metrics are throughput, average E2ED, jitter, packet delivery ratio and dropped ratio.</data>
