  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ref [12]">
  <data key="d0">Ref [12]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [12]; reference for XGBoost integrated with Boruta.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [12] for Boruta effectiveness and integration with XGBoost.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [12]; reference on vendor lock-in in LCNC solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Work cited as [12] for using advancements in artificial intelligence and natural language processing to improve system efficiency and accessibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited work providing the classification of various types of attacks by source and behavior (Table 1).&lt;SEP&gt;Proposes GeoQoE-Vanet, a geographic protocol for video streaming.&lt;SEP&gt;Related work on improving the quality of received video, using the metrics delay, jitter and packet loss rate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
