  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [18]. Sara Nasiri et al., 2024; focuses on Digital Twin modeling for smart injection molding with interconnected process stages, covering fault detection, 3D printing and system integration for predictive manufacturing.</data>
