  <data key="d2">Cited as [19]. F. J. Lacueva-Perez et al., 2012; introduces a cloud-based Digital Twin for injection molding using AI to control process parameters and predict part quality in real time, validated industrially but facing cloud-centric IoT challenges.</data>
