<node id="Process Stability">
  <data key="d0">Process Stability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Stability of the injection molding process, predicted through LSTM forecasting of the melt cushion.&lt;SEP&gt;Stability of manufacturing process parameters monitored via control charts.&lt;SEP&gt;Stability of the production process, whose evaluation in SPC relies on data normality.&lt;SEP&gt;Stability of the injection molding process. It is monitored through control charts and indicated by the Cushion parameter; prediction covers both quality and machine defects.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56015fdaac28ae50466d3ddc4439d39b-chunk-000</data>
