<node id="Melt Cushion Dataset">
  <data key="d0">Melt Cushion Dataset</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">6000 observations of the melt cushion parameter collected from an Arburg GmbH 150T machine; 20% used for offline LSTM training.&lt;SEP&gt;Dataset of 2978 observations derived from the X-Bar control chart, split into 80% training and 20% validation; the testing data includes production anomalies.&lt;SEP&gt;Dataset of normal training samples and anomalous testing samples of the Melt cushion parameter, used to train and test the LSTM-AE model.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-012</data>
