  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Experimental procedure comparing four tuning iterations (Tune 1 to Tune 4) of a two-layer LSTM model; Tunes 1-3 used 50 units per layer while Tune 4 used 100 units in the second layer and achieved superior performance.</data>
