<node id="Genetic Algorithms">
  <data key="d0">Genetic Algorithms</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Optimization approach suggested as future work for closing the final loop of the Digital Twin.&lt;SEP&gt;Listed by study [9] as a method used for road traffic accident forecasting, cited with [11], [12], [13].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-001</data>
