  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [2]. Written by F. Tayalati, A. Azmani and M. Azmani and published in Prog. Artif. Intell., 2024. It applies supervised ML to predict cooling time in injection molding.&lt;SEP&gt;Reference [17]. F. Tayalati, A. Azmani and M. Azmani, Prog. Artif. Intell., pp. 1–17, April 2024. Applies supervised machine learning to predict the cooling time parameter in injection molding.&lt;SEP&gt;Reference 3. A 2024 article by Tayalati, Azmani and Azmani in Progress in Artificial Intelligence that applies supervised machine learning to predict the cooling time parameter in injection molding.&lt;SEP&gt;Reference 3. Tayalati F, Azmani A and Azmani M, Progress in Artificial Intelligence, 2024, pages 1-17. Applies supervised machine learning to predict the cooling time parameter in injection molding.&lt;SEP&gt;Reference [1]; Tayalati, Azmani, Azmani, Progress in Artificial Intelligence, 2024; predicts cooling time in injection molding with supervised machine learning.</data>
