<node id="Prediction of hot-rolled strip crown based on Boruta and extremely randomized trees algorithms">
  <data key="d0">Prediction of hot-rolled strip crown based on Boruta and extremely randomized trees algorithms</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [11]. A 2023 paper by L. Wang, S. He, Z. Zhao and X. Zhang in the Journal of Iron and Steel Research International (vol. 30, no. 5, pp. 1022–1031). It predicts hot-rolled strip crown using Boruta feature selection and extremely randomized trees.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">CIST_174.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423736</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="A novel feature susceptibility approach for a PEMFC control system based on an improved XGBoost-Boruta algorithm">
  <data key="d0">A novel feature susceptibility approach for a PEMFC control system based on an improved XGBoost-Boruta algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [12]. A 2023 paper by X. Yuan, F. Chen, Z. Xia, Z. Hou and others in Energy AI (vol. 12, p. 100229). It proposes a feature susceptibility approach for PEMFC control systems based on an improved XGBoost-Boruta algorithm.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">CIST_174.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423736</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Spatio-Temporal Variation Analysis of Soil Salinization in the Ougan-Kuqa River Oasis of China">
  <data key="d0">Spatio-Temporal Variation Analysis of Soil Salinization in the Ougan-Kuqa River Oasis of China</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [13]. A 2024 paper by D. Du, B. He, X. Luo, S. Ma, Y. Song and W. Yang in Sustainability (vol. 16, no. 7). It analyzes spatio-temporal variation of soil salinization in the Ougan-Kuqa River Oasis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">CIST_174.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423736</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Feature Selection with the Boruta Package">
  <data key="d0">Feature Selection with the Boruta Package</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [14]. A 2010 paper by M. B. Kursa and W. R. Rudnicki in the Journal of Statistical Software (vol. 36, no. 11, pp. 1–13). It describes the Boruta package for feature selection.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">CIST_174.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423736</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Churn Prediction in Banking System using K-Means, LOF, and CBLOF">
  <data key="d0">Churn Prediction in Banking System using K-Means, LOF, and CBLOF</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [16]. A 2019 paper by I. Ullah, H. Hussain, I. Ali and A. Liaquat at the 1st International Conference on Electrical, Communication and Computer Engineering (ICECCE 2019), published by IEEE. It addresses churn prediction in banking using K-Means, LOF and CBLOF.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">CIST_174.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423736</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hyperparameter Tuning for Machine Learning Algorithms Used for Arabic Sentiment Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Hyperparameter Tuning for Machine Learning Algorithms Used for Arabic Sentiment Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [17]. A 2021 paper by E. Elgeldawi, A. Sayed, A. R. Galal and A. M. Zaki in Informatics (vol. 8, no. 4, p. 79). It studies hyperparameter tuning of machine learning algorithms for Arabic sentiment analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">CIST_174.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791423736</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
