<node id="AHP and TOPSIS are prominent classical machine selection methods">
  <data key="d0">AHP and TOPSIS are prominent classical machine selection methods</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Among the prominent methods are the analytical hierarchy process (AHP) [4], [5] and the technique for order preference by similarity to ideal solution (TOPSIS) [6].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
