  <data key="d0">Stochastic Gradient Descent Classifier</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">SGD classifier used for machine selection prediction.&lt;SEP&gt;SGD algorithm used to find parameter values minimizing a cost function; widely applied in discriminative learning with linear classifiers and effective with convex loss functions such as SVM and LR.&lt;SEP&gt;SGD classifier used in the study. It was the only model that correctly identified machine 320 t for the second new part.</data>
