  <data key="d2">Phase of the injection molding process in which the plastic is injected into the mold.&lt;SEP&gt;The injection phase, in which the screw introduces plastic into the mold through filling channels. It lasts a few seconds, and pressures range from a few hundred to a thousand bars.</data>
