</node>
<node id="Clamping Force">
  <data key="d0">Clamping Force</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Force required to ensure proper closing and holding of the mold; must be within the machine's maximum clamping force capacity.&lt;SEP&gt;The maximum force needed to clamp and hold the mold, measured in kilo-newtons or tons. It is used to assign machine size.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425062</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Opening Stroke">
  <data key="d0">Opening Stroke</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Machine opening capacity directly impacted by part dimensions, critical for successful part ejection after solidification.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425062</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Pressure">
  <data key="d0">Injection Pressure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Machine maximum injection pressure capacity, affected by part thickness; thinner parts necessitate higher injection pressure.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425062</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Production Rate">
  <data key="d0">Production Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Capacity of the chosen machine to meet rates aligned with customer demand; facilitates sizing of the injection unit.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425062</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dosing And Plasticizing Phase">
  <data key="d0">Dosing And Plasticizing Phase</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Phase of the injection molding process in which material is dosed and plasticized before injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
