  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425063</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PA6">
  <data key="d0">PA6</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Polyamide material type included in the material_data of the dataset.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425063</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Clamping force is moderately correlated with part weight">
  <data key="d0">Clamping force is moderately correlated with part weight</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding in the text: "Furthermore, the correlation coefficient indicates that clamping force is influenced by features associated also with part weight, with a positive coefficient of (0.591) for total part weight and (0.4) for part weight."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425064</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Material features show low correlation with clamping force">
  <data key="d0">Material features show low correlation with clamping force</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding in the text: "On the other hand, features related to plastic types, such as density, melt flow, and material type, demonstrate lower correlations."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425064</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Small molds are allocated to smaller machines and large molds to larger machines">
  <data key="d0">Small molds are allocated to smaller machines and large molds to larger machines</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding in the text: "It is highly likely that small molds are addressed to smaller machine sizes, while large molds are allocated to larger machine sizes." Figure 4 shows machine allocation according to mold size.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425064</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Correlation Matrix">
  <data key="d0">Correlation Matrix</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Matrix of correlation coefficients between clamping force and the dataset features. It confirms a significant relationship between clamping force and mold dimensions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425064</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
