<node id="Mold Size and Part Weight Drive Machine Allocation">
  <data key="d0">Mold Size and Part Weight Drive Machine Allocation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding from the initial cross-check of the dataset: features associated with both the size of the mold and the total weight of the plastic part exert a significant impact on machine allocation decisions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-006</data>
