</node>
<node id="Machine Learning-Assisted Decision Support in Industrial">
  <data key="d0">Machine Learning-Assisted Decision Support in Industrial</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read (title truncated in header), authored by Faouzi Tayalati, published in Int J Artif Intell Vol. 14, No. 1, February 2025, pages 270-285. It describes classification models including Naive Bayes, SGD classifier, logistic regression and SVM, evaluated with a confusion matrix and performance metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being read, by Faouzi Tayalati, published in Int J Artif Intell (ISSN 2252-8938). It evaluates six machine learning models (RF, SVM, DT, NB, LR, SGD) for predicting industrial machine classes, using confusion matrix and learning curve analyses.&lt;SEP&gt;Article by Faouzi Tayalati published in Int J Artif Intell, Vol. 14, No. 1, February 2025, pages 270-285; trains six machine learning models (RF, DT, SVM, NB, LR, SGD classifier) on a dataset of molds and parts to select machines, evaluating them with accuracy, precision, recall, F1-score, confusion matrices and learning curves.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being read, by Faouzi Tayalati, published in Int J Artif Intell Vol. 14, No. 1, February 2025, pages 270-285. It compares ML models (LR, NB, SGD, SVM, DT, RF) via learning curves and interprets RF, DT and SVM predictions with LIME for allocating plastic molding jobs to machines.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being read, by Faouzi Tayalati, published in Int J Artif Intell, Vol. 14, No. 1, February 2025, pages 270-285. It employs supervised ML algorithms (RF, DT, SVM, SGD, LR, NB) to forecast optimal injection molding machine selection for new plastic parts, uses LIME analysis for interpretability, and validates the models on two new parts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425064</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
