  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [9]. Written by C. Fernandes, A. J. Pontes, J. C. Viana and A. Gaspar-Cunha and published in March 2018 in Advances in Polymer Technology, vol. 37, no. 2, pp. 429-449. It reviews modeling and optimization of injection molding.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">document.pdf</data>
