  <data key="d2">Reference [10]. Written by S. K. Selvaraj, A. Raj, R. R. Mahadevan, U. Chadha and V. Paramasivam and published in January 2022 in Advances in Materials Science and Engineering, vol. 2022, pp. 1-28. It reviews machine learning models for injection molding machines.</data>
