  <data key="d0">Experimental Test Campaigns</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Structured experimental methodology of three test campaigns analyzing endorsement policy effects, block size and timeout tuning, and scalability with respect to peers per organization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Configuration_Driven_Performance_Analysis_of_Hyper.pdf</data>
