  <data key="d0">3D Performance Surface Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Experimental analysis shown in Figure 5. It visualizes throughput (tx/s) and P50 latency (ms) as functions of block size (roughly 40 to 200) and timeout (roughly 40 to 200 ms).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Configuration_Driven_Performance_Analysis_of_Hyper.pdf</data>
