  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The relationship between throughput (tx/s) and P95 latency (ms) that the figures visualize across configurations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Configuration_Driven_Performance_Analysis_of_Hyper.pdf</data>
