  <data key="d2">Configuration parameter B, inferred from the label B100T50 (B=100). Together with the timeout T, it defines the configurations compared in the throughput-latency figure.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-010</data>
