  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">The full set of evaluated batch-size and timeout configurations. The figure plots them against the highlighted B100T50 configuration in throughput (tx/s, about 150-450) versus P95 latency (ms, about 800-2400) space.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Configuration_Driven_Performance_Analysis_of_Hyper.pdf</data>
