  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Experiment C3 evaluating how Hyperledger Fabric performance evolves with 1, 2, 4, 6 and 8 peers per organization; latencies remain stable at 1–4 peers and increase significantly at 6–8 peers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Configuration_Driven_Performance_Analysis_of_Hyper.pdf</data>
