</node>
<node id="P99 Latency">
  <data key="d0">P99 Latency</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">99th percentile latency metric used in the C3 scalability experiment. Under the OR policy it ranged from 592 ms to 769 ms with 1–4 peers per organization. It was reported as 1566 ms with 4 peers per organization and reached 27075 ms at 8 peers per organization.&lt;SEP&gt;99th percentile latency metric; it reaches 2163 ms with 6 peers per organization under the AND policy.&lt;SEP&gt;The 99th percentile transaction latency in milliseconds, reported in Table 5 of the scalability analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Configuration_Driven_Performance_Analysis_of_Hyper.pdf</data>
