</node>
<node id="Optimal Configuration Block Size 100 Timeout 50 Ms">
  <data key="d0">Optimal Configuration Block Size 100 Timeout 50 Ms</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding summarized in Table 4: "the same configuration appears as best throughput, best P95, and best efficiency". That configuration is block size 100 with a 50 ms timeout, giving 448.5 tx/s, a P95 latency of 731 ms and an efficiency ratio of 1.6.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-011</data>
