  <data key="d0">Throughput Degradation</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">A performance metric for the percentage loss in throughput. It is plotted as one of two series, alongside P95 Latency, on a 'Degradation (%)' axis across the B/T configurations. The chart's degradation values span about 37.6% to 219.5% across both series, and the extracted text does not show which values belong to throughput.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-013</data>
