  <data key="d0">B/T Configuration Sweep</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A set of experimental configurations combining B and T values of 50, 100 and 200: B50T50, B100T50, B200T50, B50T100, B100T100, B200T100, B50T200, B100T200 and B200T200. Performance degradation is measured for each configuration.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-013</data>
