</node>
<node id="Transaction Endorsement">
  <data key="d0">Transaction Endorsement</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Process of validating and committing transactions by peers. Additional coordination for endorsement causes latency to increase as more peers are added.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Configuration_Driven_Performance_Analysis_of_Hyper.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425172</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sensitivity and Performance Degradation Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Sensitivity and Performance Degradation Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Analysis presented in Figure 7 of the paper, examining how performance degrades as the network configuration changes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Configuration_Driven_Performance_Analysis_of_Hyper.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425172</data>
