  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An application domain of blockchain, covered by the review papers [13] and [14].&lt;SEP&gt;Domain targeted by the Smart DLSP project. It involves producers, distributors, warehouse workers, retailers and customers, as well as freight management, digital transformation and sustainable development.</data>
