<node id="Blockchain Scalability">
  <data key="d0">Blockchain Scalability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The problem of scaling blockchain systems, surveyed from hardware to layer-two protocols in [20].&lt;SEP&gt;Open issue: growing transactions and blockchain size require large storage, limiting maintenance to admins.&lt;SEP&gt;Problem whereby increasing nodes increases transactions and blockchain file size, requiring large storage capacity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-019</data>
