<node id="IT Systems">
  <data key="d0">IT Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Information technology systems that are essential for the continuous availability of digital services. They are vulnerable to failures of critical components such as the CPU, RAM, GPU and hard disks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000</data>
