</node>
<node id="IT system maintenance is critical for availability, reliability and security of digital infrastructures">
  <data key="d0">IT system maintenance is critical for availability, reliability and security of digital infrastructures</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The maintenance of IT systems has become a critical practice to ensure the availability, reliability, and security of digital infrastructures in environments increasingly dependent on information technologies (e.g., cloud-based systems, data centers) [1], [2].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425274</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Maintenance strategies are classified into corrective, preventive and predictive maintenance">
  <data key="d0">Maintenance strategies are classified into corrective, preventive and predictive maintenance</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Maintenance strategies are typically classified into three types: corrective maintenance, performed after a failure; preventive maintenance, scheduled at regular intervals; and predictive maintenance (PdM), which anticipates failures before they occur [3], [4].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425274</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PdM reduces operational costs, optimizes performance and minimizes service interruptions">
  <data key="d0">PdM reduces operational costs, optimizes performance and minimizes service interruptions</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Among these approaches, PdM has attracted significant attention due to its potential to reduce operational costs, optimize system performance, and minimize service interruptions, thus offering significant benefits in today's IT landscape [5].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425274</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Continuous monitoring of hardware components is essential for early anomaly detection">
  <data key="d0">Continuous monitoring of hardware components is essential for early anomaly detection</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuous monitoring of these components is essential for early detection of anomalies, including CPU overheating, RAM instability, GPU overload, and hard disk degradation, all of which can significantly affect system reliability and service continuity [6], [7].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425274</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Integrating Bayesian networks with fuzzy logic manages uncertainty">
  <data key="d0">Integrating Bayesian networks with fuzzy logic manages uncertainty</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The main contributions of this paper are the development of a hybrid PdM framework for IT systems that integrates Bayesian Networks (BNs) with Fuzzy Logic (FL) to manage uncertainty [8]...</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
