<node id="Three-Axiom Model Validation">
  <data key="d0">Three-Axiom Model Validation</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Validation procedure that checks three axioms to ensure the consistency and reliability of the Fuzzy Bayesian Network model. It serves as the foundation for future implementations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000</data>
