<node id="Degradation Scenarios">
  <data key="d0">Degradation Scenarios</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Six degradation scenarios generated after model validation to simulate how IT system components deteriorate.&lt;SEP&gt;Six scenarios (S1–S6) of Normal, Degraded or Critical states across CPU, RAM, GPU, hard disk and common system parameters; Scenario 6 with all parameters critical yields 99.8% probability of critical failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Six degradation scenarios evaluated to assess system performance under varying conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-013</data>
