  <data key="d0">Hard Disk</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Critical IT hardware component whose degradation can affect system reliability and service continuity.&lt;SEP&gt;Critical IT component modeled as a subnetwork. Its indicators are UltraDMA CRC error count, power-on hours and reallocation event count.</data>
