<node id="System enters a critical state once a major component fails">
  <data key="d0">System enters a critical state once a major component fails</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding of the article: "The results indicate that the system enters a critical state once a major component fails, and the risk of total system failure becomes almost certain when multiple components degrade simultaneously."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425274</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Boukhryss">
  <data key="d0">Boukhryss</data>
  <data key="d1">author</data>
  <data key="d2">Boukhryss is a researcher identified as the lead and first author (cited as "Boukhryss et al.") of at least two scholarly works on applied computational methods in information technology and data science.

The first is the article "Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components." This work uses Fuzzy Bayesian Networks to anticipate failures and support maintenance decisions for critical IT infrastructure components.

The second is an article published in the Journal of Logistics, Informatics and Service Science, Volume 13 (2026), where Boukhryss is also first author. It presents a specification-driven, configurable framework for generating synthetic tabular data, covering both sequential and GPU-accelerated generation approaches.

The descriptions do not say whether the two works share the same co-authors. Taken together, they place Boukhryss's research at the intersection of intelligent systems, probabilistic reasoning under uncertainty, and scalable data generation techniques.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-014</data>
