<node id="Bidirectional LSTM">
  <data key="d0">Bidirectional LSTM</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Deep learning network used to estimate the remaining useful life of storage devices and to detect GPU failures.&lt;SEP&gt;Recurrent neural network architecture used to estimate the remaining useful life of hard disk drives.&lt;SEP&gt;Recurrent neural network architecture used in reference [14] for estimation on hard disk drives.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-016</data>
