<node id="Three-Axiom Verification">
  <data key="d0">Three-Axiom Verification</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Structural and probabilistic validation procedure used to evaluate the framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Structural and probabilistic validation test applied to the Fuzzy Bayesian Network model.&lt;SEP&gt;Structural and probabilistic validation procedure for the Bayesian network. Axiom 2 states that changes in the probability distributions of parent nodes should produce a consistent effect on the child node. Axiom 3 states that the combined effect of all parent nodes on a child node must exceed the effect of each parent individually.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
