  <data key="d0">PdM is effective across IoT, maritime and healthcare domains</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Its effectiveness has been demonstrated across various domains, including IoT-enabled systems [9], maritime transport [10], and healthcare systems [11].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
