  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Interpretable ML predicts hard drive failures with explainable insights">
  <data key="d0">Interpretable ML predicts hard drive failures with explainable insights</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Interpretable ML models have been used to predict hardware failures in hard drives, providing both accurate prognostics and explainable insights for system operators [12].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
