  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Deep learning estimates storage RUL and detects early GPU failures">
  <data key="d0">Deep learning estimates storage RUL and detects early GPU failures</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Deep learning methods, including bidirectional LSTM networks, have been employed to estimate the remaining useful life of storage devices and detect early GPU failures under heavy workloads [13], [14].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
