  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AI hardware failure prediction improves accuracy and reduces downtime">
  <data key="d0">AI hardware failure prediction improves accuracy and reduces downtime</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">AI-powered hardware failure prediction models have also been proposed to improve detection accuracy and reduce system downtime [15].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
