  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bayesian network node with the values Normal, Warning and Critical. It is related to GPU state.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-006</data>
