<node id="Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components">
  <data key="d0">Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">"Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components" is an article by Boukhryss et al., accepted for publication in IEEE Access in 2026 (DOI 10.1109/ACCESS.2026.3685169) and licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0. It presents a hybrid predictive maintenance (PdM) framework for IT systems. The framework integrates Bayesian Networks with fuzzy logic to model causal relationships among critical components, estimate their failure risk, handle uncertainty and incomplete observations, and support maintenance decisions. The approach targets industrial IT operations where telemetry is incomplete, labeled failure data is scarce, and cold-start conditions apply.

The model covers critical IT components including the CPU, RAM, GPU, hard disk and CSP, and is designed to anticipate their critical states under degradation scenarios. Node states (Normal, Degraded, Critical) are defined through expert elicitation, which combines fuzzy expert knowledge with Bayesian network inference. The conditional probability tables (CPTs) are built using fuzzy logic. Gaussian membership functions are applied to the network nodes, and a Sugeno-type fuzzy inference system is used, with CPT entries derived from its firing strengths. The CPTs are then calibrated using Brier scores.

The Bayesian network is validated through several methods:
- three-axiom verification
- Spearman monotonicity tests
- sensitivity analyses
- scenario-based inference across six predictive degradation scenarios
- robustness assessment under CPT uncertainty using Monte Carlo uncertainty quantification

The results of the Fuzzy Bayesian Network are chained to Event Tree Analysis to evaluate maintenance strategies, forming a complete decision-support pipeline for the predictive maintenance of critical IT components.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
