</node>
<node id="A Comparative Study of Similarity Metrics for SVM-Based Recurrent Ticket Prediction">
  <data key="d0">A Comparative Study of Similarity Metrics for SVM-Based Recurrent Ticket Prediction</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read, presented at ICRAMCS 2025 in Marrakech, Morocco. It compares three Support Vector Machine methods for predicting support ticket recurrence. One method uses Jaccard similarity, one uses Cosine similarity, and one is a hybrid of SBERT and Cosine similarity. The reported accuracies are 0.7419 for Jaccard, 0.8710 for Cosine and 0.9355 for the hybrid approach.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ef486f441df72175f968e398ffdd23d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">ICRAMCS2025F.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425570</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
