</node>
<node id="Hybrid SBERT and Cosine similarity yields the best ticket recurrence accuracy">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid SBERT and Cosine similarity yields the best ticket recurrence accuracy</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding reported in the text: "The hybrid procedure of SBERT and Cosine Similarity yields the best possible accuracy at 0.9355 and identifies that the hybrid procedure significantly boosts the predictive potential of the model in predicting ticket recurrence." Jaccard reached 0.7419 and Cosine reached 0.8710.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7ef486f441df72175f968e398ffdd23d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">ICRAMCS2025F.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425570</data>
