<node id="Synthetic Financial Data">
  <data key="d0">Synthetic Financial Data</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Artificially generated financial data that mirrors real-world datasets, enabling market analysis while protecting privacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Synthetic data resembling real financial data, targeted by the review's search query and by GAN-based financial data generation.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial datasets produced by GANs that closely replicate the statistical distributions and properties of real-world financial data. These datasets preserve privacy and sensitive information and offer a viable alternative for researchers, companies, and policymakers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425821</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
