  <data key="d0">Financial Markets</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The domain studied by the review. Alongside healthcare, financial markets face significant data challenges because of privacy and confidentiality concerns. GANs are reviewed for applications across different facets of financial markets.&lt;SEP&gt;Domain presenting significant data challenges due to privacy and confidentiality concerns; the target application area of GAN-based synthetic data generation, covering stock price prediction, algorithmic trading, portfolio optimization, risk management and fraud detection.</data>
