<node id="D. Wilson">
  <data key="d0">D. Wilson</data>
  <data key="d1">author</data>
  <data key="d2">D. Wilson, identified as Donalson Wilson based on the associated email correspondence, is an author affiliated with Abdelmalek Essaâdi University. Wilson served as the corresponding author and co-author of a systematic review examining the use of Generative Adversarial Networks (GANs) in financial data generation. The review addresses GAN-based approaches for producing synthetic financial data as well as their application to market modeling.

The review article was published in IJE Transactions B: Applications, Volume 39, Issue No. 02, in February 2026, occupying pages 395–406. As corresponding author, D. Wilson acted as the primary point of contact for the publication, while also contributing as one of its co-authors.</data>
