<node id="Bibliometric analysis is quantitative while systematic review is qualitative">
  <data key="d0">Bibliometric analysis is quantitative while systematic review is qualitative</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Unlike bibliometric analysis (15), which focuses on the quantitative evolution of a research field, a systematic review emphasizes the qualitative aspects of a research field (16, 17).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
