  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">This methodology often follows the PRISMA framework (Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic Reviews and Meta-Analyses), which provides a minimal set of guidelines to help researchers rigorously report various systematic reviews and meta-analyses (18).</data>
