<node id="Synthetic Tabular Data">
  <data key="d0">Synthetic Tabular Data</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tabular data generated synthetically while maintaining variable relationships, the target of CopulaGAN.&lt;SEP&gt;Problem of generating realistic synthetic tabular data addressed by TabFairGAN and CTGAN.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificially generated tabular data used when real data is inaccessible, incomplete, or confidential.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-000</data>
