<node id="GANs were first introduced by Goodfellow and his team">
  <data key="d0">GANs were first introduced by Goodfellow and his team</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "The concept of Generative Adversarial Networks (GANs) was first introduced by Goodfellow and his team (5, 25) in their seminal article \"Generative Adversarial Networks\"."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-003</data>
