  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "This variant of GAN is designed to generate synthetic tabular data while maintaining the relationships and dependencies between variables. It uses copula functions to model the joint distribution of the data." Attributed to Kamthe et al. (13).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-003</data>
