  <data key="d2">Private Aggregation of Teacher Ensembles GAN; generates synthetic data while preserving privacy through differential privacy guarantees, suited to sensitive data such as financial data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
