<node id="Differential Privacy">
  <data key="d0">Differential Privacy</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Privacy guarantee framework used by PATE-GAN to protect sensitive data.&lt;SEP&gt;Method suggested, alongside regularization, to address overfitting in GANs.&lt;SEP&gt;Privacy guarantee framework that PATE-GAN provides for generated synthetic data.&lt;SEP&gt;Privacy-enhancing technique integrated with federated learning to protect model updates from inference attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-001</data>
