<node id="Synthetic Financial Data Generation">
  <data key="d0">Synthetic Financial Data Generation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Research topic of generating synthetic financial and market modeling data, the primary focus of the systematic review.&lt;SEP&gt;Generation of artificial financial data such as transactions and time series using generative models.&lt;SEP&gt;Generation of synthetic financial data and market modeling with GANs.&lt;SEP&gt;Generation of artificial financial data that closely mirrors real-world datasets, facilitating progress in market analysis and modeling.&lt;SEP&gt;Research topic of generating artificial financial data, such as transactions, credit histories and market data, with generative models.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-015</data>
