  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "While these papers address aspects of the subject, they fall short in exploring a wide range of GAN variants and identifying the GANs most suitable for" financial data.&lt;SEP&gt;While these papers address aspects of the subject, they fall short in exploring a wide range of GAN variants and identifying the GANs most suitable for generating financial data across various aspect of the market.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-005</data>
