  <data key="d0">Naritomi &amp; Adachi (41)</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as (41); proposes a data augmentation method using artificial market simulations based on WGANs to improve stock price prediction in high-frequency trading, trained on Tokyo Stock Exchange FLEX Full data.</data>
