<node id="GANs have limited ability to model multivariate dependencies in financial time series">
  <data key="d0">GANs have limited ability to model multivariate dependencies in financial time series</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The authors find that while GANs can capture key stylized facts, such as random walks, mean-reverting behavior, and time-varying volatility. Their performance in modeling multivariate dependencies remains limited.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
