  <data key="d0">Efimov et al. (58)</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as (58); demonstrates a GAN architecture combining conditional GAN and DRAGAN to generate synthetic financial datasets for credit and fraud risk management.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007</data>
