<node id="Jiang et al. (59)">
  <data key="d0">Jiang et al. (59)</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as (59); uses GANs to generate synthetic data addressing data imbalance in financial market supervision and risk prediction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007</data>
