<node id="Tovar (60)">
  <data key="d0">Tovar (60)</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as (60); proposes a hybrid deep learning model using Bi-LSTM as generator and CNN for financial time series and stock market trend prediction.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as (60). Addresses financial time series prediction, particularly stock market trend forecasting in highly dynamic and volatile environments; proposes the Bi-LSTM-CNN GAN hybrid deep learning model.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-008</data>
