  <data key="d0">Hybrid Quantum-Classical Generative Adversarial Network</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">HQGAN; uses a quantum circuit as generator and a classical neural network as discriminator; falls short in capturing complex financial data patterns.</data>
