  <data key="d0">Privacy-Preserving Customer Churn Prediction Model</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">PPCCP model combining GAN-generated synthetic data with adaptive Weight-of-Evidence transformation; improves accuracy by up to 28.9% and F-measure by 27.9%.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
