<node id="Synthetic Data Generation">
  <data key="d0">Synthetic Data Generation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Creation of synthetic datasets with GANs to preserve privacy, overcome scarcity and approximate original distributions.&lt;SEP&gt;Research topic of generating artificial data, covered by cited works on GAN-based synthetic data, privacy-preserving data and financial data.&lt;SEP&gt;Generation of synthetic tabular records conforming to user-specified statistical marginals and logical constraints.&lt;SEP&gt;Generation of tabular data matching target distributions and logical constraints, using discrete sampling, continuous interval generation and mixed-type processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Governed, auditable generation of synthetic data, the domain addressed by the framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Creation of artificial data. It is the central topic of several references, including copula flows, CTGAN, LLM, TVAE and diffusion-based approaches.&lt;SEP&gt;Creation of artificial data that mimics real data, addressed by CTGAN-driven and diffusion-based works.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Vol.13.No.7.13.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Financial Time Series Prediction">
  <data key="d0">Financial Time Series Prediction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Forecasting of stock market trends in dynamic and volatile environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Prediction of financial time series, including stock market trend forecasting in volatile environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-008</data>
