  <data key="d5">1791425841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GAN-based synthetic data enhances trading performance and risk management">
  <data key="d0">GAN-based synthetic data enhances trading performance and risk management</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Experimental results show that incorporating synthetic data enhances trading performance and risk management, demonstrating the potential of GANs in financial market simulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CEGEN is the best-performing GAN for commodity price simulation">
  <data key="d0">CEGEN is the best-performing GAN for commodity price simulation</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">CEGEN (Conditional Euler Generator) is identified as the best-performing GAN, excelling in replicating marginals, correlations, and consistency across datasets, while TGAN (Time Series Generative Adversarial Network) (29) offers more generality.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Conditional GAN with DRAGAN generates high-fidelity synthetic financial data">
  <data key="d0">Conditional GAN with DRAGAN generates high-fidelity synthetic financial data</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">In this research paper, Efimov et al. (58) demonstrated that a novel GAN architecture, combining conditional GAN (12) and DRAGAN (Discriminator Regularized Generative Adversarial Network), can generate synthetic financial datasets with high fidelity, closely approximating original data distributions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GANs-aWOE improves churn prediction accuracy by up to 28.9%">
  <data key="d0">GANs-aWOE improves churn prediction accuracy by up to 28.9%</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Experiments using eight machine learning classifiers on three public telecom datasets show that the GANs-aWOE method enhances accuracy by up to 28.9% and F-measure by 27.9% compared to previous models.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FE-GAN outperforms standard GANs in VaR and ES estimation">
  <data key="d0">FE-GAN outperforms standard GANs in VaR and ES estimation</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The approach significantly improves model convergence speed, reduces estimation errors, and outperforms standard GANs in both VaR and ES estimation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Market-GAN generates high-fidelity context-controlled financial market data">
  <data key="d0">Market-GAN generates high-fidelity context-controlled financial market data</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">This paper, presented as a proceedings paper at the 38th AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (2024), introduces Market-GAN, a novel architecture designed to generate high-fidelity financial market data with semantic context control.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GANs outperform oversampling and undersampling for financial risk prediction">
  <data key="d0">GANs outperform oversampling and undersampling for financial risk prediction</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Experimental results show that GAN significantly enhances model performance, outperforming traditional oversampling and undersampling techniques.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791425841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
