  <data key="d2">Cited as (64). Addresses portfolio analysis and allocation; proposes HybridCGAN and HybridACGAN integrating CGAN and deep neural regression, applied to US and European markets.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-008</data>
