  <data key="d2">Challenge of stabilizing GAN training when modeling complex financial data.&lt;SEP&gt;Difficulty of stabilizing GAN training and achieving convergence due to the adversarial nature of GANs, especially with volatile market data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-009</data>
