  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "This model outperforms existing Machine Learning and GAN-based approaches by effectively generating synthetic financial data that retains critical market features, improving the reliability of predictions, especially under high volatility scenarios like intraday trading."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
