<node id="TAGAN and TTGAN outperform QuantGAN in realism of financial time series simulation">
  <data key="d0">TAGAN and TTGAN outperform QuantGAN in realism of financial time series simulation</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "These models outperform QuantGAN (42) by producing more realistic autocorrelation and cross-correlation structures, improving the no-arbitrage condition for option surfaces, and reducing overfitting in time series simulations."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
