  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "Empirical results demonstrate that incorporating synthetic data improves portfolio performance, leading to an 18.12% increase in the Sharpe Ratio compared to a benchmark portfolio based solely on historical data."</data>
