<node id="GANs Enhance Data Privacy And Accessibility But Face Limitations">
  <data key="d0">GANs Enhance Data Privacy And Accessibility But Face Limitations</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding of the review: "while GANs increase data privacy and accessibility, they also face limitations such as mode collapse, instability during training, and regulatory concerns in financial markets."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf</data>
