<node id="Comprehensive Assessment Of GAN-Based Financial Data Generation Is Limited">
  <data key="d0">Comprehensive Assessment Of GAN-Based Financial Data Generation Is Limited</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the abstract: "Despite their potential, a comprehensive assessment of GAN-based financial data generation is limited and requires a systematic evaluation of existing methods and findings." Motivates the systematic review.</data>
