<node id="Control Charts Reduced Lens Defect Rate From 13.49% to 10%">
  <data key="d0">Control Charts Reduced Lens Defect Rate From 13.49% to 10%</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Rohani and Chan [10] employed quality tools and control charts to enhance the quality of plastic injection molded lenses utilized in telecommunication devices. Their study showed the ability to decrease the defect rate from 13.49% to 10%.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Main Anomaly Detection Methods Include Moving Average, CUSUM, Deep Learning With Probability, and SPC">
  <data key="d0">Main Anomaly Detection Methods Include Moving Average, CUSUM, Deep Learning With Probability, and SPC</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Among the tools used for anomaly detection, the main methodologies include Moving Average, Cumulative Sum, Deep Learning with Probability, and Statistical Process Control (SPC) [5].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SPC Techniques Assume Normally Distributed Data">
  <data key="d0">SPC Techniques Assume Normally Distributed Data</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Assumption of normal distribution [13]: SPC techniques such as control charts often assume that process data follows a normal distribution.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hybrid Deep Learning-Autoencoder SPC Approach">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Deep Learning-Autoencoder SPC Approach</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Combined approach proposed in the article being read. It integrates the benefits of statistical control charts with modern machine learning methods (a deep learning autoencoder) to overcome the limitations of Statistical Process Control.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Quality Defects">
  <data key="d0">Quality Defects</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Defects in injection molding that range from compromising part integrity to functionality. Early detection is vital to prevent defective parts, reduce scrap rates and maintain quality standards.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Maintenance Anomalies">
  <data key="d0">Maintenance Anomalies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Maintenance-related anomalies in injection molding that affect productivity and profitability. Common issues include breakdown times and costs. Addressing potential equipment failures early minimizes downtime and optimizes equipment lifespan.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Limitations in Complex Processes">
  <data key="d0">Limitations in Complex Processes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Limitation of SPC: it is most effective in stable, predictable processes. In highly complex processes with many interacting variables, it is hard to isolate individual factors and root causes of variation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Overreliance on Historical Data">
  <data key="d0">Overreliance on Historical Data</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Limitation of SPC: it relies heavily on historical data to establish control limits. Such data may not capture future changes, unforeseen events or changes in operating conditions, which can lead to suboptimal decisions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Delayed Detection of Changes">
  <data key="d0">Delayed Detection of Changes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Limitation of SPC: it may not promptly detect small or rapid changes within short timeframes, or certain types of variation such as sporadic or systematic shifts. This can delay responses and cause quality issues.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Molding Anomalies Involve Quality Defects and Maintenance Aspects">
  <data key="d0">Injection Molding Anomalies Involve Quality Defects and Maintenance Aspects</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "...both quality defects and maintenance aspects [3]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Common Maintenance Issues Include Breakdown Times and Costs">
  <data key="d0">Common Maintenance Issues Include Breakdown Times and Costs</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Common maintenance issues include times and cost of break down [4]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Moving Average Detects Shifts or Trends via Sliding Window Averaging">
  <data key="d0">Moving Average Detects Shifts or Trends via Sliding Window Averaging</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "As shown by Cox [6], The Moving Average is foundational statistical technique that calculates the average of a sliding window of data points, enabling the detection of shifts or trends in process behavior over time."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cumulative Sum Enables Early Detection of Persistent Process Shifts">
  <data key="d0">Cumulative Sum Enables Early Detection of Persistent Process Shifts</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "On the other hand, Cumulative Sum, as demonstrated by Grunkemeier et al. [7], allows tracking the cumulative deviation from a specified reference value, facilitating the early detection of persistent process shifts or abnormalities."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Deep Learning With Probability Leverages Neural Networks for Anomaly Detection">
  <data key="d0">Deep Learning With Probability Leverages Neural Networks for Anomaly Detection</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Additionally, Deep Learning with Probability, as demonstrated by Ketonen and Blech [8], leverages advanced neural network architectures."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Control Charts Systematically Track Process Stability">
  <data key="d0">Control Charts Systematically Track Process Stability</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "These charts, including the X-bar and R (Range) charts for monitoring process mean and deviation, provide a systematic approach to tracking process stability and detecting deviations from established control limits [9]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SPC With Capability Indicators Improves Defect Detection Using Product Mass">
  <data key="d0">SPC With Capability Indicators Improves Defect Detection Using Product Mass</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Chaciński et al. [11] deployed Statistical Process Control, integrating process capability indicators and performance indicators into their study. They assessed three product types, focusing on product mass to improve defect detection, meet customer specifications, and reduce non-compliance."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Part-Family Control Charts Speed Up Defect Response in Injection Molding">
  <data key="d0">Part-Family Control Charts Speed Up Defect Response in Injection Molding</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Cao et al. [12] introduced an approach using SPC principles. They utilized data from different parts to create control charts tailored to specific part families." The method aims for swift identification of and response to defects.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LSTM-AE">
  <data key="d0">LSTM-AE</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Combination of LSTM and Autoencoder merged with SPC to enhance identification of process irregularities.&lt;SEP&gt;LSTM-based Autoencoder trained on sequences of 5 observations; final dataset size of 2974 × 5 sequences; composed of an LSTM encoder, RepeatVector layer and LSTM decoder.&lt;SEP&gt;LSTM autoencoder model trained on normal melt cushion data. The model reconstructs its input and flags anomalies when the reconstruction error exceeds a threshold. The best tuning reached training R2 of 0.994 and validation MAE of 0.0146.&lt;SEP&gt;Long Short-Term Memory Autoencoder model. It is trained on normal Melt cushion data, reconstructs input sequences, and flags anomalies when the reconstruction mean absolute error exceeds a threshold (0.04).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Womer, Zhao and Schiffers [16]">
  <data key="d0">Womer, Zhao and Schiffers [16]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [16]. A work by Womer, Zhao and Schiffers. It outlines how monitoring the melt cushion parameter enables early detection of problems, preventing product quality defects and damage to critical machine components such as the non-return valve and screw.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Melt cushion is a critical aspect of injection molding">
  <data key="d0">Melt cushion is a critical aspect of injection molding</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The case study presented in this study focuses on the 'Melt cushion parameter,' a critical aspect of the injection molding process [15].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Melt cushion compensates for variations in material viscosity and mold temperature">
  <data key="d0">Melt cushion compensates for variations in material viscosity and mold temperature</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">This action forms a cushion of material in front of the screw, compensating for variations in material viscosity and mold temperature [15].&lt;SEP&gt;Statement in the text: "...the screw, compensating for variations in material viscosity and mold temperature [15]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Early melt cushion anomaly detection prevents defects and machine damage">
  <data key="d0">Early melt cushion anomaly detection prevents defects and machine damage</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">This early detection helps prevent defects in product quality and damage to critical machine components like the non-return valve and screw, as outlined by Womer, Zhao and Schiffers [16].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection molding comprises five key steps">
  <data key="d0">Injection molding comprises five key steps</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Injection molding, a widely used plastic manufacturing process, comprises five key steps: Plasticizing, injection, packing, cooling, and ejection [17].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Solidified part is ejected as the mold opens, completing the cycle">
  <data key="d0">Solidified part is ejected as the mold opens, completing the cycle</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Once solidified, the part is ejected as the mold opens, completing the cycle [18].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426315</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection system comprises hopper, barrel, screw and nozzle">
  <data key="d0">Injection system comprises hopper, barrel, screw and nozzle</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
