<node id="Reconstruction Error">
  <data key="d0">Reconstruction Error</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Error computed by the Autoencoder in the hybrid approach and used to detect anomalies.&lt;SEP&gt;The autoencoder's error measure. It is compared against the upper and lower limits to flag anomalies.&lt;SEP&gt;The error reconstruction on which the LSTM-AE model heavily relies for anomaly detection.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
