<node id="Cushion parameter compensates shrinkage during cooling phase">
  <data key="d0">Cushion parameter compensates shrinkage during cooling phase</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Firstly, the cushion parameter compensates the shrinkage during cooling phase [20], ensuring the final part retains its desired dimensions and geometry."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
