  <data key="d0">Cushion parameter prevents short shots</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Secondly, it prevents short shots by optimizing the injection process to adequately fill the mold cavity, reducing the risk of incomplete parts [21]."</data>
