<node id="Lughofer and Pichler [23]">
  <data key="d0">Lughofer and Pichler [23]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [23]. Proposes an automated method for predicting quality issues in injection molding machines using only regular production data. The models are updated dynamically, and the method reaches correlations up to 0.98 and error rates below 5%.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-003</data>
