  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [24]. Presents a framework that uses sensor data from plastic injection machines and deep learning to detect anomalies and securely cluster outliers in smart factories. The framework is incorporated into the Two Phases Anomaly Detection architecture.</data>
