  <data key="d2">Cited as [25]. Introduces generalized fault trees, combined with isolation forest anomaly detection, for real-time reliability assessment and predictive maintenance of injection molds. Reports cost savings of 27.05% vs preventive maintenance and 63.43% vs corrective maintenance.</data>
