<node id="Sensor data-based deep learning framework detects anomalies in plastic injection machines with over 90% accuracy">
  <data key="d0">Sensor data-based deep learning framework detects anomalies in plastic injection machines with over 90% accuracy</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "The benefits of this approach are incorporated into the Two Phases Anomaly Detection system architecture, which utilizes an LSTM classifier alongside the pseudo labeling technique, achieving a high reliability rate surpassing 90% accuracy." The claim is attributed to Lee et al. [24].</data>
