<node id="Generalized fault trees with isolation forest yield significant maintenance cost savings for injection molds">
  <data key="d0">Generalized fault trees with isolation forest yield significant maintenance cost savings for injection molds</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Applied to predictive maintenance of injection molds, their approach, combining a new training algorithm with isolation forest anomaly detection, demonstrates significant cost savings of 27.05% compared to preventive maintenance and 63.43% compared to corrective maintenance." The claim is attributed to Nunes et al. [25].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-003</data>
