  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [5]. Study by RC Kanu applying SPC with x-bar and range control charts to monitor process stability in injection molding of plastic parts, integrating SPC and injection molding course materials for students; identified variability sources such as cushion final position, screw change-over position, cooling time and plasticizing time.</data>
