  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [27]. Study by Uluksan addressing water leakage in condenser dryer water tanks produced by plastic injection molding and vibration welding using SPC, cause-and-effect diagrams, control charts and hypothesis testing; process capability improved after mold maintenance, welding fixtures and standardized controls.</data>
