<node id="Containerization">
  <data key="d0">Containerization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Modern software deployment practice coupled with the automated quality prediction system of Muaz et al. [30] to enhance quality control.&lt;SEP&gt;The practice of packaging each application component together with its dependencies into an isolated environment. Docker implements this practice.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployment criterion in the comparative analysis. Only FSMicroGenerator and Prasanthan et al. [2] support containerized deployment.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-021</data>
