  <data key="d0">Jung et al. [31]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [31]; investigates machine learning applicability for quality prediction in the injection molding industry within Industry 4.0, finding autoencoders outperform other algorithms and identifying temperature and time as significant quality factors.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-005</data>
