  <data key="d0">Huang et al. [32]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [32]; proposes a machine learning virtual-actual correction model for mold cavity pressure in injection molding using an autoencoder and a multilayer perceptron, improving simulated-actual correlation from 81% to 98%.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-005</data>
