  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [33]; introduces a sim-to-real transfer-learning framework using wide-and-deep learning and a convolutional variational autoencoder to address sparse and heterogeneous data in smart manufacturing, evaluated on an industrial thermoforming process with SHAP explainability.</data>
