<node id="Cushion Parameter">
  <data key="d0">Cushion Parameter</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Injection molding parameter whose monitoring is identified as lacking in existing literature, which focuses on post-defect indicators like weight and dimensions.&lt;SEP&gt;Melt cushion parameter of injection molding that acts as a pre-defect indicator. Its expected value is 6.61 cm3 with a tolerance of +/-0.5 cm3 (LSL 6.11, USL 7.11).&lt;SEP&gt;An injection molding parameter monitored through the internal calculations of the Arburg Allrounder 150T.&lt;SEP&gt;Critical injection molding process parameter indicative of process stability.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56015fdaac28ae50466d3ddc4439d39b-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;M3A_24_Book_of_Abstracts-57.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426614</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
