</node>
<node id="Ref [51]">
  <data key="d0">Ref [51]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [51] for the internal structure of an LSTM cell with input, output and forget gates.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited work on integrating retrieved texts into LLMs via cross-attention.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited work on festive and social events affecting traffic and on urban delivery during peak hours.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-004</data>
