  <data key="d0">Digital Twin For Injection Process [57]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The work cited as [57], on developing a digital twin for the injection process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Digital Twin Real-Time Monitoring [58]">
  <data key="d0">Digital Twin Real-Time Monitoring [58]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The work cited as [58], describing digital twin technology as a virtual model enabling real-time monitoring, analysis and optimization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Digital twin is a promising solution for dynamic adaptation in injection molding">
  <data key="d0">Digital twin is a promising solution for dynamic adaptation in injection molding</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "A promising solution to address this challenge is the development of a digital twin for the injection process [57]".</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Digital twin enables real-time monitoring, analysis, and optimization">
  <data key="d0">Digital twin enables real-time monitoring, analysis, and optimization</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "this technology creates a virtual model mirroring the manufacturing environment, enabling real-time monitoring, analysis, and optimization [58]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Arburg Allrounder 150T">
  <data key="d0">Arburg Allrounder 150T</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">An injection molding machine. Its data and internal calculations were used to monitor the cushion parameter in the study.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Root Cause Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Root Cause Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Proposed as a future extension that would complement the anomaly detection methodology.&lt;SEP&gt;Proposed future extension that would complement anomaly detection by identifying the root causes of detected anomalies. Suggested approaches include Bayesian networks, fuzzy logic and failure tree analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SPC and LSTM-AE Hybrid Approach">
  <data key="d0">SPC and LSTM-AE Hybrid Approach</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">A novel hybrid method that combines Statistical Process Control (SPC) with an LSTM-Autoencoder (LSTM-AE). Data from the mean control chart is used as training data for the LSTM-AE. The method enhances anomaly detection in injection molding, enables early detection and trend analysis of deviations, and supports real-time monitoring and proactive management of production processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Molding Process Data">
  <data key="d0">Injection Molding Process Data</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">Process data collected from the Arburg Allrounder 150T. It initially contained 10160 values, which were divided into samples of three according to the mean control chart, yielding 3389 values for training the LSTM-AE.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Accelerometers">
  <data key="d0">Accelerometers</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensors proposed for future work. Mounted on the motor and hydraulic pump, they could detect subtle vibrations that give early indicators of underlying issues or equipment wear.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cavity Pressure Sensors">
  <data key="d0">Cavity Pressure Sensors</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensors proposed for future work. They would monitor the stability of injection filling within the mold and help identify deviations from expected norms.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Control Chart Limit Trials">
  <data key="d0">Control Chart Limit Trials</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Experimental trials that varied the maximum and minimum limits of the control chart. The initial trial (maximum 0.0277, minimum 0.0277) detected only one anomaly type, while trial 4 (maximum 0.243, minimum 0.0188) identified all four types.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Anomaly Type 3">
  <data key="d0">Anomaly Type 3</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">One of four anomaly types identified in the study. The proposed model achieved early detection particularly for this type by discerning ascending and descending trends.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Real-Time Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Real-Time Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuous monitoring of production processes. The hybrid approach and digital twin technology are both presented as enabling it.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Static Model Limitation">
  <data key="d0">Static Model Limitation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A limitation noted in the study: static models may not effectively address real-world conditions involving complex interactions among variables that evolve over time. This creates a need for adaptable systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Training Data Quantity Limitation">
  <data key="d0">Training Data Quantity Limitation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A limitation noted in the study: more data would improve the precision of reconstruction error and enhance detectability for deep learning models.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Normal Condition Training Dependency">
  <data key="d0">Normal Condition Training Dependency</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A limitation noted in the study: the model depends on training under normal situations. Such conditions are hard to achieve in practice because of machine degradation, materials, maintenance protocols and labor factors.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
