<node id="Testing of Normality of Data Files for Application of SPC Tools">
  <data key="d0">Testing of Normality of Data Files for Application of SPC Tools</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [37]. Paper by P. Mach and H. Hochlova, presented at the 27th International Spring Seminar on Electronics Technology in Bankya, Bulgaria, 2004, pp. 318–321. It addresses normality testing of data before applying statistical process control (SPC) tools.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Normality Testing Methods and the Importance of Skewness and Kurtosis in Statistical Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Normality Testing Methods and the Importance of Skewness and Kurtosis in Statistical Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [38]. Paper by G. Hatem, J. Zeidan, M. Goossens and C. Moreira, published in BAU Journal - Science and Technology, vol. 3, no. 2, Jun. 2022. It discusses normality testing methods and the role of skewness and kurtosis in statistical analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Analyzing Data Utilized in Process Control and Continuous Improvement">
  <data key="d0">Analyzing Data Utilized in Process Control and Continuous Improvement</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [39]. Paper by J. E. Jarrett, published in the International Journal of Economics and Management Sciences, vol. 5, no. 2, 2016. It analyzes data used in process control and continuous improvement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SPC (Statistical Process Control): A Quality Control Technique for Confirmation to Ability of Process">
  <data key="d0">SPC (Statistical Process Control): A Quality Control Technique for Confirmation to Ability of Process</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [40]. Paper by E. H. S. Oberoi, M. Parmar, H. Kaur and R. Mehra, published in the International Research Journal of Engineering and Technology, vol. 3, no. 6, pp. 666–672, 2016. It describes SPC as a quality control technique for confirming process ability.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Creating a Capable Process Using Process Capability">
  <data key="d0">Creating a Capable Process Using Process Capability</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [41]. Online article from ptonline.com, accessed on Jun. 10, 2024. It describes how to create a capable process using process capability.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="A Review and Interpretations of Process Capability Indices">
  <data key="d0">A Review and Interpretations of Process Capability Indices</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [42]. Paper by K. Palmer and K.-L. Tsui, published in Annals of Operations Research, vol. 87, pp. 31–47, Apr. 1999. It reviews and interprets process capability indices.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Short Run SPC Using Dynamic Control Chart">
  <data key="d0">Short Run SPC Using Dynamic Control Chart</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [43]. Paper by G. S. Wasserman, published in Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering, vol. 27, pp. 353–356, Sep. 1994. It addresses short-run SPC using a dynamic control chart.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791426330</data>
