</node>
<node id="SPC Chart Selection Process">
  <data key="d0">SPC Chart Selection Process</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [44]. Paper by R. P. Anjard, published in Microelectronics Reliability, vol. 35, no. 11, pp. 1445–1447, Nov. 1995. It describes the process for selecting SPC charts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
