</node>
<node id="Attribute Control Chart for Multivariate Poisson Distribution">
  <data key="d0">Attribute Control Chart for Multivariate Poisson Distribution</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [45]. Paper by J.-E. Chiu and T.-I. Kuo, published in Communications in Statistics - Theory and Methods, vol. 37, no. 1, pp. 146–158, Dec. 2007. It proposes an attribute control chart for multivariate Poisson distributions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-018</data>
