  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">A HAITIAN injection molding machine from 2015. Its clamping force is 3200 kN, the distance between bars is 680 mm and the screw diameter is 60 mm. It produces 229 g/s with a maximum injection volume of 792 cm3.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-006</data>
