  <data key="d0">An Analytical Hierarchy Process (AHP)-Guided Decision Model for Underground Mining Method Selection</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference 21. Gupta S and Kumar U, International Journal of Mining, Reclamation and Environment, 2012, 26(4):324-36. The paper presents an AHP-guided decision model for selecting underground mining methods.</data>
