  <data key="d0">TOPSIS and Modified TOPSIS: A Comparative Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference 24. Chakraborty S, Decision Analytics Journal, 2022, 2:100021. The paper compares TOPSIS with Modified TOPSIS.</data>
