  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference 25. Hwang C-L and Yoon K, 1981, pages 58-191. The work is a chapter in "Multiple Attribute Decision Making: Methods and Applications, A State-of-the-Art Survey" and covers methods for multiple attribute decision making.</data>
