  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference 26. Papathanasiou J and Ploskas N, Springer, 2018. The work covers the TOPSIS method.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-015</data>
