  <data key="d2">Reference 27. Shih H-S, Lin W-Y and Lee E (editors). Proceedings of the Joint 9th IFSA World Congress and 20th NAFIPS International Conference, IEEE, 2001. The paper addresses group decision making with TOPSIS.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-015</data>
