  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference 28. Majumder M, 2015, pages 35-47. The work is a chapter in "Impact of Urbanization on Water Shortage in Face of Climatic Aberrations" and covers multi criteria decision making.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-015</data>
