  <data key="d0">The Decision-Support Modeling with Fuzzy Analytic Hierarchy Process (AHP) to Determine the Career Path for Bachelor Informatics Students</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference 29. Wijaya EK, Gaol FL and Matsuo T, Emerging Science Journal, 2024, 8(1):153-68. The paper applies Fuzzy AHP decision-support modeling to determine career paths for bachelor informatics students.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-015</data>
