  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference 30. Kuo Y, Yang T and Huang G-W, Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering, 2008, 55(1):80-93. The paper applies grey relational analysis to multiple attribute decision-making problems.</data>
