  <data key="d2">Reference 33. Kaliszewski I and Podkopaev D, Expert Systems with Applications, 2016, 54:155-61. The paper presents simple additive weighting as a metamodel for multiple criteria decision analysis methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-015</data>
