<node id="Application of Serial Temporal Deep Learning Models in Statistical Control Chart for Process Stability Monitoring: A Case Study in Injection Molding Manufacturing">
  <data key="d0">Application of Serial Temporal Deep Learning Models in Statistical Control Chart for Process Stability Monitoring: A Case Study in Injection Molding Manufacturing</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read; applies LSTM, Bi-LSTM and CNN-LSTM models to enhance statistical process control charts by predicting the Cushion parameter in injection molding, with LSTM achieving an R-squared of 0.765.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-56015fdaac28ae50466d3ddc4439d39b-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">M3A_24_Book_of_Abstracts-57.pdf</data>
