  <data key="d0">CNN-LSTM</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Hybrid neural network and LSTM model, written in the text as "Conventional Neural Network LSTM (CNN-LSTM)". It is one of three sequential temporal deep learning models evaluated for predicting the Cushion parameter. It yielded results comparable to LSTM and Bi-LSTM.</data>
