<node id="Covid 19">
  <data key="d0">Covid 19</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pandemic that closed schools and workplaces, which increased people's reliance on the Internet for communication.&lt;SEP&gt;Pandemic that dramatically changed people's lives worldwide, shutting down schools, companies and workplaces and forcing people to stay at home under quarantine orders, which increased reliance on the Internet for communication.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-001</data>
