</node>
<node id="Access Control">
  <data key="d0">Access Control</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Security service restricting network resources to legitimate nodes; authentication is a fundamental requirement for implementing access control in MANET.&lt;SEP&gt;Control of access to network resources. Authentication, which confirms a user's identity, is a fundamental requirement for implementing it in MANET.&lt;SEP&gt;Security service for which blockchain is considered well suited in MANETs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466824</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Polydisciplinary Faculty">
  <data key="d0">Polydisciplinary Faculty</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
