<node id="Instant temporary multimedia networks are needed in civilian settings">
  <data key="d0">Instant temporary multimedia networks are needed in civilian settings</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">In some situations, people need to set up an instant and temporary multimedia network where devices can communicate immediately, such as in conferences, classrooms, home networks or other civilian locations like a sports stadium, ship or small aircraft [2].</data>
