<node id="Cluster Head">
  <data key="d0">Cluster Head</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Node with the highest weight chosen to lead a cluster in clustering-based authentication; it authenticates nodes with AUCRES, and the scheme fails when the cluster head is attacked.&lt;SEP&gt;Node with the highest weight that is chosen to lead a cluster in clustering-based MANET authentication. It authenticates nodes using AUCRES and is a single point of failure when attacked.&lt;SEP&gt;CH; the node with the highest weight, elected in each cluster during the initialization phase of the clustering algorithm. It authenticates nodes using AUCRES, and the scheme is weakened if the cluster head is compromised.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccc87fb659a572e9c9db17272d2f6955-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Paper (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467168</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
