<node id="Clustering">
  <data key="d0">Clustering</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Popular MANET authentication mechanism that divides the network into clusters with a cluster head chosen as the node of highest weight; vulnerable when the cluster head is attacked.&lt;SEP&gt;Authentication solution from [6] that avoids reliance on trusted third parties.&lt;SEP&gt;A network organization technique that becomes especially important in highly dense networks and for MANET security because of the dynamic nature of MANETs. It involves selecting cluster heads.&lt;SEP&gt;Problem of selecting cluster heads in MANETs. Chatterjee and Saha address it with Artificial Neural Networks.&lt;SEP&gt;A scheme used by QMM-VANET and CBQoS-Vanet. In CBQoS-Vanet, cluster heads are used to expedite data transmission.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccc87fb659a572e9c9db17272d2f6955-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Paper (1).pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Paper.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-Hop Communication">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Hop Communication</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">MANET mode where intermediate nodes are employed to communicate with nodes beyond the radio range.&lt;SEP&gt;MANET communication mode in which intermediate nodes are employed to communicate with nodes beyond their radio range.&lt;SEP&gt;MANET mode in which intermediate nodes are used to communicate with nodes beyond radio range.&lt;SEP&gt;MANET mode in which intermediate nodes relay communication to nodes beyond radio range.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-005</data>
