</node>
<node id="Eavesdropping">
  <data key="d0">Eavesdropping</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Example of a passive attack in MANET, alongside traffic analysis and traffic monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Example of a passive attack.&lt;SEP&gt;Attack to which ad hoc networks are vulnerable because of their wireless transmission links.&lt;SEP&gt;Attack that Hacha et al.'s scheme secures against.&lt;SEP&gt;An internal passive attack listed in Table 1.</data>
