<node id="Single Point Of Failure">
  <data key="d0">Single Point Of Failure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Failure risk avoided in blockchain by having each node keep a copy of the blockchain.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk posed by a central trusted authority in MANET, which also adds computation and communication overhead. Many current MANET technologies try to avoid this dependence.</data>
