<node id="Fog Computing Consists Of Three Layers">
  <data key="d0">Fog Computing Consists Of Three Layers</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The basic instruction of Fog computing consists of three layers: End devices, fog nodes and cloud servers [10].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Single Point of Failure">
  <data key="d0">Single Point of Failure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Failure risk avoided in blockchain networks by having each node keep a copy of the blockchain.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness of centralized mechanisms. Blockchain avoids it by having every node keep a synchronized copy of the ledger.&lt;SEP&gt;Security risk that decentralized blockchain-based authentication schemes reduce.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Access Tokens">
  <data key="d0">Access Tokens</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tokens calculated by the smart contract in the proposed decentralized authentication approach to authenticate devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MANET Is Vulnerable Due To Its Characteristics">
  <data key="d0">MANET Is Vulnerable Due To Its Characteristics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">MANET is vulnerable to security attacks because of dynamic topology, lack of central management and an unsecured medium; the absence of centralized administration makes it more vulnerable to internal attackers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jarjis and Kadir [11]">
  <data key="d0">Jarjis and Kadir [11]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [11]. Presents a blockchain implementation for AODV, modifying it into BAODV by adding a Bnode field to RREQ and RREP packets to detect impersonation and black-hole attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Yang and Hwanseok [12]">
  <data key="d0">Yang and Hwanseok [12]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [12]. Proposes a decentralized authentication protocol that integrates blockchain with an area-based hierarchical structure using Region and Top Certificate Authorities.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azees et al. [14]">
  <data key="d0">Azees et al. [14]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [14]. Proposes an anonymous blockchain-based authentication mechanism for VANET in which RSUs anonymously authenticate vehicles.&lt;SEP&gt;Work by Azees et al. proposing a blockchain-based anonymous authentication mechanism for VANET. In this mechanism, RSUs anonymously authenticate vehicles and share session keys. It also enables fast reauthentication between adjacent RSUs. The authors report efficiency in communication, computational and storage costs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
