<node id="Fabrication Attack">
  <data key="d0">Fabrication Attack</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An example of an active attack in MANETs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bnode Field">
  <data key="d0">Bnode Field</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">A field added to the RREQ packet header in BAODV. It stores the address of a malicious node that breaks into the network or tries to exploit its resources, and each node verifies the previous node's address against it.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Route Request">
  <data key="d0">Route Request</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">RREQ; an AODV control message that BAODV extends with an extra field (Bnode).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Route Reply">
  <data key="d0">Route Reply</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">RREP; an AODV control message that BAODV extends with an extra field.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Road Side Unit">
  <data key="d0">Road Side Unit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">RSU; infrastructure units in VANET that anonymously authenticate vehicles in the blockchain-based mechanism of Azees et al. [14].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
