<node id="ANNs are inspired by biological neural networks">
  <data key="d0">ANNs are inspired by biological neural networks</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "ANNs are computer systems inspired by the biological neural networks that form human brains [17]."</data>
