</node>
<node id="Blockchain-based anonymous authentication is efficient for VANET">
  <data key="d0">Blockchain-based anonymous authentication is efficient for VANET</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text attributed to Azees et al. [14]: "In addition, the performance analysis done by the authors of this work proves its efficiency in terms of communication, computational and storage costs. So it is convenient for real-time applications."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blockchain-based PKI for FANET keeps throughput and latency constant">
  <data key="d0">Blockchain-based PKI for FANET keeps throughput and latency constant</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text attributed to Kashish et al. [15]: "The experimental results show that this method works with constant throughput, latency and approximately constant message overhead as transaction size increase for a given network size."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466841</data>
