</node>
<node id="Hardhat">
  <data key="d0">Hardhat</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Tool used to implement the smart contract's compilation and deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Tool used to compile and deploy the smart contract.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466843</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ganache-CLI">
  <data key="d0">Ganache-CLI</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Ethereum emulator providing accounts with 100 ethers for testing smart contracts; very close to a real Ethereum implementation and shows created transactions and blocks.&lt;SEP&gt;Ethereum emulator providing accounts with 100 ethers for testing smart contracts; close to a real Ethereum implementation and shows transactions and blocks created.&lt;SEP&gt;Ethereum emulator providing accounts with 100 ethers for testing smart contracts, close to a real Ethereum implementation and showing transactions and blocks created.&lt;SEP&gt;Ethereum emulator that provides accounts with 100 ethers for testing smart contracts. It closely resembles a real Ethereum implementation and shows transactions and blocks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466843</data>
