<node id="Efficient Energy Optimization in Mobile Ad Hoc Network (MANET) Using Better-Quality AODV Protocol">
  <data key="d0">Efficient Energy Optimization in Mobile Ad Hoc Network (MANET) Using Better-Quality AODV Protocol</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [3]. Anand and Sasikala; concerns energy optimization in MANET using an improved AODV protocol.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [3]. M. Anand and T. Sasikala, Cluster Computing, vol. 22, no. 5, 2019; addresses energy optimization in MANETs using an improved AODV protocol.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [3]. Anand and Sasikala, Cluster Computing vol. 22, 2019; energy optimization in MANET using an improved AODV protocol.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [3]. Written by M. Anand and T. Sasikala and published in Cluster Computing, vol. 22, no. 5, pp. 12681–12687, in 2019. The paper addresses energy optimization in MANETs using an improved AODV protocol.</data>
