<node id="AODV Protocol">
  <data key="d0">AODV Protocol</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Ad hoc On-Demand Distance Vector routing protocol; an improved, better-quality version is used for energy optimization in MANET by Anand and Sasikala.&lt;SEP&gt;Ad hoc On-Demand Distance Vector routing protocol. Reference [3] improves it for energy optimization in MANETs.&lt;SEP&gt;Ad hoc On-Demand Distance Vector routing protocol; an improved version is used for energy optimization in MANET by Anand and Sasikala.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-020</data>
