  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [4]. N. Sharma and A. Gangal, Far East J. Electron. Commun, 2016; addresses mobile node authentication in MANETs with an enhanced cluster-based AUCRES algorithm.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [4]. Sharma and Gangal, Far East J. Electron. Commun, 2016; mobile node authentication using an enhanced cluster-based AUCRES algorithm.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [4]. Written by N. Sharma and A. Gangal and published in Far East J. Electron. Commun in 2016. The paper addresses mobile node authentication in MANETs.&lt;SEP&gt;Reference 6. Sharma and Gangal, Far East Journal of Electronics and Communications, 2016.</data>
