<node id="AUCRES Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">AUCRES Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Enhanced cluster-based algorithm for mobile node authentication in MANETs, proposed by Sharma and Gangal (2016).&lt;SEP&gt;Cluster-based authentication algorithm, enhanced by Sharma and Gangal for mobile node authentication in MANET.&lt;SEP&gt;Enhanced cluster-based authentication algorithm used for mobile node authentication in MANETs in reference [4].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466843</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Clustering Schemes">
  <data key="d0">Clustering Schemes</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Clustering approaches used to improve MANET performance. In the proposed mechanism, each node has a cluster identifier (CID) associating it with its group.&lt;SEP&gt;Schemes used by Er-Rouidi et al. to improve the performance of mobile ad hoc networks.&lt;SEP&gt;Clustering techniques used to improve mobile ad hoc network performance in reference [5].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791466843</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Real-Time Applications">
  <data key="d0">Real-Time Applications</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Open issue: the proposed approach is not adapted to real-time applications because registration and authentication times depend on admin availability, due to limited node storage capacity.&lt;SEP&gt;Target use setting for which the computational efficiency of the fuzzy Bayesian Network approach is to be optimized.&lt;SEP&gt;Future work aims to optimize the computational efficiency of the fuzzy Bayesian Network approach so that it becomes practical for real-time applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
