</node>
<node id="Mask R-CNN">
  <data key="d0">Mask R-CNN</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Neural network known for its speed and precision in object detection; used by Lee et al. (2021) with a ResNet101 backbone.&lt;SEP&gt;Instance segmentation deep learning model used together with Canny edge detection for fault detection in injection molding (reference [7]).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467085</data>
