</node>
<node id="ResNet101">
  <data key="d0">ResNet101</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Backbone network used with Mask R-CNN for enhanced accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;CNN architecture combined with Canny filters in Lee et al. (2021).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467085</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Knowledge Reuse Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Knowledge Reuse Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Strategy proposed by Liu et al. (2021) to train CNN models. It combines model-based transfer learning and data augmentation to improve the accuracy and robustness of defect inspection.&lt;SEP&gt;Strategy integrating model-based transfer learning and data augmentation to train CNN models for industrial defect detection.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-001</data>
