  <data key="d0">Quality Defect Detection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The task of identifying defective products; it is challenging in injection molding because of its reliance on human visual inspection.&lt;SEP&gt;Task of identifying quality defects in input images, framed as binary classification.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-004</data>
