<node id="Lee et al. 2021">
  <data key="d0">Lee et al. 2021</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [7]. Introduces a framework for identifying defective injection-molded products. It integrates Canny Edge Detection with Mask R-CNN using a ResNet101 backbone and optimizes image capture with LEDs.</data>
