<node id="Addressing quality defects is critical for product standards and customer satisfaction">
  <data key="d0">Addressing quality defects is critical for product standards and customer satisfaction</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Consequently, identifying and addressing quality defects in injection molding is critical for maintaining product standards and customer satisfaction[4].</data>
