  <data key="d0">Sobel Operator</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Operator used to compute intensity gradient magnitude and direction for each pixel.&lt;SEP&gt;Edge detection operator assessed by Yang et al. (2015).</data>
