<node id="Canny filter with CNN achieves high accuracy in defect detection">
  <data key="d0">Canny filter with CNN achieves high accuracy in defect detection</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "Lee et al. (2021) [7] achieved an accuracy of 96.94% using a model combining Canny filters and CNN (ResNet101) with 10,000 trained images. Meanwhile, Ha et al. (2021) [23] reached around 93% accuracy utilizing CNN and edge detection with approximately 3,800 images for injection molding."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467116</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="M. Hamlich">
  <data key="d0">M. Hamlich</data>
