<node id="Canny filter before CNN enhances defect detection performance">
  <data key="d0">Canny filter before CNN enhances defect detection performance</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding of the paper: "The results strongly indicate that applying the Canny edge detection filter before feeding images into the CNN greatly enhances model performance across all evaluated metrics."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467116</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Generalizability to Other Plastic Parts">
  <data key="d0">Generalizability to Other Plastic Parts</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Open question not explored by the study; future research could test the approach on a wider variety of parts, materials and molding processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467116</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Molding Defects">
  <data key="d0">Injection Molding Defects</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Other defect types proposed for future research, such as shrinkage, sink marks and burns.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467116</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
