  <data key="d0">Deep Learning for Automatic Vision-Based Recognition of Industrial Surface Defects: A Survey</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [6]. By M. Prunella et al., IEEE Access vol. 11, 2023, pp. 43370-43423. Surveys deep learning for vision-based recognition of industrial surface defects.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
