<node id="Fault Detection Using Canny Edge Detection and Mask R-CNN in Injection Molding of Manufacturing Processes">
  <data key="d0">Fault Detection Using Canny Edge Detection and Mask R-CNN in Injection Molding of Manufacturing Processes</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [7]. By J. Lee, J. Lee, C. Lee and J. Jeong, presented at the 2021 4th International Conference on Control and Computer Vision (ACM), Macau, August 2021, pp. 70-75. Detects faults in injection molding using Canny edge detection and Mask R-CNN.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467116</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Defect detection of injection molding products on small datasets using transfer learning">
  <data key="d0">Defect detection of injection molding products on small datasets using transfer learning</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [8]. By J. Liu et al., Journal of Manufacturing Processes vol. 70, October 2021, pp. 400-413. Detects defects in injection molding products on small datasets using transfer learning.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467116</data>
