<node id="Online quality optimization of the injection molding process via digital image processing and model-free optimization">
  <data key="d0">Online quality optimization of the injection molding process via digital image processing and model-free optimization</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [9]. By Y. Yang, B. Yang, S. Zhu and X. Chen, Journal of Materials Processing Technology vol. 226, December 2015, pp. 85-98. Optimizes injection molding quality online using digital image processing and model-free optimization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467116</data>
