<node id="Quality Prediction and Classification of Process Parameterization for Multi-Material Jetting by Means of Computer Vision and Machine Learning">
  <data key="d0">Quality Prediction and Classification of Process Parameterization for Multi-Material Jetting by Means of Computer Vision and Machine Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [10]. By A. Reckert et al., JMMP vol. 8 no. 1, January 2024, p. 8. Uses computer vision and machine learning to predict quality and classify process parameterization for multi-material jetting.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-007</data>
