  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference [11]. By J. Kim and J. Y. Lee, Int. J. Precis. Eng. Manuf. vol. 24 no. 6, June 2023, pp. 901-914. Develops a quality prediction algorithm for injection molding that uses cavity sensor and vibration data.</data>
