<node id="Review in Authentication for Mobile Ad hoc Network">
  <data key="d0">Review in Authentication for Mobile Ad hoc Network</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read; a survey of authentication techniques for Mobile Ad hoc Networks (MANETs), covering authentication in traditional networks and MANETs and discussing advantages and disadvantages of authentication schemes.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being read, by H. Khalfaoui et al.; it reviews authentication methods for Mobile Ad hoc Networks (MANET), including PKI limitations, clustering, certificate exchange, intrusion detection, confidential communication and SIP credential protection.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being read, by H. Khalfaoui et al.; reviews authentication methods for Mobile Ad hoc Networks (MANET), including clustering, certificate exchange, biometrics, smart antennas and Blockchain-based schemes, and evaluates their advantages and disadvantages.&lt;SEP&gt;The article being read, by H. Khalfaoui et al. It reviews authentication mechanisms for Mobile Ad hoc Networks. It concludes that research is moving toward decentralized, Blockchain-based authentication, and it plans to evaluate a blockchain framework with a network simulator.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ccc87fb659a572e9c9db17272d2f6955-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccc87fb659a572e9c9db17272d2f6955-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccc87fb659a572e9c9db17272d2f6955-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccc87fb659a572e9c9db17272d2f6955-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467168</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
