  <data key="d0">National Institute of Standards and Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">US institute that conducted a 2002 study on developer debugging effort.&lt;SEP&gt;US standards body that authored FIPS 204.&lt;SEP&gt;US standards body that authored and published FIPS 186-5: Digital Signature Standard (DSS).&lt;SEP&gt;US standards body that authored and published FIPS 186-5, the Digital Signature Standard, in 2023.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-041</data>
