<node id="Monolithic Architecture">
  <data key="d0">Monolithic Architecture</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Architecture integrating frontend and backend into a single application; considered restrictive compared to distributed architectures.&lt;SEP&gt;Architecture style many existing code generation solutions are designed for, which causes rigidity in maintenance and makes evolving toward modular solutions difficult.&lt;SEP&gt;Architecture favored by most code generation tools, limiting scalability.&lt;SEP&gt;Architecture that bundles all components into one unit, simplifying early development but creating scaling and maintenance issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Architectural style used by most existing code generation tools in the comparative analysis (Uyanik &amp; Sahin, Ullah &amp; Inayat, Livraghi, Paolone et al., Ražinskas &amp; Čeponienė, Tesoriero et al.). It is contrasted with the microservices architecture of FSMicroGenerator and Prasanthan et al.&lt;SEP&gt;Architectural style that reference [22] compares with microservice architecture.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d4">Microservices-Driven_Automation_in_Full-Stack_Deve.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467621</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
