<node id="Code Generation Tools">
  <data key="d0">Code Generation Tools</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tools that automate development to improve efficiency and accessibility. Their limitations include being language-specific, monolithic, frontend- or backend-only, requiring manual input, and lacking template import or modification.</data>
