<node id="Microservices">
  <data key="d0">Microservices</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Distributed architecture style; the article's generator targets it, while several reviewed tools are monolithic and do not support it.&lt;SEP&gt;Architectural style of the generated backend, with base structures including caching, middlewares, monitoring, and logging, plus complementary microservices like member management and taxonomy.&lt;SEP&gt;Architectural principles inspiring the structuring of applications into packages, modules and projects, enabling modularity, reusability and scalability.&lt;SEP&gt;Architectural style of the applications generated by FSMicroGenerator. Each microservice exposes a Prometheus-compatible /metrics endpoint.&lt;SEP&gt;Architectural style in which each bounded context is implemented as an independent service.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Microservices-Driven_Automation_in_Full-Stack_Deve.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467633</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
