  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Architecture followed by the integration of components in the tool by Uyanik and Sahin.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Microservices-Driven_Automation_in_Full-Stack_Deve.pdf</data>
