  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Messaging platform used for automated alerts on high-severity issues and for notifications of deployment success or failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Notification channel included in the default preconfigured alerting setup that FSMicroGenerator provides for incidents such as high memory usage or service unavailability.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Microservices-Driven_Automation_in_Full-Stack_Deve.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467650</data>
