  <data key="d0">FSMicroGenerator offers greater flexibility than LCNC platforms</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Compared with low-code/no-code solutions, FSMicroGenerator offers greater flexibility by enabling advanced customization."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">Microservices-Driven_Automation_in_Full-Stack_Deve.pdf</data>
