  <data key="d0">Manual Development</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Conventional, hand-written development of inventory management systems, used as the comparison baseline against FSMicroGenerator-generated applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">Microservices-Driven_Automation_in_Full-Stack_Deve.pdf</data>
