  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [28]. An online resource by Stack Overflow, accessed June 6, 2025. The listed URL (survey.stackoverflow.co/2023/) points to the 2023 edition even though the title says 2024.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-025</data>
