  <data key="d2">The Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 License is the license under which the article presenting FSMicroGenerator is published and distributed. The article, also called "This Paper" or "the FSMicroGenerator paper," describes FSMicroGenerator and was accepted for publication in IEEE Access.

