</node>
<node id="Grafana">
  <data key="d0">Grafana</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Grafana is an open-source monitoring and visualization tool that serves as a dashboard platform for observing system behavior and performance. It works closely with Prometheus, complementing it with dashboards for exploring and interacting with time-series data, particularly real-time performance metrics. Together, Grafana and Prometheus form the monitoring stack for microservices.

Within the described system, Grafana is an infrastructure service included in the generated Docker Compose files, so visualization capabilities come built into the deployed environment. It ships with a default Prometheus data source and a set of standard dashboard templates, which give a ready-to-use monitoring setup from the start. The engine personalizes Grafana's otherwise static templates, adapting the dashboards to the specific project. As a result, Grafana is used to monitor the generated modules, providing visibility into their operation and performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-026</data>
  <data key="d4">Microservices-Driven_Automation_in_Full-Stack_Deve.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791467662</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Accurate AI Assistance in Contract Law Using Retrieval-Augmented Generation to Advance Legal Technology">
  <data key="d0">Accurate AI Assistance in Contract Law Using Retrieval-Augmented Generation to Advance Legal Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read, published in IJACSA Vol 16, No 2, 2025. It presents a semantic legal chatbot (AI Lawyer) that uses retrieval-augmented generation and large language models to answer contract and property law questions in multiple languages. The chatbot relies on official legal documents to avoid LLM hallucinations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
