<node id="AI Lawyer">
  <data key="d0">AI Lawyer</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Semantic legal chatbot proposed by the article. It interacts with contract law data, answers questions in English and French, and helps users draft contracts. It can be adapted to other countries by changing its legal databases.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
