</node>
<node id="Contract Law">
  <data key="d0">Contract Law</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal domain targeted by the chatbot, including contract management law and contract drafting.&lt;SEP&gt;Legal domain used as the paper's case study; the chatbot helps citizens understand it.&lt;SEP&gt;Legal domain governing formation, execution and nullity of contracts, targeted by the AI assistance model.&lt;SEP&gt;Legal domain addressed by the AI assistance system.&lt;SEP&gt;Legal domain targeted by the assistance system, demanding a very high level of response fidelity given the sensitivity and rigor of legal inquiries.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008</data>
