<node id="Contract Drafting">
  <data key="d0">Contract Drafting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal task for which ChatGPT and Gemini were assessed.&lt;SEP&gt;Task of creating accurate, legally compliant contracts. The chatbot assists non-expert users with this task by guiding them on the key information to include.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-003</data>
