</node>
<node id="Misinformation">
  <data key="d0">Misinformation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Risk in the legal domain that AI chatbots based on LLMs and RAG aim to reduce.&lt;SEP&gt;Incorrect information often produced by large language models and non-RAG chatbots. Retrieval-augmented generation reduces it.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
