</node>
<node id="Legal Digitalization">
  <data key="d0">Legal Digitalization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Field of digitizing legal services, analyzed in the paper's related-work section.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Misinformation Reduction">
  <data key="d0">Misinformation Reduction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Goal of minimizing incorrect or speculative information by relying on verified, regularly updated data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Democratization Of Justice">
  <data key="d0">Democratization Of Justice</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Broader access to justice, promoted by simplifying access to legal information.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LLMs can produce inaccurate or misleading information">
  <data key="d0">LLMs can produce inaccurate or misleading information</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Despite their impressive fluency and conversational capabilities, this suggests that LLMs can still produce inaccurate or misleading information [16].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RAG systems enhance LLMs by integrating vector databases">
  <data key="d0">RAG systems enhance LLMs by integrating vector databases</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">These systems enhance LLMs by integrating them with vector databases containing relevant information [17].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Retrieval augmentation has proven highly effective">
  <data key="d0">Retrieval augmentation has proven highly effective</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">This augmentation strategy has proven highly effective [18], as it addresses the shortcomings of LLMs in processing legal data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LLM and RAG synergy yields robust context-sensitive legal applications">
  <data key="d0">LLM and RAG synergy yields robust context-sensitive legal applications</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The synergy between LLMs and RAG systems provides more robust and context-sensitive applications in this domain [19].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chatbots automate routine tasks and enhance user experience">
  <data key="d0">Chatbots automate routine tasks and enhance user experience</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Chatbots are widely used to automate routine tasks, save time, and enhance user experience across various industries [20], [21], [22].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chatbots serve as virtual assistants handling structured and informal tasks">
  <data key="d0">Chatbots serve as virtual assistants handling structured and informal tasks</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Integrated into chat platforms, chatbots often serve as virtual assistants, capable of handling both structured tasks and informal conversations within their programmed expertise [23], [24].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chatbots are reshaping human-technology interaction">
  <data key="d0">Chatbots are reshaping human-technology interaction</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">As their applications continue to expand, chatbots are reshaping interactions between humans and technology [21], [25].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Information Retrieval Mechanism">
  <data key="d0">Information Retrieval Mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Key component of Retrieval-Augmented Generation. It searches for and fetches relevant documents or data to place into the LLM's context.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Contextual Content Generation">
  <data key="d0">Contextual Content Generation</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Key component of Retrieval-Augmented Generation. It produces responses grounded in the retrieved context and is integrated into interactive systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Legal Transparency And Accessibility">
  <data key="d0">Legal Transparency And Accessibility</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Goal of making complex legal texts and legal processes more accessible and transparent to citizens. The proposed chatbot is presented as a significant improvement toward this goal.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jurisdictional Adaptability">
  <data key="d0">Jurisdictional Adaptability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dynamic personalization and adaptability of the legal chatbot to local laws. The chatbot is adapted to different jurisdictions by modifying its integrated databases and legal rules, so it can meet each country's specific needs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Customer Support">
  <data key="d0">Customer Support</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Application area in which chatbots improve efficiency and availability.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Education">
  <data key="d0">Education</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Application area in which chatbots enable personalized learning experiences.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Entertainment">
  <data key="d0">Entertainment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Application area in which chatbots create interactive user experiences.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chatbots Reshape Human-Technology Interactions">
  <data key="d0">Chatbots Reshape Human-Technology Interactions</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "As their applications continue to expand, chatbots are reshaping interactions between humans and technology [21], [25]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NLU Identifies Intent, Extracts Information and Understands Context">
  <data key="d0">NLU Identifies Intent, Extracts Information and Understands Context</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "This involves analyzing natural language to identify intent, extract relevant information, and understand the context of the conversation [26], [27], ensuring that the chatbot can respond appropriately to user needs."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Retrieval Models Select Existing Responses">
  <data key="d0">Retrieval Models Select Existing Responses</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "This can be achieved using predefined rule-based systems, retrieval models that select existing responses [26], [28], or generative models that create unique and personalized responses tailored to the user's input."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Remembering Previous Exchanges Lets Chatbots Adapt Responses">
  <data key="d0">Remembering Previous Exchanges Lets Chatbots Adapt Responses</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "By remembering previous exchanges [27], chatbots can adjust their responses according to the evolving needs of the user, improving the flow and relevance of the conversation."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RAG Produces Natural, Contextually Appropriate and Reliable Responses">
  <data key="d0">RAG Produces Natural, Contextually Appropriate and Reliable Responses</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "By integrating the robustness of a generative model with the relevance and timeliness of the retrieved data, RAG produces responses that are not only natural and human-like but also contextually appropriate and highly reliable [16], [29]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RAG Is a Major Advancement in Generative Models">
  <data key="d0">RAG Is a Major Advancement in Generative Models</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "This fusion of retrieval and generation delivers results that are inaccessible by either component in isolation, positioning RAG as a major advancement in generative models [13], [30]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Document Associations Can Be Established via Annotations or Weak Supervision">
  <data key="d0">Document Associations Can Be Established via Annotations or Weak Supervision</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "The direct association between a document z ∈ Z and a tuple (x, y) ∈ D is not necessarily known, although it can be established through human annotations [31], [32] or weakly supervised signals [33]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Information Retrieval Organizes Unstructured Data to Find Relevant Information">
  <data key="d0">Information Retrieval Organizes Unstructured Data to Find Relevant Information</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Information Retrieval (IR) is a field of information science and computer science that focuses on the representation, storage, and organization of unstructured data to help users find and retrieve relevant information based on their queries [36], [37], [38]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Text Generation Creates Readable Coherent Texts">
  <data key="d0">Text Generation Creates Readable Coherent Texts</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Text generation represents a crucial domain in natural language processing and artificial intelligence, aiming to automatically create readable and coherent texts from existing information [40]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dense Passage Retrieval">
  <data key="d0">Dense Passage Retrieval</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">DPR; neural document retriever projecting documents and queries into a shared dense encoding space and scoring relevance via dot product.&lt;SEP&gt;A dense retrieval method for open-domain question answering, introduced by Karpukhin et al. (2020).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Information Retrieval">
  <data key="d0">Information Retrieval</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">IR; field focusing on representation, storage and organization of unstructured data to retrieve relevant information for queries.&lt;SEP&gt;Task of retrieving relevant information. The text notes that RAG models can also be used for it.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Information Generation">
  <data key="d0">Information Generation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Task (IG), also called text generation, of automatically creating readable and coherent texts from existing information using machine learning and NLP.&lt;SEP&gt;IG, or text generation; automatically creating readable, coherent texts from existing information using ML and NLP techniques.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Response Generation">
  <data key="d0">Response Generation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">One of three key elements of chatbot performance. It provides suitable and contextually relevant answers using predefined rule-based systems, retrieval models that select existing responses, or generative models that create personalized responses.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Conversation Context Management">
  <data key="d0">Conversation Context Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">One of three key elements of chatbot performance. It maintains coherence in long interactions by remembering previous exchanges, so chatbots can adjust their responses to the user's evolving needs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Outdated Knowledge">
  <data key="d0">Outdated Knowledge</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A limitation of LLMs that RAG overcomes by anchoring generated content on up-to-date information from reliable external sources.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Neural Document Retrievers">
  <data key="d0">Neural Document Retrievers</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">An advanced IR approach that typically uses two independent encoders, such as BERT, to separately encode the query and the document. Relevance is estimated by a single similarity score between the two encoded representations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DPR Narrows Search to Relevant Documents">
  <data key="d0">DPR Narrows Search to Relevant Documents</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Therefore, the first step of RAG is to use document retrievers, such as DPR [29], to narrow the search down to a handful of relevant documents."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Text Generator Produces Output Conditioned on Input and Retrieved Documents">
  <data key="d0">Text Generator Produces Output Conditioned on Input and Retrieved Documents</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Then, the second step is to use a text generator [34], [35] to produce the desired result y by taking both the input x and the retrieved document set Z as conditions."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Neural Retrievers Use Independent Encoders Such as BERT">
  <data key="d0">Neural Retrievers Use Independent Encoders Such as BERT</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "These typically use two independent encoders, such as BERT [39], to separately encode the query and the document."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DPR Projects Documents and Queries into a Shared Dense Space">
  <data key="d0">DPR Projects Documents and Queries into a Shared Dense Space</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "For example, in the DPR model [33], the documents Z and contextual queries x are projected into the same dense encoding space."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ref [40] Text Generation">
  <data key="d0">Ref [40] Text Generation</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [40]; supports the description of text generation as a crucial NLP and AI domain that automatically creates readable, coherent texts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ref [41] Neural Text Generation Models">
  <data key="d0">Ref [41] Neural Text Generation Models</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [41]; supports the statement that text generation models use deep neural networks to learn linguistic and contextual structures.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ref [42] Chatbot Development Growth">
  <data key="d0">Ref [42] Chatbot Development Growth</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [42]; supports the claim that AI advancements led to increased development and deployment of chatbots.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ref [43] Technical Advancements in Chatbot Development">
  <data key="d0">Ref [43] Technical Advancements in Chatbot Development</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [43]; addresses technical advancements in chatbot development to enhance capabilities and effectiveness.</data>
