  <data key="d0">Smart Contracts</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Complex legal/code documents for which a dedicated chatbot was proposed to help non-technical users generate code.&lt;SEP&gt;Programs on the blockchain to which vehicle data such as registration, maintenance, and ownership records are transmitted, validated, and recorded.&lt;SEP&gt;Programs receiving vehicle registration, maintenance and ownership data, which are validated and recorded on the blockchain ledger.</data>
