  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited source on the Moroccan Code of Obligations and Contracts promulgated by the Dahir of August 12, 1913.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited work on delivery period and home-school trips contributing to congestion in Belgium.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-004</data>
