<node id="Retrieval-based response generation outperforms retrieval-only or generation-only models">
  <data key="d0">Retrieval-based response generation outperforms retrieval-only or generation-only models</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">several studies have focused on enhancing chatbot systems to address this issue, through the integration of a retrieval-based response generation model, which has outperformed models based solely on retrieval or generation, offering increased fluency, improved contextual relevance, and greater diversity in responses [49].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RAG retrieves texts from an external corpus and provides them to an LLM">
  <data key="d0">RAG retrieves texts from an external corpus and provides them to an LLM</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">This technology is Retrieval-Augmented Generation, which involves retrieving texts from a relevant external corpus for the task, and then providing them to the large language model [29], [50].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RAG integrates retrieved texts via cross-attention">
  <data key="d0">RAG integrates retrieved texts via cross-attention</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">RAG improves the performance of LLMs by integrating the retrieved texts via cross-attention [29], [51], [52] or by directly inserting the retrieved documents into the prompt.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LLMs are trained on massive datasets to process and generate text">
  <data key="d0">LLMs are trained on massive datasets to process and generate text</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Large language models, advanced systems for natural language processing, are trained on massive datasets to process and generate text [34].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RAG models can be used for information retrieval">
  <data key="d0">RAG models can be used for information retrieval</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Although they are designed for tasks such as machine translation, summarization, and conversational interactions, RAG models can also be used for information retrieval [13].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RAG succeeds on knowledge-intensive NLP tasks">
  <data key="d0">RAG succeeds on knowledge-intensive NLP tasks</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Retrieval-augmented generation has demonstrated notable success in several natural language processing tasks requiring deep knowledge, such as answering general knowledge questions accurately, fact-checking with high precision, and answering questions within specific domains [17], [29].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="The COC is the foundation of contract law in Morocco">
  <data key="d0">The COC is the foundation of contract law in Morocco</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">"We found that contract management in Morocco is called the \"Code of Obligations and Contracts (COC),\" promulgated by the Dahir of August 12, 1913, which serves as the foundation of contract law in the country [53]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dahir of August 12, 1913">
  <data key="d0">Dahir of August 12, 1913</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Royal decree that promulgated the Moroccan Code of Obligations and Contracts (COC).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Human Intervention">
  <data key="d0">Human Intervention</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Human oversight that the text calls essential for legal chatbots. The reasons given are the sensitivity of legal information and the risk of severe consequences from incorrect answers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Knowledge-Intensive NLP Tasks">
  <data key="d0">Knowledge-Intensive NLP Tasks</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Natural language processing tasks that require deep knowledge. Examples given are general knowledge question answering, fact-checking and domain-specific question answering, where RAG has shown notable success.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Prompt Insertion Of Retrieved Documents">
  <data key="d0">Prompt Insertion Of Retrieved Documents</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Alternative to cross-attention in which retrieved documents are inserted directly into the LLM prompt to improve performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AI Assistance Model For Contract Law">
  <data key="d0">AI Assistance Model For Contract Law</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Model proposed in the article for efficiently accessing legal knowledge on contracts. Its workflow has three stages: data collection and document pre-processing, document embedding and storage, and similarity search with answer generation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="OCR">
  <data key="d0">OCR</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Optical character recognition technology used to convert text images in PDF documents into usable digital text.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recursive Text Splitter">
  <data key="d0">Recursive Text Splitter</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Text chunking method that divides documents into segments of up to 4,000 characters without overlap, using separators such as line breaks, periods, exclamation and question marks, and spaces.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LLM-Embedder">
  <data key="d0">LLM-Embedder</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Embedding model known for capturing complex semantic relationships and linguistic nuances, used to convert text segments and user questions into vector representations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Facebook AI Similarity Search (FAISS)">
  <data key="d0">Facebook AI Similarity Search (FAISS)</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Library recognized for efficient and scalable similarity search, suited to large datasets and offering significant speed advantages.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Approximate Nearest Neighbor Search">
  <data key="d0">Approximate Nearest Neighbor Search</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Nearest-neighbor (ANN) search performed by the vector database to return the most similar context vectors, with Top-k = 3.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GPT-4 Turbo">
  <data key="d0">GPT-4 Turbo</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Large language model developed by OpenAI with improved speed and accuracy, 128K-token context length and April 2023 knowledge cutoff.&lt;SEP&gt;Large language model evaluated in the RAG pipeline; achieved Faithfulness 1, Answer Relevance 0.971 and response time 3.12.&lt;SEP&gt;Large language model (gpt-4-turbo) evaluated in the system. It has an average response time of 3.12 seconds, with per-question times of 3.10, 2.95, 3.46, 4.00 and 3.34 seconds. Its answers cite specific articles and pages of the Dahir formant Code des obligations et des contrats.&lt;SEP&gt;Large language model that outperforms Llama 3 in fidelity (score of 1) and answer relevance (score of 0.971); selected for definitive integration into the RAG process of the legal assistance system.&lt;SEP&gt;Large language model chosen for the system due to richness, fidelity and contextual relevance of responses, despite being slower.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Llama 3">
  <data key="d0">Llama 3</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Family of large language models developed by Meta, available in 8 billion and 70 billion parameter versions, pre-trained or instruction-tuned, with 8K-token context length and December 2023 knowledge cutoff.&lt;SEP&gt;Large language model evaluated in the RAG pipeline; achieved Faithfulness 0.84, Answer Relevance 0.79 and response time 0.86.&lt;SEP&gt;Large language model (Llama3) integrated into the system using Groq technology. It has an average response time of 0.86 seconds, with per-question times of 1.21, 0.66, 0.80, 0.67 and 1.06 seconds. Its speed comes with a slight reduction in answer quality. Some of its answers cite Dahir.pdf, while others rely on general concepts or state that information is not explicitly provided.&lt;SEP&gt;Large language model evaluated in the system; gained speed through Groq integration but showed slightly reduced answer quality, with fidelity 0.84 and answer relevance 0.79.&lt;SEP&gt;Large language model offering superior speed but less depth in complex legal cases.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="OpenAI">
  <data key="d0">OpenAI</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Organization that developed GPT-4 Turbo.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Meta">
  <data key="d0">Meta</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Organization that developed the Llama 3 family of models.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Retrieval-Augmented Chatbot">
  <data key="d0">Retrieval-Augmented Chatbot</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Chatbot that answers user questions using only context retrieved from a document knowledge base, returning "Not applicable" when no usable context exists.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reference [54]">
  <data key="d0">Reference [54]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited work supporting the suitability of the LLM-Embedder model for extracting relevant, context-rich information from documents.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reference [55]">
  <data key="d0">Reference [55]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited work on FAISS's efficient and scalable similarity search for large datasets.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reference [56]">
  <data key="d0">Reference [56]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited work on FAISS's efficient and scalable similarity search for large datasets.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reference [57]">
  <data key="d0">Reference [57]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited work on FAISS's speed advantages.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LLM-Embedder is ideal for extracting relevant context-rich information">
  <data key="d0">LLM-Embedder is ideal for extracting relevant context-rich information</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "This model, characterized by its precision in analyzing linguistic nuances, is ideal for extracting relevant and context-rich information from documents [54]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FAISS provides efficient and scalable similarity search for large datasets">
  <data key="d0">FAISS provides efficient and scalable similarity search for large datasets</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "For this task, we opted for the use of Facebook AI Similarity Search (FAISS), recognized for its efficient and scalable similarity search capabilities, particularly suited to the management of large datasets [55], [56]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FAISS offers significant speed advantages">
  <data key="d0">FAISS offers significant speed advantages</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "FAISS offers significant advantages, particularly in terms of speed [57]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Top-k Retrieval">
  <data key="d0">Top-k Retrieval</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Retrieval setting in which the vector database index is queried for a fixed number of most similar vectors; the system uses Top-k = 3 to set how much context is retrieved for each user question.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Context-Grounded Prompting">
  <data key="d0">Context-Grounded Prompting</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Prompting procedure in which the user question and the retrieved text chunks are sent to the LLM in a prompt. The LLM is instructed to answer using only the provided context, to respect the limits set for sensitive information, and to return a standard "Not applicable" message when the context contains no usable data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Instruction-Tuned Llama 3">
  <data key="d0">Instruction-Tuned Llama 3</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Instruction-tuned variants of Llama 3, optimized for specific chat use cases and reported to outperform many other models.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Semantic Similarity Search">
  <data key="d0">Semantic Similarity Search</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Retrieval of the most relevant document chunks by comparing the embedding of a user query with stored embeddings in a vector database.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sensitive Information">
  <data key="d0">Sensitive Information</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Nature of the technical documentation handled by the chatbot. Generated answers must respect the limits set for this type of information.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PDF Technical Documentation">
  <data key="d0">PDF Technical Documentation</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">Digital technical documentation in PDF format used to build the chatbot's knowledge base. It is processed with OCR and split into non-overlapping chunks of up to 4,000 characters.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Es et al., 2023, RAGAS">
  <data key="d0">Es et al., 2023, RAGAS</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [58]. Work by Es et al. from 2023 introducing the RAGAS (Retrieval-Augmented Generation Evaluation) framework, which evaluates RAG pipelines component by component and defines metrics such as Faithfulness and Answer Relevance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Es">
  <data key="d0">Es</data>
  <data key="d1">author</data>
  <data key="d2">First author (Es et al.) of the 2023 work introducing the RAGAS framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RAGAS">
  <data key="d0">RAGAS</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Retrieval-Augmented Generation Evaluation Framework that evaluates RAG systems component by component (Retriever and Generator), offering state-of-the-art tools to scrutinize LLM-generated text.&lt;SEP&gt;Evaluation framework planned for continuously evaluating the system's performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Framework for automated evaluation of retrieval-augmented generation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Contract Law Assistance System">
  <data key="d0">Contract Law Assistance System</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Chatbot system built on a RAG architecture providing accurate, contextualized answers to contract law questions based on Moroccan law; returns "Not applicable" when no relevant context is found.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Faithfulness">
  <data key="d0">Faithfulness</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">RAGAS metric assessing factual consistency of the generated response with the provided context; scores range from 0 to 1.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Answer Relevance">
  <data key="d0">Answer Relevance</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">RAGAS metric computing the average cosine similarity between the original question and synthetic questions derived from the answer.&lt;SEP&gt;Evaluation metric measuring the relevance of generated answers; GPT-4 Turbo scored 0.971 versus 0.79 for Llama 3.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Moroccan COD Law Documentation">
  <data key="d0">Moroccan COD Law Documentation</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">Documentation of Moroccan contract law (COD) used as the knowledge source for the assistance system.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Generator Component">
  <data key="d0">Generator Component</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Component of a RAG pipeline that generates text based on retrieved context; the focus of evaluation in the study.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Retriever Component">
  <data key="d0">Retriever Component</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Component of a RAG pipeline responsible for retrieving context, evaluated separately by RAGAS.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RAGAS evaluates RAG systems component by component">
  <data key="d0">RAGAS evaluates RAG systems component by component</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "This granular approach provides a nuanced understanding of system performance, identifying strengths and weaknesses at each stage of the process [58]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Faithfulness measures whether response statements can be deduced from context">
  <data key="d0">Faithfulness measures whether response statements can be deduced from context</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "It determines the extent to which the statements made in the response can be logically deduced from the context [58]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Answer Relevance uses cosine similarity between original and synthetic questions">
  <data key="d0">Answer Relevance uses cosine similarity between original and synthetic questions</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "It calculates the average cosine similarity between the original question and synthetic questions derived from the answer [58]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GPT-4 Turbo outperforms Llama 3 in faithfulness and relevance">
  <data key="d0">GPT-4 Turbo outperforms Llama 3 in faithfulness and relevance</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding in the text: GPT-4 Turbo scored Faithfulness 1 and Answer Relevance 0.971 versus Llama 3's 0.84 and 0.79, while Llama 3 had a faster response time (0.86 vs 3.12).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Large Language Model">
  <data key="d0">Large Language Model</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Generative AI model integrated into the RAG pipeline of the contract law assistance system. It synthesizes the data provided by the system's prompt so that responses are coherent and contextualized. It is not allowed to answer from its general knowledge alone when no relevant context is found.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Response Time">
  <data key="d0">Response Time</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Evaluation metric measuring the time each model takes to answer queries, in seconds.&lt;SEP&gt;Metric used alongside Faithfulness and Answer Relevance to compare GPT-4 Turbo (3.12) and Llama 3 (0.86) in Table II.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Misinformation Avoidance">
  <data key="d0">Misinformation Avoidance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Design goal of the contract law assistance system. The system returns "Not applicable" when no relevant context is found, to avoid misinformation or inaccuracies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Moroccan Law">
  <data key="d0">Moroccan Law</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal system whose datasets, specifically the Code of Obligations and Contracts (COD), serve as the example knowledge base for the contract law assistance system.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Llama 3 has faster response time than GPT-4 Turbo">
  <data key="d0">Llama 3 has faster response time than GPT-4 Turbo</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding in the text from Table II: Llama 3 had a response time of 0.86 compared with 3.12 for GPT-4 Turbo, despite lower faithfulness (0.84) and answer relevance (0.79).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Groq">
  <data key="d0">Groq</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Advanced technology that optimizes query processing and meets the demands of high-responsiveness environments; credited for Llama 3's superior speed.&lt;SEP&gt;Advanced technology that optimizes query processing and meets the demands of high-responsiveness environments; credited for Llama 3's speed improvement when integrated into the system.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dahir Formant Code Des Obligations Et Des Contrats">
  <data key="d0">Dahir Formant Code Des Obligations Et Des Contrats</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">Moroccan legal code (Dahir of 9 Ramadan 1331) on obligations and contracts, used as the source document collection for answering legal questions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Answer Quality">
  <data key="d0">Answer Quality</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Quality of generated answers, which was slightly reduced for Llama 3 in exchange for speed.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Contract Law Question Answering">
  <data key="d0">Contract Law Question Answering</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Task of answering questions on contract validity, defects in consent, damages for non-performance, breach and seller obligations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Llama 3 is faster than GPT-4 Turbo but with slightly lower answer quality">
  <data key="d0">Llama 3 is faster than GPT-4 Turbo but with slightly lower answer quality</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding stated in the text: "The average response time for GPT-4 Turbo is 3.12 seconds, whereas Llama 3 stands out with a remarkably reduced response time of 0.86 seconds... However, this improvement in speed for Llama 3 appears to have come at the cost of a slight reduction in answer quality."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Llama 3's speed is attributed to Groq technology">
  <data key="d0">Llama 3's speed is attributed to Groq technology</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "This superior speed of Llama 3 is attributed to the use of Groq technology during its integration into our system."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Essential Elements Of A Valid Contract">
  <data key="d0">Essential Elements Of A Valid Contract</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal question posed to the models. GPT-4 Turbo answered: capacity to obligate, valid declaration of will, a certain object, and a lawful cause (Article 2 of the Dahir).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Defects In Consent">
  <data key="d0">Defects In Consent</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal notion of defects that can render a contract null and void, namely error, fraud (dol) and duress (violence). The concept was posed as a question to both models.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Damages For Non-Performance Of A Contract">
  <data key="d0">Damages For Non-Performance Of A Contract</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal question about the conditions for claiming damages: failure to perform, attribution to the debtor, causal link, and proof of damage. Llama 3 stated these conditions were not explicitly given in the provided text.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Seller's Obligations In A Contract Of Sale">
  <data key="d0">Seller's Obligations In A Contract Of Sale</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal question on seller obligations. GPT-4 Turbo answered: delivering the thing sold and guaranteeing peaceful possession free from defects and third-party claims (Articles 498 and 499 of the Dahir).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Breach Of Contract">
  <data key="d0">Breach Of Contract</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal question on what happens when one party fails to perform a contract. The answers covered specific performance, resolution of the contract in court, and damages for losses.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dahir.pdf">
  <data key="d0">Dahir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal document file cited as the source in Llama 3's answers, for example page 69, page 50 and page 29.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fidelity">
  <data key="d0">Fidelity</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Evaluation metric measuring how well generated responses align with facts and the provided context; GPT-4 Turbo scored 1 versus 0.84 for Llama 3.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Legal Texts">
  <data key="d0">Legal Texts</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal texts used as the primary source during the data augmentation phase for answer generation, ensuring contextual accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Speed-Quality Trade-off">
  <data key="d0">Speed-Quality Trade-off</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Observed phenomenon in which Llama 3's speed improvement through Groq appears to come at the cost of a slight reduction in answer quality.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Table II">
  <data key="d0">Table II</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Results table in the paper reporting that GPT-4 Turbo outperforms Llama 3 in fidelity (1 versus 0.84) and answer relevance (0.971 versus 0.79).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Legal Domain">
  <data key="d0">Legal Domain</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Broader field targeted by the assistance system, within which contract law is the specific focus; requires a very high level of response fidelity given the sensitivity and rigor of legal inquiries.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Data Augmentation Phase">
  <data key="d0">Data Augmentation Phase</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Phase of the RAG process in which legal texts are relied upon as the primary source for answer generation, ensuring enhanced contextual accuracy and better alignment with the needs of users in the legal field.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Contextual Accuracy">
  <data key="d0">Contextual Accuracy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Quality of responses aligning with facts and the provided context; enhanced by relying on legal texts during data augmentation and reflected in GPT-4 Turbo's high fidelity, which ensures a reliable and accurate user experience.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Legal Vector Database">
  <data key="d0">Legal Vector Database</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">Database of official legal data such as national laws and regulations, based on Moroccan legislation, used to augment LLM responses.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Legal Assistance">
  <data key="d0">Legal Assistance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Field of AI-driven support for legal tasks, including contract management and access to justice.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Contract Management">
  <data key="d0">Contract Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal domain targeted by the chatbot, including creation of compliant contracts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Access to Justice">
  <data key="d0">Access to Justice</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Goal advanced by the system through facilitating understanding of laws and democratizing access to legal information.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
