<node id="Legal Chatbot">
  <data key="d0">Legal Chatbot</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">The chatbot developed by the article being read. It delivers accurate, contextually appropriate legal responses based on official legal data. The authors state that it surpasses existing chatbots in the domain but does not replace professional legal advice or human expertise.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Moroccan Legislation">
  <data key="d0">Moroccan Legislation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">National laws and regulations of Morocco that form the data basis of the system, ensuring compliance with the national legal framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Not Applicable Option">
  <data key="d0">Not Applicable Option</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">System mechanism that responds "Not applicable" when the sought information is not explicitly available in the legal texts. It avoids incorrect or unfounded answers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multimodal Capabilities">
  <data key="d0">Multimodal Capabilities</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Planned future functionality, including speech recognition and document analysis, to be integrated into the system.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Explainability">
  <data key="d0">Explainability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Planned future improvement that would provide explicit legal references in the system's responses.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791500933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Automated Legal Updates">
  <data key="d0">Automated Legal Updates</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Planned future improvement that would automate updating of the legal databases to keep pace with evolving legislation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
