  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read, by Hafida Khalfaoui, Abderrazak Farchane and Said Safi. It surveys security issues in Mobile Ad hoc Networks, reviews existing security solutions and their shortcomings, and explains how AI techniques can improve routing protocol security and connectivity between mobile nodes.</data>
