<node id="MANET Security">
  <data key="d0">MANET Security</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Problem of protecting MANETs from malicious nodes and attacks. It covers privacy, availability, integrity and non-repudiation.&lt;SEP&gt;Security of Mobile Ad hoc Networks. MANETs are vulnerable to network threats because they lack wire links and a fixed architecture.</data>
