<node id="Luong et al. [27]">
  <data key="d0">Luong et al. [27]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [27]; by Luong et al.; uses machine learning with a route discovery frequency vector (RDFV) and FADA on AODV to detect and prevent flooding attacks in MANETs, achieving a misbehavior detection ratio over 99%.&lt;SEP&gt;Work cited as [27]. It addresses intrusion detection of flooding attacks with machine learning (RDFV with DATA and AODV). It achieves a higher misbehavior detection ratio and packet delivery ratio, reduced routing overhead and lower end-to-end delay, but it is not resistant to dynamic attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501030</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Luong">
  <data key="d0">Luong</data>
  <data key="d1">author</data>
