<node id="Blockchain Technology">
  <data key="d0">Blockchain Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Technology that the authors plan to integrate with AI in future work to strengthen MANET protection.&lt;SEP&gt;Technology offering decentralization, immutability and transparent auditability, presented as a solution to fragmented vehicle data management.&lt;SEP&gt;Technology that can be used to authenticate vehicles and secure information exchanges and financial transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26549e3ff493405b55b221c1d804516e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-004</data>
