  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Machine learning approach that Luong et al. combine with DATA and AODV for intrusion detection of flooding attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-004</data>
