<node id="Faster Response Time">
  <data key="d0">Faster Response Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Advantage of AI in MANET security: AI can solve security problems faster and with higher precision than traditional techniques, using alert systems and protected data logs to speed up threat analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501031</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Massive Data Management">
  <data key="d0">Massive Data Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Challenge of securing exponentially growing, complex data from log files and system-generated warnings. AI can assist with data selection and security.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501031</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Most current MANET security approaches have limitations">
  <data key="d0">Most current MANET security approaches have limitations</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Finding stated in the text: "After evaluating the existing system, we found that the majority of current security approaches have limitations that fill gaps in network security."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501031</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mitigation of Black Hole and Gray Hole Attack Using Swarm Inspired Algorithm with Artificial Neural Network">
  <data key="d0">Mitigation of Black Hole and Gray Hole Attack Using Swarm Inspired Algorithm with Artificial Neural Network</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference 6, by P. Rani, S. Verma and G.N. Nguyen, published in IEEE Access, vol. 8, pp. 121755–121764 (2020). It addresses mitigation of black hole and gray hole attacks using a swarm-inspired algorithm combined with an artificial neural network.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1e0beceeffe2b62352afd4291e0fd937-chunk-005</data>
