  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "BNs have been used with great success in many systems, with different objectives, from medical diagnostic [21] predicting types of hematological malignancies, to the Water supply field [22] Predicting Rehabilitation of Water Distribution Networks."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
