  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statements made in the text about BNs in transportation: "In the article [23], authors utilized Bayesian networks (BNs) to quantify accident risks... in study [24] authors have developed a BN model to pinpoint factors influencing motor carrier safety. The purpose of two works [25] and [26] was the evaluation of driving behavior..."</data>
