</node>
<node id="Objective Methods">
  <data key="d0">Objective Methods</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Approach to constructing a Bayesian network that uses a database to apply structure learning techniques, with algorithms learning the network structure directly from data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501134</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subjective Methods">
  <data key="d0">Subjective Methods</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Approach to constructing a Bayesian network by acquiring expertise from field specialists through written surveys, one-on-one interviews, or collaborative brainstorming; can incorporate expert knowledge not present in the data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501134</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Structure Learning">
  <data key="d0">Structure Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Techniques applied to a database to learn the structure of a Bayesian network directly from data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501134</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
