  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "In literature, numerous researchers have leaned on expert insights, as seen in studies [30], [31], [32], [33], [34]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501134</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NHTSA Annual Traffic Crash Data Report">
  <data key="d0">NHTSA Annual Traffic Crash Data Report</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [35]. The U.S. Department of Transportation's NHTSA released this annual traffic crash data in 2020, and the report was revised in July 2022. It defines the variables VTRAFWAY, VPROFILE, VTCONT_F and VSURCOND.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501134</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NHTSA Crash Database">
  <data key="d0">NHTSA Crash Database</data>
  <data key="d1">dataset</data>
  <data key="d2">The NHTSA accident records database. It records the traffic way (VTRAFWAY), road grade (VPROFILE), traffic control functioning (VTCONT_F) and road surface condition (VSURCOND) for accidents.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501134</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="National Highway Traffic Safety Administration">
  <data key="d0">National Highway Traffic Safety Administration</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">NHTSA is an agency under the U.S. Department of Transportation and was established by the Highway Safety Act of 1970. It releases annual traffic crash data.&lt;SEP&gt;NHTSA, an agency of the U.S. Department of Transportation. It issued the 2022 Crash Report Sampling System Analytical User's Manual, 2016-2020.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501134</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
