  <data key="d0">Ref [63]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited work on braking distance and accidents.&lt;SEP&gt;Cited as [63] for accidents occurring when braking distance exceeds available stopping distance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-005</data>
