<node id="Road Accident Risk">
  <data key="d0">Road Accident Risk</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Problem modeled through nodes such as Accident on the Road (No accident, Possible Injury, Fatal Injury), braking distance, stopping distance, reaction time, driver condition, alcohol or drug consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk of occurrence of a road accident. This Paper models it with a Bayesian network whose output node 'occurrence of accident' takes the states no accident, possible injury and fatal injury.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501134</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Photovoltaic Static Compensator">
  <data key="d0">Photovoltaic Static Compensator</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Power system device. Reference [74] proposes coordinated fuzzy-logic control of multiple such systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501134</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Supply Chain Sustainability Risk">
  <data key="d0">Supply Chain Sustainability Risk</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Risk domain addressed by Reference [75] using a three-phase model incorporating Fuzzy VIKOR.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501134</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Driver Style">
  <data key="d0">Driver Style</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bayesian network node 1 with linguistic values Good, Medium, Bad.&lt;SEP&gt;Node of the Bayesian network modeling road accident risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-007</data>
