  <data key="d0">Fuzzy controller enhances voltage profile dynamics</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">"The results presented by the author validate that the suggested fuzzy controller has the capability to enhance the dynamics of the voltage profile." (Reference [74])</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
