<node id="Fuzzy logic saves about 41.96% of AC energy consumption">
  <data key="d0">Fuzzy logic saves about 41.96% of AC energy consumption</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">"The research underscores the efficacy of fuzzy logic in optimizing AC power consumption in response to real-time conditions, resulting in an impressive energy savings of around 41.96%." (Reference [76])</data>
