  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">In the article [75] Fuzzy VIKOR is used as a part of a three-phase model for managing supply chain sustainability risks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-006</data>
