  <data key="d0">Fuzzy-Bayesian process begins with variable definition and membership functions</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Step 1: Initial data collection and variable definition, including the identification of linguistic values and the creation of membership functions [90] [91].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
