</node>
<node id="Fuzzy rule sets guide conversion of inputs into outputs">
  <data key="d0">Fuzzy rule sets guide conversion of inputs into outputs</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">"Step 2: Establishment of fuzzy rule sets; constructing a series of \"if-then\" rules that guide the fuzzy inference system in converting input variables into output[90]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
