  <data key="d0">Fuzzy conversion translates inputs into membership degrees</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Step 3: Fuzzy conversion; translating input values into fuzzy representations using membership functions, and assessing the membership degree of each fuzzy subset [92].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
