  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Table in the article titled "States of the Bayesian Network Nodes" (printed as "TATE'S OF THE BAYESIAN NETWORK NODES"), listing 16 nodes with their linguistic values: Driver Style; Kinetic Energy; Physical Vehicle Condition; Planning Parameters; Road Design; Road Surface Condition; Traffic Flow; Negative Emotions; Road Adhesion; Braking Distance; Driver Condition; Reaction Time; Stopping Distance; Accident on the Road; Age; Alcohol or Drug Consumption.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-007</data>
