<node id="The Estimation of Vehicle Speed and Stopping Distance by Pedestrians Crossing Streets in a Naturalistic Traffic Environment">
  <data key="d0">The Estimation of Vehicle Speed and Stopping Distance by Pedestrians Crossing Streets in a Naturalistic Traffic Environment</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [50]. Sun, Zhuang, Wu, Zhao and Zhang, Transportation Research Part F, 2015, volume 30, pp. 97-106. The paper studies how pedestrians estimate vehicle speed and stopping distance when crossing streets in naturalistic traffic.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf</data>
