  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [66]. Written by Gürbüz H and Buyruk S. Published in IET Intelligent Transport Systems, 2019, 13(12):1843-1850. It addresses safe stopping distance and accident risk based on the driver's active sight field.</data>
