  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [67]. Written by Sathyamoorthy G, Vijay R and Lenin Singaravelu D. Published in Proceedings of the Institution of Mechanical Engineers, Part J, 2022, 236(8):1674-1706. It reviews brake friction composite materials and how they influence braking performance.</data>
