  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [83]. Jithendra T and Sharief Basha S, Diagnostics 2023, 13(9):1641. The paper predicts COVID-19 by combining ANFIS with the Reptile Search Algorithm.</data>
