<node id="Locally Deployed Production-Grade Blockchain">
  <data key="d0">Locally Deployed Production-Grade Blockchain</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Research gap identified in the text: many blockchain applications in the vehicle domain remain at pilot stage or rely on cloud infrastructures, while demand grows for locally deployed, production-grade solutions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26549e3ff493405b55b221c1d804516e-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">poster_nihad.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501149</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
