  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">The proposed model combining a Bayesian network and fuzzy logic to quantify QoS in a VANET.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-000</data>
