<node id="On-Board Unit">
  <data key="d0">On-Board Unit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">OBU; wireless communication systems installed in vehicles to enable communication with each other.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ecodid">
  <data key="d0">Ecodid</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Project that integrates information technologies such as sensors, edge computing and AI to let vehicles exchange information with other vehicles, warehouses and road infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Digital intelligent and decisional ecosystem created for Smart DLSP to give each actor and object in the distribution chain an intelligent, collaborative, ubiquitous and evolving character; it adopts a vehicular network.&lt;SEP&gt;System that uses AI techniques to turn vehicles into intelligent nodes that make decisions autonomously, improving logistics operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Smart DLSP project/ecosystem aimed at solving global logistics problems using VANET technology; its architecture is shown in Figure 3.&lt;SEP&gt;System whose performance in bad road conditions and risks could be improved by the connection loss predictions of the FB model.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Logistics 4.0">
  <data key="d0">Logistics 4.0</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Collaborative logistics paradigm targeted by Smart DLSP to improve process efficiency while reducing cost, effort and errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
