<node id="Freight transport growth made logistics vital to companies">
  <data key="d0">Freight transport growth made logistics vital to companies</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">The growth in freight transport due to the expansion of e-commerce and the globalization of industries and commercial exchanges has made logistics and transportation a vital segment of most companies in the competitive market [1].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
