  <data key="d0">Cellular Networks</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">One of the two wireless communication technologies, alongside VANETs, used to share vehicle information across the Ecodid system.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the two wireless communication technologies Ecodid uses to share information across the whole system. VANET is the other.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-001</data>
