  <data key="d0">Radio Frequency Identification</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">RFID; a technology cited as being used, along with robotics and communication technologies, to maximize productivity and minimize costs and errors in logistics.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
