<node id="RSUs With DDSRC Collect and Transmit Traffic Data">
  <data key="d0">RSUs With DDSRC Collect and Transmit Traffic Data</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Some authors [13] used roadside units (RSUs) to collect and transmit traffic data via Dijkstra's dedicated short-range communication protocol (DDSRC).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="New Techniques Improve VANET Performance">
  <data key="d0">New Techniques Improve VANET Performance</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">"The authors of [14] invented new ways to improve a VANET's performance by remov-" (the sentence is truncated in the excerpt).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Existing Protocol Studies Ignore Varied Density and Mobility Environments">
  <data key="d0">Existing Protocol Studies Ignore Varied Density and Mobility Environments</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">"Deficiently, these studies only evaluated new protocols for particular scenarios; therefore, they did not consider the case of various types of environments with different density and mobility models." This is a critique of refs [7]–[12].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Quality Of Service">
  <data key="d0">Quality Of Service</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">QoS in VANET, covering aspects such as routing, connectivity and security. It is measured with metrics such as throughput, delay and packet delivery ratio.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dijkstra's Dedicated Short-Range Communication Protocol">
  <data key="d0">Dijkstra's Dedicated Short-Range Communication Protocol</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">DDSRC, a protocol that determines the shortest route to the destination based on the cost of each transmission path.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Roadside Units">
  <data key="d0">Roadside Units</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">RSUs, used to collect and transmit traffic data in VANET.&lt;SEP&gt;RSUs with network devices that extend the ad hoc communication range and can provide Internet connectivity via base stations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Network Connectivity">
  <data key="d0">Network Connectivity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Node connectivity in VANET; improving it is assumed to improve VANET performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Packets Increase Queue Causing Expiration">
  <data key="d0">Packets Increase Queue Causing Expiration</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "They perceived that the transmission of a large quantity of data in the network creates a queue of packets in the vehicle, which contributes to the expiration time of certain packets before being processed, thus causing a decreased service rate."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FL Decision Provides Low Packet Loss And Latency">
  <data key="d0">FL Decision Provides Low Packet Loss And Latency</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "The simulation results proved that the FL decision provided low packet losses, maintained a high packet delivery ratio, and offered a low latency in variable environments [15]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Better QoS Under 250 m Transmission Range">
  <data key="d0">Better QoS Under 250 m Transmission Range</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "The study assumed that improving the network connectivity could allow a VANET's performance to be tweaked, and it stated that a better QoS could be reached under certain conditions (having less than 250 m in the transmission range) [16]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="BN Defined By DAG Encoding Joint Distribution">
  <data key="d0">BN Defined By DAG Encoding Joint Distribution</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "A BN is defined by a pair (G, O), where G = V, A is a directed acyclic graph that encodes a joint probability distribution over a finite set of categorical variables V, and the arcs A represent direct relationships between them [18]."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="No Previous Solution Met All QoS Criteria">
  <data key="d0">No Previous Solution Met All QoS Criteria</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "In conclusion, none of the previous solutions met all QoS criteria." The text bases this conclusion on the related works summarized in Table 1.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DDSRC Finds Shortest Route Based On Transmission Path Cost">
  <data key="d0">DDSRC Finds Shortest Route Based On Transmission Path Cost</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "Some authors [13] used roadside units (RSUs) to collect and transmit traffic data via Dijkstra's dedicated short-range communication protocol (DDSRC). This algorithm determines the shortest route to the destination based on the cost of each transmission path."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Removing Unused Packets Improves VANET Performance">
  <data key="d0">Removing Unused Packets Improves VANET Performance</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement in the text: "The authors of [14] invented new ways to improve a VANET's performance by removing unused and useless packets."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Communication Medium Selection">
  <data key="d0">Communication Medium Selection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The problem of choosing the most appropriate communication medium for running applications. Ref [15] addresses it with a fuzzy system that considers network density, received signal strength, vehicle speed and cost of service.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501518</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Message Expiration Ratio">
  <data key="d0">Message Expiration Ratio</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">QoS metric used by Ref [14] to evaluate the detection and removal of unused messages.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501527</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Edge Boxes">
  <data key="d0">Edge Boxes</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Devices installed in vehicles and warehouses to collect, process and exchange data locally.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501545</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Kafka Cluster">
  <data key="d0">Kafka Cluster</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Performance messaging platform used for streaming data within the cloud.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501545</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Apache Storm">
  <data key="d0">Apache Storm</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">ETL platform that aggregates, transforms and structures streamed data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501545</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
