<node id="Specification-Driven Synthetic Tabular Data Generation for System Validation and Management Decision Support">
  <data key="d0">Specification-Driven Synthetic Tabular Data Generation for System Validation and Management Decision Support</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">The article being read, published in Journal of Logistics, Informatics and Service Science, Vol. 13 (2026) No. 7, pp. 207-225. It proposes a configurable, specification-driven framework for generating synthetic tabular data that respects user-defined distributions and logical exclusion constraints, with sequential and GPU-accelerated parallel generation strategies, demonstrated on IT infrastructure and smart building case studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Vol.13.No.7.13.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
