<node id="GPU-Accelerated Parallel Generation">
  <data key="d0">GPU-Accelerated Parallel Generation</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Parallel generation method based on CUDA and Numba that significantly reduces generation time.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Vol.13.No.7.13.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CUDA">
  <data key="d0">CUDA</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">GPU computing platform used for the parallel generation method.&lt;SEP&gt;GPU parallel computing platform used to exploit the parallel architecture of the GPU, running thousands of threads concurrently to accelerate core operations.&lt;SEP&gt;GPU parallel computing platform employed to run thousands of threads concurrently, accelerating random sampling, distribution enforcement, and constraint validation.&lt;SEP&gt;NVIDIA parallel computing platform; version 12.8 was used in the experiments. It is discussed in "Parallel Computing Experiences with CUDA".</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Vol.13.No.7.13.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Numba">
  <data key="d0">Numba</data>
  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Python compiler used with CUDA for the parallel generation method.&lt;SEP&gt;Library that compiles Python functions into optimized machine code via just-in-time compilation, complementing CUDA for writing GPU kernels in Python.&lt;SEP&gt;Python GPU programming environment whose kernel environment does not support string manipulation and lacks most high-level Python methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Vol.13.No.7.13.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791501852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Logical Exclusion Constraints">
  <data key="d0">Logical Exclusion Constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Rules encoding forbidden combinations of variable values that generated data must satisfy.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-000</data>
