  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Framework that generates synthetic tabular datasets faithful to user-defined parameters, statistical distributions, and logical constraints, using configuration files that specify variable values, distribution percentages, and exclusion rules.&lt;SEP&gt;Framework of This Paper allowing users to define and enforce explicit rules, offering regulatory compliance, explainability, auditability and strict rule enforcement.</data>
