  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "A first step will be to integrate constraint programming (Echeverria et al., 2025; Krings et al., 2020) to model the conditions more formally."</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-011</data>
