  <data key="d2">The Journal of Logistics, Informatics and Service Science is an academic journal identified by ISSN 2409-2665. It is the venue in which the article by Boukhryss et al., referred to as "This Paper," was published.

The article appears in Volume 13 (2026), Issue No. 7, on pages 207–225 of the Journal of Logistics, Informatics and Service Science.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-014</data>
