  <data key="d0">Post-Quantum Digital Signatures</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Digital signature schemes resistant to quantum attacks; migration to them is a critical issue for future resilience of blockchain infrastructures.&lt;SEP&gt;Digital signature algorithms resistant to quantum attacks. Benchmarked and assessed in references [21] and [22].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-039</data>
