  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">...compare multiple post-quantum KEMs and digital signatures on commodity CPUs and report favorable performance for lattice-based schemes such as Kyber and Dilithium/ML-DSA [22].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Toward_Quantum-Safe_Permissioned_Blockchains_Evalu.pdf</data>
