<node id="Blockchain systems relying on quantum-vulnerable primitives face cryptographic challenges">
  <data key="d0">Blockchain systems relying on quantum-vulnerable primitives face cryptographic challenges</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Yang et al. provide a comprehensive survey and comparison of post-quantum and quantum blockchains, highlighting the cryptographic challenges that arise when blockchain systems rely on quantum-vulnerable primitives [19].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Toward_Quantum-Safe_Permissioned_Blockchains_Evalu.pdf</data>
