  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "More recently, Abbas et al. investigated quantum-safe blockchain integration in Hyperledger Fabric by modifying certificate-generation mechanisms and evaluating post-quantum schemes using tools such as Hyperledger Caliper and Prometheus [9]."</data>
