  <data key="d4">Toward_Quantum-Safe_Permissioned_Blockchains_Evalu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791502203</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Existing Fabric Post-Quantum Works Have Limited System-Level Benchmarking">
  <data key="d0">Existing Fabric Post-Quantum Works Have Limited System-Level Benchmarking</data>
  <data key="d1">claim</data>
  <data key="d2">Statement made in the text: "However, existing Fabric-oriented works are still limited in one or more dimensions: they modify Fabric internals, focus primarily on certificate generation, rely on simulation, target application-specific architectures, or provide limited system-level benchmarking."</data>
