  <data key="d0">Xu et al. [23]</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited as [23]. A post-quantum blockchain study that does not target Hyperledger Fabric. According to Table 1 it addresses PQC signatures, is partially NIST-aligned, and does not address hybrid signatures, ECDSA comparison, real deployment or performance metrics.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-007</data>
