  <data key="d1">methodology</data>
  <data key="d2">Image-encryption approach using a three-dimensional memristive cubic map with dual discrete memristors, cited as [40].</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-035</data>
  <data key="d4">Toward_Quantum-Safe_Permissioned_Blockchains_Evalu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791502219</data>
