<node id="Ref [41] Memristive Rulkov Neuron Video Encryption">
  <data key="d0">Ref [41] Memristive Rulkov Neuron Video Encryption</data>
  <data key="d1">paper</data>
  <data key="d2">Cited work [41] on segment-selective video encryption based on a discrete sinusoidal memristive Rulkov neuron.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-035</data>
  <data key="d4">Toward_Quantum-Safe_Permissioned_Blockchains_Evalu.pdf</data>
