  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Traditional selection requires understanding machine characteristics such as maximum shot size, injection pressure, and screw type [3], as well as mold specifications and material properties like viscosity and density [4].</data>
  <data key="d9">cites</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-000</data>
