<edge source="Abdellah Azmani" target="Abdelmalek Essaadi University">
  <data key="d7">12.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Abdellah Azmani is affiliated with Abdelmalek Essaadi University in Morocco. Several sources place this affiliation in Tetouan, Morocco, which is where the university is headquartered. Others specify that he belongs to the Faculty of Science and Technology of Tangier (also called the Faculty of Science and Technologies), one of the university's constituent faculties.

The references to Tetouan and Tangier do not conflict. Abdelmalek Essaadi University is a multi-campus institution with its main seat in Tetouan and faculties in other cities of northern Morocco, including Tangier. The more detailed descriptions suggest that Azmani's academic work is based at the Tangier faculty. The Tetouan references most likely reflect the university's general institutional address.

Within the Faculty of Science and Technologies, Abdellah Azmani is associated with the Intelligent Automation and BioMedGenomics laboratory. This research unit appears to be the specific setting for his scholarly activities at Abdelmalek Essaadi University.&lt;SEP&gt;Affiliated with Abdelmalek Essaadi University.&lt;SEP&gt;Intelligent Automation Laboratory, Abdelmalek Essaadi University.</data>
  <data key="d9">affiliated_with</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-860e34bf4e631717387a6fc6684e1154-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8153b8d12e35b15bf93bd763cdd0b2f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56015fdaac28ae50466d3ddc4439d39b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26549e3ff493405b55b221c1d804516e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-000</data>
