<edge source="Abdellah Azmani" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Abdellah Azmani and This Paper is one of authorship. Abdellah Azmani, also referred to simply as Azmani, is consistently identified as an author of the paper, which is also described as an article.

Beyond being listed as a co-author, Abdellah Azmani contributed supervision to the work, giving him an oversight role in the research presented in the paper. He is also included in the paper's section of author biographies, which further confirms his formal association with the publication.&lt;SEP&gt;Abdellah Azmani is an author of the article.</data>
