<edge source="Support Vector Machine" target="Random Forest">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between Random Forest (RF) and Support Vector Machine (SVM) is a comparative one. The two are classification techniques evaluated side by side to judge their relative performance. The study selected them for their distinct strengths so that it could make a comprehensive comparison. Reference 12 is also cited as a source that compares these two techniques.

Across the reported evaluations, Random Forest consistently outperformed Support Vector Machine and ranked higher among the tested models. In one experiment, the best Random Forest configuration reached 81% accuracy, compared with 67% for a linear SVM. In that same comparison, Random Forest also led on every other metric:

- F1-score: 78% vs. 66%
- Precision: 85% vs. 66%
- Recall: 81% vs. 67%

Other evaluations reported higher absolute figures but the same pattern. In one, Random Forest achieved 91% accuracy versus 83% for SVM. In another, Random Forest reached 93% versus 87% for SVM. These differing numbers probably come from different experimental setups, datasets, or configurations rather than contradicting each other, since Random Forest leads in all of them.

Both models also showed similar behavior in one evaluation interval. In the range [70:100], both Random Forest and SVM showed variation and stability but no significant further improvement in performance.</data>
  <data key="d9">accuracy,compares_with,learning curve plateau,outperforms,performance</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f0352d149ce07cb8b4fdf8db0076c7d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-467b87e0a1eaa0377cb70477245debc3-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d11">978-3-031-75329-9_31.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;25293-55764-1-PB.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;document.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791425146</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
