<edge source="Injection Molding" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Injection Molding and This Paper is defined by the paper's focus on injection molding as its central manufacturing process and subject of study. The paper names injection molding as the manufacturing process it uses, and its scope explicitly covers that process. Its first part describes how injection molding works and explains how the multi-criteria decision-making methods AHP (Analytic Hierarchy Process) and TOPSIS (Technique for Order of Preference by Similarity to Ideal Solution) are applied in molding.

The paper also connects injection molding with Digital Twin technology. Its related works section reviews existing Digital Twin applications in injection molding, and the paper itself targets implementing a Digital Twin for this process.

Quality is a further central concern. The paper studies defects in injection-molded plastic parts and aims to detect and mitigate quality defects in the process.

Because these descriptions combine Digital Twin implementation, AHP/TOPSIS-based decision-making, and defect analysis, they may come from more than one work referred to as "This Paper." Across all of them, however, injection molding is the core manufacturing domain under investigation.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses,manufacturing,manufacturing process,quality defects</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;IJE_Volume38_Issue2_Pages488-502_Versionfinale.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
