<edge source="F. Tayalati" target="Hybrid Approach Integrating Deep Learning-Autoencoder With SPC Chart">
  <data key="d7">14.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between F. Tayalati and "Hybrid Approach Integrating Deep Learning-Autoencoder With SPC Chart" is one of authorship. F. Tayalati is the first and lead author of this scholarly paper, which presents a hybrid approach combining a deep learning autoencoder with Statistical Process Control (SPC) charts.

The work is a collaborative effort, credited as "F. Tayalati et al.," indicating that F. Tayalati led a team of co-authors. This attribution also appears in the article's running page header, where the work is cited as "F. Tayalati et al.," confirming F. Tayalati's position as the principal author.</data>
  <data key="d9">authored_by</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-016</data>
