<edge source="TOPSIS" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">13.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between TOPSIS and This Paper centers on the paper's use of the Technique for Order of Preference by Similarity to Ideal Solution (TOPSIS) as a core decision-making method. The paper both reviews and describes the TOPSIS approach and then applies it in practice. TOPSIS is combined with the Analytic Hierarchy Process (AHP) in the proposed methodology. AHP supplies the criteria weights, and TOPSIS uses them as inputs to produce the final ranking of alternatives.

In its main application, the paper uses TOPSIS in a case study to evaluate and rank machine alternatives, specifically three injection molding machines, and to identify the best or optimal machine. The method ranks the alternatives by their distance from the ideal solution, comparing each machine against both the ideal and anti-ideal solutions. To do this, the paper computes the separation measures S+ and S- and the relative closeness coefficient Si, which together determine the final rank of the machine choices.

One description presents a different application. In it, TOPSIS evaluates and ranks four suppliers in the fourth phase of a methodology. This may reflect a distinct study or a separate phase of a broader framework that also refers to itself as "This Paper," since it differs from the machine-selection case study involving three injection molding machines. In both contexts, TOPSIS serves as the final ranking stage that identifies the most suitable alternative.</data>
  <data key="d9">decision making,machine ranking,ranking,ranking alternatives,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d11">A_Comprehensive_Framework_for_Supplier_Selection_Using_Subjective_Objective_and_Hybrid_Multi-Criteria_Decision-Making_Techniques_With_Sensitivity_Analysis_F (1).pdf&lt;SEP&gt;IJE_Volume38_Issue2_Pages488-502_Versionfinale.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791426485</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
