<edge source="TOPSIS" target="Analytic Hierarchy Process">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The AHP results serve as inputs to the TOPSIS analysis, which improves the precision of the decision-making process.&lt;SEP&gt;AHP and TOPSIS were combined in the machine selection process: AHP structured the criteria and TOPSIS produced the rankings.&lt;SEP&gt;The two techniques are combined: AHP provides criteria weights used by TOPSIS for ranking.</data>
  <data key="d9">combined MCDM,hybrid approach,input to,related_to</data>
