<edge source="Accuracy" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Accuracy and This Paper describes how accuracy is used as a central metric for evaluating and comparing classification models. In this context, "This Paper" appears to refer to several distinct studies, each using accuracy in its own experimental setting. Across all of them, accuracy is a key performance metric. It is computed to assess model performance, used in performance comparisons, and applied to compare proposed models against baselines. In one instance, the paper formally defines accuracy through Eq. 1 as a measure of classification performance.

In one study, accuracy was used to evaluate seven models. In another, focused on churn prediction, the paper reports accuracy for five classical machine learning algorithms: Decision Tree (DT), Logistic Regression (LR), K-Nearest Neighbors (K-NN), Support Vector Machine (SVM), and Naive Bayes (NB).

In an image classification context, the paper uses image-level accuracy to evaluate the VGG16 and VGG19 deep learning models. In a further reported experiment, adding a Canny filter (an edge-detection preprocessing step) raised accuracy from 95.31% without the filter to 99.57% with it.</data>
  <data key="d9">evaluation,evaluation metric,metric,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">25293-55764-1-PB.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;CIST_174.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791467166</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
