<edge source="Precision" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Precision and This Paper centers on the paper's use of precision as a key metric for evaluating classification performance. Precision is listed among the paper's classification evaluation metrics and is formally defined through Eq. 2. It is computed for each model and used throughout the performance comparison, making it one of the main criteria by which the models are assessed.

In the customer churn prediction context, the paper reports precision per class for each model. It specifically measures how precisely the models identify churn and non-churn customers, which allows a class-level view of each model's ability to avoid misclassification.

In the image-processing context, the paper shows that precision improved significantly when the Canny edge-detection filter was applied. Precision rose from 94.24% to 99.44%, which indicates a substantial reduction in false positives.

Because these contexts differ, the descriptions may refer to more than one paper sharing the generic label "This Paper." In every case, precision serves as a central performance metric for comparing models and validating methodological improvements.</data>
  <data key="d9">evaluation,evaluation metric,metric,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-006</data>
