<edge source="Recall" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Recall and This Paper describes how recall serves as a central performance metric in the paper's evaluation framework. Recall, also called sensitivity, is formally defined in the paper through Eq. 3 and is listed among its classification evaluation metrics. The paper treats recall as a key metric: it is computed for each model, used to evaluate the models, and used in the comparative analysis of their performance.

The descriptions suggest that "This Paper" may refer to more than one study, since recall appears in two distinct application contexts. In a customer churn prediction context, recall was reported per class for each model. This allowed the paper to assess how well the models identified both churn and non-churn customers, giving a detailed view of class-specific detection performance.

In a separate context involving image pre-processing, recall was evaluated to determine whether Canny edge-detection pre-processing affected detection performance. The paper reports that recall was not compromised by the Canny pre-processing and remained at 100% for both configurations tested. This indicates that the pre-processing step preserved the model's ability to identify all positive instances.

Across these contexts, recall consistently functions as a primary measure of a model's ability to correctly detect relevant instances. It plays a central role in the paper's validation and comparison of model performance.</data>
  <data key="d9">evaluation,evaluation metric,metric,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b6de35b4fc6654223999680ef1082ec-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed5a32c2476eb625d3377722542a5d95-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-006</data>
