<edge source="National Center for Scientific and Technical Research" target="Smart DLSP Project">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between the National Center for Scientific and Technical Research (CNRST) of Morocco and the Smart DLSP Project is one of institutional support. CNRST is identified as one of the supporters of the Smart DLSP Project, and it backs the research carried out within the project's framework.

The support is provided through the Smart DLSP Project, which falls under the AL KHAWARIZMI IA-PROGRAM, a Moroccan initiative focused on artificial intelligence. Through this channel, CNRST funds and enables research activities linked to the project. This makes CNRST a key institutional backer of the scientific work produced under the Smart DLSP initiative.</data>
  <data key="d9">funding,funding program,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c6cf0e7751b1667f02411ba9fa2e2995-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d11">4597JPB.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;7561-ArticleText-31951-37131-10-20251228.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;acs_AIapplicationinmarketanalysis.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;GANsinsyntheticfinancialdata_donalsonwilson_versionpublie.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;IJE_Volume38_Issue2_Pages488-502_Versionfinale.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Paper_101-Enhancing_Predictive_Analysis_of_Vehicle_Accident_Risk.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791501626</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
