  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="National Center for Scientific and Technical Research" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">12.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between the National Center for Scientific and Technical Research (CNRST) of Morocco and This Paper is one of research funding and institutional support. CNRST, Morocco's national body for scientific and technical research, is identified as the supporting organization behind the research presented in the paper, and its backing is repeatedly acknowledged across the descriptions of the work.

CNRST's support was channeled through specific funding initiatives. The research was funded under the PASS program, and it was also supported through the Smart DLSP Project, which falls under the AL KHAWARIZMI Program, also referred to as the AL KHAWARIZMI IA-PROGRAM, an initiative focused on artificial intelligence. These programs together form the framework through which CNRST provided financial and institutional assistance to the project underlying This Paper.&lt;SEP&gt;Research supported by CNRST via Smart DLSP Project.</data>
