<edge source="A. Azmani" target="Burnout: A Pervasive Challenge Threatening Workplace Well-Being and Organizational Success">
  <data key="d7">15.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between A. Azmani and "Burnout: A Pervasive Challenge Threatening Workplace Well-Being and Organizational Success" is one of authorship. A. Azmani, also referred to simply as Azmani, is a co-author of this scholarly work, which is described variously as a paper and an article published in 2024.

Within the authorship structure of the publication, Azmani is identified as the second author, contributing alongside the other researchers to the study. The work focuses on burnout and examines it as a widespread phenomenon that threatens employee well-being in the workplace and poses risks to organizational success. For this reason, it is commonly referred to as the 2024 burnout paper or article.&lt;SEP&gt;A. Azmani is a co-author.&lt;SEP&gt;Azmani A is a co-author.</data>
