<edge source="A. Azmani" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between A. Azmani and This Paper is one of authorship. A. Azmani is a co-author of This Paper, which is described as a review, more specifically a systematic review. Some descriptions refer to A. Azmani simply as an author of the review, while most identify A. Azmani as a co-author. These are consistent, since A. Azmani shares authorship with at least one other contributor.

A. Azmani's authorship is also shown in the document's formatting. A. Azmani is named in the running page header of This Paper, which reads "D. Wilson and A. Azmani / IJE TRANSACTIONS B: Applications." This header identifies D. Wilson as a fellow author. It also indicates that This Paper appeared in the International Journal of Engineering (IJE), Transactions B: Applications.</data>
  <data key="d9">authored_by</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-014</data>
