<edge source="I. Boukrouh" target="Comprehensive Framework for Supplier Selection">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between the Comprehensive Framework for Supplier Selection and I. Boukrouh is one of authorship. I. Boukrouh is the first and lead author of the paper (also called the article) that presents the Comprehensive Framework for Supplier Selection. The work was written with co-authors and is cited as "I. Boukrouh et al."

I. Boukrouh's first-author position is also shown in the paper's running header, where I. Boukrouh appears as the first listed author. Every source agrees that I. Boukrouh led the authorship of this framework for supplier selection.</data>
  <data key="d9">authored_by</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-012</data>
