<edge source="L. Bouhsaien" target="Burnout: A Pervasive Challenge Threatening Workplace Well-Being and Organizational Success">
  <data key="d7">15.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between "Burnout: A Pervasive Challenge Threatening Workplace Well-Being and Organizational Success" and L. Bouhsaien is one of authorship. L. Bouhsaien is the first author of this 2024 article, which addresses burnout as a widespread challenge affecting both employee well-being and organizational performance.

Some descriptions call Bouhsaien a co-author or simply an author of the paper. These are consistent with the first-author role: the work had multiple contributors, and Bouhsaien is listed first among them. The descriptions consistently identify Bouhsaien as the lead author of this 2024 paper on burnout.&lt;SEP&gt;L. Bouhsaien is the first author.&lt;SEP&gt;Bouhsaien L is the first author.</data>
  <data key="d9">authored_by</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-020</data>
