<edge source="AHP" target="FAHP">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">FAHP is the fuzzy extension of AHP addressing uncertainty.&lt;SEP&gt;FAHP is the fuzzy extension of AHP.&lt;SEP&gt;FAHP integrates fuzzy sets with traditional AHP.&lt;SEP&gt;Fuzzy pairwise comparison matrices were developed using the AHP method with TFNs.&lt;SEP&gt;AHP and FAHP produced the same ranking as the most probable ranking only for A1.&lt;SEP&gt;FAHP enhances AHP by incorporating fuzzy set theory.&lt;SEP&gt;FAHP is the fuzzy extension of the Analytic Hierarchy Process.</data>
  <data key="d9">compares_with,extends,fuzzy enhancement,fuzzy extension,fuzzy integration,fuzzy variant</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-012</data>
