  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">AHP-Entropy combines AHP with Entropy.&lt;SEP&gt;AHP-Entropy merges subjective AHP weights with objective Entropy weights.&lt;SEP&gt;AHP-Entropy combines AHP subjective weights with entropy objective weights.&lt;SEP&gt;AHP-Entropy integrates the subjective AHP weights.&lt;SEP&gt;AHP-Entropy combines AHP subjective weights with Entropy.</data>
