  <data key="d8">Uses AHP to calculate criteria and sub-criteria weights.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper uses AHP to calculate criterion and sub-criterion weights.&lt;SEP&gt;AHP is used as a subjective method to calculate criteria and sub-criteria weights.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper derives subjective weights using AHP.&lt;SEP&gt;AHP is one of the compared weighting methods.&lt;SEP&gt;AHP is used as the subjective method to determine criteria weights.&lt;SEP&gt;AHP is used to capture subjective preferences.</data>
