<edge source="Autoencoder" target="Hybrid Approach Integrating Deep Learning-Autoencoder With SPC Chart">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between the Autoencoder and the Hybrid Approach Integrating Deep Learning-Autoencoder With SPC Chart is central to the methodology of the paper. The Autoencoder is the core deep learning component of the hybrid approach, which integrates deep learning autoencoders with Statistical Process Control (SPC) charts. The paper uses Autoencoders as its unsupervised learning technique, while noting the limitations of conventional autoencoders that its hybrid design seeks to address.

Within the approach's workflow, the prepared data sequences are fed into the Autoencoder, which then calculates reconstruction errors as part of the triple approach. These reconstruction errors link the Autoencoder to the SPC charts, so that statistical monitoring can be applied to the deep learning model's outputs. This integration is the defining feature of the hybrid framework.

To support the approach's validity, the authors include Table 7, which compares the performance of Autoencoder applications across various contexts. According to the authors, this comparison confirms the effectiveness of the proposed model.</data>
  <data key="d9">compares_with,deep learning,hybrid approach,performance comparison,unsupervised learning,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d11">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791426408</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
