<edge source="Anomaly Detection" target="Statistical Process Control">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">SPC detects predefined patterns but is limited in identifying anomalies beyond common patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;SPC methods may have limitations in detecting sporadic or systematic shifts, leading to delayed responses.&lt;SEP&gt;SPC remains one of the most widely used methods for anomaly detection.</data>
