<edge source="Anomaly Detection" target="Hybrid Approach Integrating Deep Learning-Autoencoder With SPC Chart">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between Anomaly Detection and the Hybrid Approach Integrating Deep Learning-Autoencoder With SPC Chart centers on the paper's main goal: to address, improve, and enhance anomaly detection in industrial processes. The work focuses specifically on the injection molding process. It details a methodology for detecting anomalies on an injection molding machine, applied to process time series data generated during manufacturing.

The hybrid approach tackles the anomaly detection challenge by modeling normal sequences. A deep learning autoencoder learns the patterns of normal process behavior, and Statistical Process Control (SPC) charts are combined with it, so deviations from the learned normal sequences can be identified as anomalies. The paper also places its contribution within the broader field by reviewing existing anomaly detection research in three main areas.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d11">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791426396</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
