<edge source="Fuzzy-Bayesian Approach" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The article models the risk of QoS in VANET using a Fuzzy-Bayesian approach.&lt;SEP&gt;This Paper models the risk of accident using a Fuzzy-Bayesian approach.&lt;SEP&gt;This Paper implements a five-stage fuzzy-Bayesian approach to create conditional probability tables.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper proposes the FB approach that implements a QoS model.</data>
