<edge source="Bayesian Network" target="Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between the Bayesian Network and the paper "Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components" is central to the paper's methodology. The paper uses Bayesian networks as its main framework for causal modeling and inference. It builds a Bayesian network model of IT system reliability to support predictive maintenance of critical IT components.

To construct the Bayesian Network, the paper identifies the relevant variables and the causal dependencies among them in IT systems, which together form a causal graph. Nodes in the network represent the states of IT components and take linguistic values rather than purely numerical ones, which reflects the fuzzy logic part of the approach. The paper defines component-level subnetworks and then combines them into a single Bayesian network centered on a System_State node, which captures the overall condition of the IT system.

The paper parameterizes the Bayesian Network for predictive maintenance by deriving its conditional probabilities through fuzzy inference over the causal graph. It also specifies Gaussian membership function parameters for all Bayesian Network nodes, which allows the linguistic node states to be linked to quantitative measurements. Through this combination of fuzzy logic and Bayesian reasoning, the Bayesian Network serves as the probabilistic and causal backbone of the paper's intelligent predictive maintenance framework.</data>
  <data key="d9">fuzzy BN,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d11">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791425369</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
