<edge source="Reference [20]" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">With the recent emergence of new integrated architectures and access technologies, the computation burden of IA algorithms and big data can be alleviated by migrating complex computations to external cloud servers [20].&lt;SEP&gt;Early research primarily focused on the security and functionality of the platform, but recent work has increasingly addressed key performance metrics such as latency, throughput, and scalability, which are critical for large-scale enterprise use cases [20].&lt;SEP&gt;We have selected a specific set of works [1], [2], [6], [17]–[20] for a detailed analysis, as these sources are seminal in the development of code generation tools, covering a broad spectrum of methodologies and application areas.&lt;SEP&gt;UML is a widely adopted and well-known modeling language that ensures ease of learning and reduces design time [20], making it an ideal choice for user input.&lt;SEP&gt;UML is a widely adopted and well-known modeling language that ensures ease of learning and reduces design time [20],</data>
