<edge source="Artificial Intelligence" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Artificial Intelligence (AI) and "This Paper" describes how AI serves as the central subject or a key technological component of the research. The descriptions likely refer to several distinct papers that share the generic label "This Paper." Together they cover three areas: human resource management (HRM), vehicular ad hoc networks (VANETs), and market analysis.

In the HRM-focused work, the paper studies research at the intersection of human resources and AI. It maps the existing literature on AI applications in HRM and examines how AI technologies are integrated into HRM practices. It also analyzes research on AI's broader implications for both HRM and business. As part of its methodology, the study builds its corpus by gathering papers whose keywords relate to AI, which indicates a bibliometric or systematic literature review approach.

In the VANET context, the paper presents AI as a complementary technology for processing the data generated within vehicular ad hoc networks. Here AI functions as a tool that supports and enhances network data handling.

In the market analysis context, the paper explores how the application of AI to market analysis has evolved and what impact it has had. This places AI as a transformative force in analytical and business decision-making.

Across these contexts, AI is consistently the primary object of investigation or a key enabling technology within the paper's scope.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses,data processing</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e26e4b19a21a1bf5f3daec0bcb0830c-chunk-007</data>
