<edge source="Ref [28]" target="Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">This method enables the linguistic representation of variable states and the automatic generation of CPTs, thus reducing the dependence on repeated expert consultations while improving precision in modeling [28].&lt;SEP&gt;Event Tree Analysis (ETA) is a probabilistic technique that models the possible outcomes of a critical initiating event and the performance of subsequent mitigation measures through a tree-structured diagram [28].</data>
