<edge source="Conditional Probability Table" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">All CPs for QoS in VANET were computed and presented in Table VI.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper assigns conditional probability tables to BN nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper obtains the conditional probability table for the Drivers' Reaction-time node by normalizing aggregated state values.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper computes CP tables, e.g. for the variable congestion.</data>
