<edge source="Smart DLSP Project" target="This Paper">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between the Smart DLSP Project and This Paper is one of institutional support and affiliation. The research presented in This Paper was conducted, carried out, and supported under the Smart DLSP Project, and the work is described as forming part of that project.

The Smart DLSP Project belongs to the AL KHAWARIZMI IA-PROGRAM. Most descriptions use the abbreviation "IA-PROGRAM," likely the French-style abbreviation for "Intelligence Artificielle." One description gives it as "AI-PROGRAM," which appears to be the English equivalent of the same program rather than a separate initiative.

The Smart DLSP Project therefore provided the framework and support for the research in This Paper, linking the study to the wider AL KHAWARIZMI artificial intelligence program.&lt;SEP&gt;The research is supported under the Smart DLSP Project - AL KHAWARIZMI IA-PROGRAM.&lt;SEP&gt;The research is carried out within the Smart DLSP Project.&lt;SEP&gt;The case study presents an overview of the Smart DLSP project.</data>
