<edge source="This Paper" target="VANET">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between This Paper and VANET (Vehicular Ad Hoc Network) centers on the paper's study of Quality of Service (QoS) in vehicular networks. The paper examines the QoS of VANETs, focusing on the factors that influence it and the risks associated with maintaining it. It treats QoS risk as a central theme and analyzes the conditions under which service quality in VANET environments may be compromised.

Beyond QoS, the paper takes a broader view of the main challenges and risks facing VANETs. It discusses security problems, data processing problems, and QoS support. It also models security, routing, and data processing within VANET, offering a structured view of how these interrelated aspects shape the network's performance and reliability.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses,data processing,security,vehicular networks</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db5423cfc6b0239a805a929baa02d1e9-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d11">10.2478_acss-2022-0011.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791501602</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
