  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper defines fuzzy rules and identifies activated ones.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper applies if-then fuzzy rules as part of the fuzzy inference method.&lt;SEP&gt;This Paper articulates experts' evaluations as fuzzy IF-THEN rules.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper defines 27 fuzzy rules for the Driver Reaction-time node with its parent nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper defines 180 fuzzy rules based on the Bayesian network and information from previous research.</data>
