<edge source="This Paper" target="Data Augmentation">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">This Paper integrates a systematic data augmentation strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;Data augmentation is part of the structured road extraction process.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper applies horizontal and vertical flips, producing four images per original image.&lt;SEP&gt;Rotations, flips, scaling, and brightness and contrast adjustments are used to improve robustness.&lt;SEP&gt;Rotations, flips, zooms and brightness/contrast adjustments are applied in segmentation training.&lt;SEP&gt;Extensive data augmentation enhances robustness to viewpoint, illumination and occlusion variations.&lt;SEP&gt;Augmentation strategies improve robustness to occlusion, scale and illumination.</data>
