  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between the Ministry of Higher Education, Scientific Research, and Innovation and This Paper is one of institutional and financial support. The Ministry supported the research presented in This Paper, and the work is acknowledged as having been supported "in part" by the Ministry. This indicates that the Ministry was a significant contributor but may not have been the sole source of funding or assistance.

The Ministry's support was provided under the Smart DLSP Project, an initiative within the AL KHAWARIZMI AI-PROGRAM. This places the research within a broader national framework for promoting artificial intelligence research and innovation. The Ministry's contribution is also described as additional support for the project, which suggests it complemented other resources or partners involved in the work.&lt;SEP&gt;The work was supported in part by the Ministry.</data>
