<edge source="This Paper" target="Sales Forecasting">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between Sales Forecasting and This Paper is central, as sales forecasting is the primary subject and focus of the paper. This Paper addresses the forecasting of sales for retailers and tackles the complexities that businesses face in predicting future sales. Its overarching goal is to improve the accuracy of sales forecasting in real-world retail environments.

Specifically, This Paper focuses on forecasting daily sales, with the aim of predicting retail store sales for 'n' future days. To achieve this, the study evaluates various forecasting models on sales data, seeking to identify the most effective model for predicting daily retail store sales.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses,retail</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d11">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791423618</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
