<edge source="This Paper" target="Reference (1)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Accurate prediction of sales is an essential task for all industries as it directly impacts their ability to formulate effective plans (1), particularly in response to changing market trends, while also enabling them to optimize inventory management (2), and enhance customer satisfaction through timely product availability.</data>
  <data key="d9">cites</data>
