<edge source="This Paper" target="Ref. 24">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Box-Jenkins methodology for time series modeling progresses through four primary keys: model identification, parameter estimation, model validation, and forecasting (24).</data>
  <data key="d9">cites,methodology background</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-006</data>
