</edge>
<edge source="This Paper" target="Ref. 25">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Initially, the process begins with assessing the stationarity of the time series under study, either through visual inspection or by employing statistical tests like the Augmented Dickey-Fuller (ADF) or the Kwiatkowski-Phillips-Schmidt-Shin (KPSS) tests (25).</data>
  <data key="d9">cites,stationarity testing</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791423618</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="This Paper" target="Ref. 26">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The ADF test checks if the time series is non-stationary by identifying if any autoregressive polynomial roots are close to 1 (26).</data>
  <data key="d9">ADF test,cites</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791423618</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="This Paper" target="Ref. 27">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Conversely, the KPSS test evaluates if the residuals from ARMA modeling display white noise characteristics, indicating stationarity (27).</data>
  <data key="d9">KPSS test,cites</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791423618</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="This Paper" target="Ref. 28">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In cases of non-stationarity, techniques like differencing or logarithmic transformations are applied to achieve stationarity (28).</data>
  <data key="d9">cites,data transformation</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf</data>
