<edge source="This Paper" target="Reference (7)">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A comparison between the obtained results and those reported in the literature reveals that neural network models are generally superior to traditional time series models (7-9).&lt;SEP&gt;The main principle of the suggested approach is based on combination of two models, the Analytic Hierarchy Process (AHP) (7) and Technique for Order of Preference by Similarity to Ideal Solution (TOPSIS) (8, 9) methodologies to facilitate decision-making in injection molding machine selection.</data>
  <data key="d9">AHP method,cites,literature comparison</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-001</data>
