<edge source="This Paper" target="Hyperledger Fabric">
  <data key="d7">13.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between Hyperledger Fabric and This Paper is that of a subject under study and the empirical research examining it. This Paper deploys and benchmarks a Hyperledger Fabric network, specifically version 2.4, to evaluate its performance and scalability. The study reports an empirical evaluation of Hyperledger Fabric's behavior under practical configuration choices, assessing how the platform performs as its setup changes.

The evaluation is organized as multiple test campaigns that benchmark key Hyperledger Fabric parameters across multi-parameter configurations. A central focus is measuring latency and throughput across different peer configurations, which shows how the network scales as its structure and settings vary.

Through these experiments, This Paper provides a concrete empirical basis for tuning Hyperledger Fabric. Its systematic benchmarks of latency and throughput give practitioners evidence-based guidance on configuring Hyperledger Fabric 2.4 networks for better performance and scalability.&lt;SEP&gt;The project implements a secure blockchain network using Hyperledger Fabric for trusted vehicle data management.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper evaluates performance in the Fabric transaction pipeline.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper evaluates its PQC hybrid and ECDSA configurations on Fabric infrastructure components.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper evaluates its PQC layer on Hyperledger Fabric peers, orderers and chaincode.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper integrates hybrid post-quantum signatures into Hyperledger Fabric at the application layer.</data>
  <data key="d9">benchmarking,benchmarking platform,blockchain platform,network deployment,performance evaluation,platform,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26549e3ff493405b55b221c1d804516e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-038</data>
