<edge source="This Paper" target="D. Wilson">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between D. Wilson and This Paper is one of authorship. D. Wilson is a co-author of This Paper, which is described as a review and, more specifically, as a systematic review. D. Wilson contributed to the work alongside other authors and is credited as one of its authors.

D. Wilson's authorship is visible in the document itself. D. Wilson's name appears in the running header, also called the page header, of This Paper, which shows D. Wilson as one of the credited contributors throughout the publication.</data>
