<edge source="This Paper" target="IJE Transactions B: Applications">
  <data key="d7">22.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between IJE Transactions B: Applications and This Paper is one of publication: the paper appeared in the journal IJE Transactions B: Applications, part of the International Journal of Engineering (IJE) series. The source descriptions give two different sets of publication details. This most likely means the generic label "This Paper" refers to two distinct articles published in different years, not to a single article.

In the first instance, the paper was published in IJE Transactions B: Applications, Volume 39, Issue No. 02, in February 2026. It occupies pages 395–406 of that issue.

In the second instance, which is more frequently attested, the article was published in IJE Transactions B: Applications, Volume 38, Issue No. 02, in February 2025. It spans pages 488–502 of that issue.

Both records place the work in the February (No. 02) issue of the journal, one year apart. They differ in volume number (38 versus 39) and page range (488–502 versus 395–406), which supports treating them as separate publications rather than conflicting accounts of a single paper.</data>
  <data key="d9">published_in</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed200d7fb9035c5336533a6730c8671b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-690b1785f1cbb35b37a4dcdbae1984e4-chunk-017</data>
