<edge source="This Paper" target="Ref (24) TOPSIS MCDM Tool">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">TOPSIS, abbreviated for Technique for Order of Preference by Similarity to Ideal Solution, serves as multi-criteria decision-making (MCDM) tool aimed at selecting the most favorable alternative from a given set, taking into account multiple criteria (24).</data>
  <data key="d9">TOPSIS definition,cites</data>
