<edge source="This Paper" target="Hwang and Yoon 1981">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Originating from the work of Hwang and Yoon in 1981 (25), TOPSIS evaluates alternatives by assessing their proximity to the ideal solution and their deviation from the worst solution.</data>
