<edge source="This Paper" target="Ethereum">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">System architecture includes an Ethereum blockchain.&lt;SEP&gt;System architecture includes mobile nodes and Ethereum blockchain managed by smart contract rules.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper selects Ethereum as the blockchain platform based on popularity, smart contract support, ECC security, test networks and community adoption.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper selects Ethereum for its popularity, smart contract support, ECC-secured transactions, test networks and wide community adoption.&lt;SEP&gt;Each admin has an Ethereum address with asymmetric key pairs.&lt;SEP&gt;Each admin has an Ethereum address including asymmetric public key pairs.</data>
  <data key="d9">admin addresses,architecture,blockchain platform,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-018</data>
