<edge source="This Paper" target="Lee et al. (2021)">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">When considering the baseline from previous studies, Lee et al. (2021) [7] achieved an accuracy of 96.94% using a model combining Canny filters and CNN (ResNet101) with 10,000 trained images.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper compares its results against Lee et al. as a baseline, noting bias from different part types.</data>
