<edge source="This Paper" target="10.1109/access.2025.3589285">
  <data key="d7">21.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between 10.1109/access.2025.3589285 and This Paper establishes that 10.1109/ACCESS.2025.3589285 is the Digital Object Identifier (DOI) of This Paper. Multiple descriptions consistently state that this DOI appears in the paper's citation information, where it serves as the article's official identifier.

The DOI prefix 10.1109 corresponds to IEEE, and the "ACCESS" designation indicates publication in IEEE Access, with the year marker 2025 in the identifier. All of the provided descriptions agree, with no conflicting information. They reinforce that the DOI uniquely identifies the article and is recorded in its citation details for reference and retrieval.</data>
