<edge source="This Paper" target="Ražinskas and Čeponienė [19]">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In another similar approach, but specific to the Laravel framework, a widely used PHP framework for building web applications, Mantas Ražinskas and Lina Čeponienė [19] have proposed an MDA-based methodology for the automatic generation of Laravel code from UML diagrams.</data>
  <data key="d9">cites,literature review</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d11">Microservices-Driven_Automation_in_Full-Stack_Deve.pdf</data>
