</edge>
<edge source="This Paper" target="FSMicroGenerator">
  <data key="d7">18.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between FSMicroGenerator and This Paper is that the paper (also called the article) both presents and evaluates FSMicroGenerator. The paper introduces FSMicroGenerator as a tool for automating the generation of multilingual full-stack microservices solutions, positioning it as a means of optimizing software development in microservices architectures. It describes the tool's own architecture, the architecture of the solutions it generates, and its package lifecycle and generation process. The paper explains that FSMicroGenerator automatically generates CRUD operations, entity relationships, filtering capabilities, and non-functional concerns.

Beyond presenting the tool, the paper evaluates FSMicroGenerator both quantitatively and qualitatively. The central evaluation is a controlled experiment comparing an FSMicroGenerator-based implementation, carried out by a team of two junior developers, against manual development. The comparison covers development effort, codebase size, performance, and resource usage.

The evaluation also uses a checklist of features and a table of non-functional requirements (NFRs). According to the paper, FSMicroGenerator automatically generates many of the checklist features. It also generates the features listed in the NFR table, achieving full non-functional coverage.</data>
  <data key="d9">code generation,code generation tool,code generator,evaluation,proposes,tool,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-025</data>
