<edge source="This Paper" target="Tesoriero et al. [20] MDA Full-Stack Web Application Development">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The majority of previous work focuses on specific application layers, while Tesoriero et al. [20] offer a comprehensive solution for full-stack development of multi-layered web applications based on MDA.</data>
