<edge source="This Paper" target="Legal Assistance Chatbot">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper proposes an innovative chatbot that gives basic legal advice to everyone.</data>
  <data key="d9">legal assistance,proposes</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791500982</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="This Paper" target="Retrieval-Augmented Generation">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper implements a technical architecture based on RAG.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper describes RAG's principle and components.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper builds its contract-law AI assistance model on retrieval-augmented generation.&lt;SEP&gt;The system is built on a RAG architecture combining search and generation.&lt;SEP&gt;The assistance system relies on a RAG process for answer generation in the legal domain.&lt;SEP&gt;The developed chatbot combines legal vector databases with large language models via Retrieval-Augmented Generation.</data>
  <data key="d9">RAG overview,addresses,architecture,legal AI assistant,legal chatbot,system architecture,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d11">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791500982</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="This Paper" target="Contract Law">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper uses contract law as its case study and aims to help citizens understand it.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper introduces an AI assistance model tailored for contract law.&lt;SEP&gt;The assistance system is designed for the legal domain, specifically contract law.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses,case study,legal domain</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d11">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791500982</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="This Paper" target="Ref [16]">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Despite their impressive fluency and conversational capabilities, this suggests that LLMs can still produce inaccurate or misleading information [16].&lt;SEP&gt;By integrating the robustness of a generative model with the relevance and timeliness of the retrieved data, RAG produces responses that are not only natural and human-like but also contextually appropriate and highly reliable [16], [29].&lt;SEP&gt;The study assumed that improving the network connectivity could allow a VANET's performance to be tweaked, and it stated that a better QoS could be reached under certain conditions (having less than 250 m in the transmission range) [16].</data>
  <data key="d9">LLM limitations,RAG,cites,fuzzy logic</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d11">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791501581</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="This Paper" target="Ref [17]">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">These systems enhance LLMs by integrating them with vector databases containing relevant information [17].&lt;SEP&gt;Retrieval-augmented generation has demonstrated notable success in several natural language processing tasks requiring deep knowledge, such as answering general knowledge questions accurately, fact-checking with high precision, and answering questions within specific domains [17], [29].&lt;SEP&gt;A Bayesian network (BN) is a probabilistic graphical model developed by Pearl to aid in reasoning under uncertainty [17].</data>
  <data key="d9">Bayesian network background,RAG background,cites,knowledge-intensive tasks</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d11">Paper_113-Accurate_AI_Assistance_in_Contract_Law1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Symbiotic_Combination_of_a_Bayesian_Network_and_Fu.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791501581</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="This Paper" target="Ref [18]">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">This augmentation strategy has proven highly effective [18], as it addresses the shortcomings of LLMs in processing legal data.&lt;SEP&gt;A BN is defined by a pair (G, O), where G = V, A is a directed acyclic graph that encodes a joint probability distribution over a finite set of categorical variables V, and the arcs A represent direct relationships between them [18].</data>
  <data key="d9">Bayesian network definition,RAG effectiveness,cites</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-caa1a23d50101616a42f59c788898ea5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7716e61d153c4d281900275dc536a626-chunk-002</data>
