<edge source="This Paper" target="Hosni, 2025">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Privacy-enhancing techniques such as homomorphic encryption, differential privacy, and secure multi-party computation (SMPC) have been integrated to further protect model updates from inference attacks (Hosni, 2025).</data>
  <data key="d9">cites,federated learning</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-001</data>
