<edge source="This Paper" target="ML-DSA-65">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper uses ML-DSA-65 in an external signing microservice.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper uses ML-DSA-65 as the post-quantum signature scheme in its hybrid PQC configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;ML-DSA-65 is the primary scheme evaluated in the six-scenario benchmark suite and in concurrent signing-service instances.</data>
