  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Burnout is characterized as a condition of physical, emotional, and mental fatigue, frequently triggered by prolonged and intense stress, especially within the professional environment. (Gaur &amp; Jindal, 2023).&lt;SEP&gt;Burnout is a state of pervasive exhaustion stemming from prolonged and excessive stress, frequently encountered in demanding work environments (Gaur &amp; Jindal, 2023).</data>
