<edge source="Workplace Well-Being" target="Burnout: A Pervasive Challenge Threatening Workplace Well-Being and Organizational Success">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper frames burnout as a threat to workplace well-being and organizational success.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper frames burnout as a threat to workplace well-being.&lt;SEP&gt;The article stresses that individuals and organizations should acknowledge the significance of well-being and foster environments that support a balanced, sustainable approach to work.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses,organizational success,sustainable work</data>
