</edge>
<edge source="Workplace Well-Being" target="Burnout">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Burnout harms individuals' physical, psychological and social well-being, and it reduces organizational productivity and reputation.&lt;SEP&gt;Burnout threatens workplace well-being.&lt;SEP&gt;Burnout threatens workplace well-being, and addressing its factors holistically nurtures overall well-being.&lt;SEP&gt;Burnout is described as a pervasive challenge that threatens workplace well-being.</data>
  <data key="d9">related_to,threat</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-011</data>
