  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">As an example, in order to understand how occupational stress and burnout impact the neurophysiological, a model was developed using a computational model based on Artificial Intelligence (AI). This model has two types of factors: exogenous and endogenous. The exogenous ones are related to work and the endogenous are the personal ones (Mikołajewski et al., 2023).</data>
