<edge source="Fuzzy Bayesian Network" target="Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between the Fuzzy Bayesian Network (FBN) and the paper "Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components" is one of central methodology. The FBN is the core analytical framework the paper relies on for the intelligent predictive maintenance of critical IT components, including in industrial IT settings. The approach combines fuzzy logic with Bayesian inference: it integrates the causal structure of a Bayesian Network (BN) with fuzzy-derived probabilities to estimate the risk of IT failures.

Within the paper, the FBN is used to derive the probability that IT components will enter critical states. The paper develops and validates a BN-based model to anticipate these states, which supports proactive maintenance decisions for IT systems.

The descriptions disagree on the paper's exact contribution. Most state that the paper "proposes" an FBN framework or a fuzzy-Bayesian predictive maintenance approach. One record explicitly corrects this, noting that the text does not state that the paper introduces the method, and that "uses" or "applies" is the more accurate characterization. The paper therefore clearly develops, applies and validates an FBN-based model for this domain. However, it is uncertain whether the Fuzzy Bayesian Network methodology itself is a novel contribution of the paper or an existing technique applied to the predictive maintenance of critical IT components.</data>
  <data key="d9">PdM model,core approach,failure prediction model,framework,hybrid model,predictive maintenance,predictive maintenance model,proposes,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d11">From_Uncertainty_to_Decision_An_Intelligent_Predic.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791425328</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fuzzy Bayesian Network" target="Predictive Maintenance">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Applying FBNs to PdM in IT systems is presented as a novel direction.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fuzzy Bayesian Network is applied to predictive maintenance of critical IT components.&lt;SEP&gt;The BN model provides a robust framework for anticipating risks and supporting predictive maintenance strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;The fuzzy BN supports maintenance planning, incident triage and risk-based prioritization.</data>
