<edge source="Burnout: A Pervasive Challenge Threatening Workplace Well-Being and Organizational Success" target="International Journal of Professional Business Review">
  <data key="d7">15.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper "Burnout: A Pervasive Challenge Threatening Workplace Well-Being and Organizational Success" was published in the International Journal of Professional Business Review in 2024. It appeared in Volume 9, Issue 4 of the journal as article number e04597.

All available records agree on these publication details, so there is no conflicting information about where or when the paper appeared. The relationship shows that the International Journal of Professional Business Review is the publishing venue. The journal served as the academic outlet that brought this research on burnout, its effects on workplace well-being, and its threat to organizational success to the scholarly community.&lt;SEP&gt;Published in 2024, 9(4), e04597.</data>
  <data key="d9">published_in</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f659f89172b81a0adff01963801bdcb-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d11">4597JPB.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;ACS_10_THEPOTENTIALOFARTIFICIALINTELLIGENCEINHUMANRESOURCEMANAGEMENT.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791422775</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Burnout: A Pervasive Challenge Threatening Workplace Well-Being and Organizational Success" target="Burnout">
  <data key="d7">14.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Burnout and the 2024 article "Burnout: A Pervasive Challenge Threatening Workplace Well-Being and Organizational Success" is that burnout is the central subject of the work. The article frames burnout as a pervasive and critical workplace issue, one that threatens both employee well-being and organizational success. It also responds to the growing prevalence of employee burnout and argues for a healthier approach to work.

The paper studies the factors behind workplace burnout and treats it as a multifactorial phenomenon with complex relationships among its contributing variables. Beyond identifying these causes, it considers how organizations can prevent burnout.

Methodologically, the paper models and quantifies the variables that affect employee burnout. Its burnout model produces values of Low 0.001, Medium 0.135 and High 0.607, which points to a substantial likelihood of high burnout under the conditions modeled.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper discusses burnout as a threat to workplace well-being and organizational success.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses,employee burnout,employee well-being,workplace well-being</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bed29169806bd2571a0eff67abe0e549-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a503621d914a716d7d3a5232c23b6bc6-chunk-020</data>
