<edge source="Long Short-Term Memory" target="Recurrent Neural Network">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">LSTM is a type of recurrent neural network. Both are listed together in the paper's keywords.&lt;SEP&gt;LSTM enhances the short-term memory capacity of RNNs by adding long-term cell states.&lt;SEP&gt;LSTM enhances RNN short-term memory by adding long-term cell states.&lt;SEP&gt;LSTM is a recurrent neural network architecture.</data>
