<edge source="2252-8938" target="Int J Artif Intell">
  <data key="d7">19.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between 2252-8938 and Int J Artif Intell (International Journal of Artificial Intelligence) is one of identification: 2252-8938 is the International Standard Serial Number (ISSN) assigned to the journal Int J Artif Intell. It serves as the unique standardized identifier for this serial publication.

The ISSN 2252-8938 identifies the journal as a whole rather than any individual article or paper published in it. Several descriptions emphasize this distinction and explicitly correct an earlier attribution that had wrongly linked the identifier to a specific article. The ISSN therefore applies to the publication venue, Int J Artif Intell, and not to the individual research papers within it.</data>
  <data key="d9">ISSN,issn,journal ISSN,related_to</data>
