<edge source="Predictive Maintenance" target="Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components">
  <data key="d7">15.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between the paper "Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components" and Predictive Maintenance (PdM) is that predictive maintenance is the paper's central subject. Across all descriptions, the paper, also called the article, is consistently characterized as addressing, targeting, and being concerned with the predictive maintenance of critical IT components.

The paper goes beyond discussing the topic. It proposes a dedicated PdM model for critical IT components and builds a predictive maintenance pipeline for these components. Several descriptions frame the work as intelligent predictive maintenance, reflecting its use of Fuzzy Bayesian Networks to anticipate failures in critical IT infrastructure. Predictive maintenance is therefore both the problem domain the paper investigates and the application area its proposed model and pipeline are designed to serve.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-017</data>
