<edge source="Supplier Selection" target="Comprehensive Framework for Supplier Selection">
  <data key="d7">12.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between the Comprehensive Framework for Supplier Selection and Supplier Selection is central and direct. The framework was presented in a paper by I. Boukrouh et al., and it was designed specifically for supplier selection. The paper treats supplier selection as a decision-making problem and builds a full methodology to address it, with the overall goal of evaluating and ranking suppliers.

To analyze supplier selection, the study uses Multi-Criteria Decision-Making (MCDM) methods and approaches. A key part of the work is a comparison of different weighting approaches for supplier selection, which shows how alternative ways of assigning importance to criteria can affect the evaluation of suppliers.

The paper also applies its proposed methodology to a supplier selection problem to show how it works in practice. This illustrates how the Comprehensive Framework for Supplier Selection can be used to assess, compare and rank suppliers in real decision-making settings.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54e26c32a6c6377d00b93d14e0ea3092-chunk-015</data>
