  <data key="d8">Uses FAHP for weight calculation.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper uses FAHP for weight calculation to address uncertainty.&lt;SEP&gt;FAHP is used as a subjective method to calculate fuzzy weights of criteria and sub-criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper derives weights using FAHP.&lt;SEP&gt;FAHP weights computed via fuzzy pairwise comparison.&lt;SEP&gt;FAHP is used as a subjective method incorporating fuzzy set theory.&lt;SEP&gt;FAHP is used to capture subjective preferences with fuzzy logic.</data>
