<edge source="DeepLabV3+" target="Semantic Segmentation">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">DeepLabV3+ is used for semantic segmentation tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;DeepLabV3+ performs the semantic segmentation stage of the pipeline.&lt;SEP&gt;DeepLabV3+ is designed for pixel-wise semantic segmentation.&lt;SEP&gt;DeepLabV3+ produces predicted road segmentation masks.&lt;SEP&gt;DeepLabV3+ is the model used for semantic segmentation of road pixels.&lt;SEP&gt;DeepLabV3+ performs semantic segmentation of roads.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d11">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791422786</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="DeepLabV3+" target="Dice Loss">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">DeepLabV3+ attains low Dice Loss and a Dice score of about 97.9% on road-positive subsets.&lt;SEP&gt;DeepLabV3+ is trained with Dice Loss as the primary loss function.&lt;SEP&gt;DeepLabV3+ is trained with Dice loss as the main objective, using batch size 4. It is trained for 3 epochs in the early-epoch analysis and up to 50 epochs for final evaluation.&lt;SEP&gt;DeepLabV3+ is trained with Dice loss combined with BCE and assessed using Dice loss.</data>
  <data key="d9">evaluation metric,related_to,training loss,training objective</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a32e5ba6e7447add4fce7dbb90abe96-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d11">A_Deep_Learning_Pipeline_for_Accurate_Road_Detecti.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791422786</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
