<edge source="Hybrid Forecasting Model" target="SARIMA">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The hybrid model integrates SARIMA.&lt;SEP&gt;SARIMA is applied directly to the time series to establish a baseline for comparison with the hybrid model. SARIMA also serves inside the hybrid model to model the residual errors of the LSTM predictions.</data>
