<edge source="Forget Gate" target="Cell State">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The forget gate filters the previous cell state to decide how much past information is kept.&lt;SEP&gt;The forget gate decides whether to retain or discard the prior cell state information c(t-1).</data>
  <data key="d9">filtering,memory control,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-002</data>
