</edge>
<edge source="Input Gate" target="LSTM">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The input gate is one of the three gates of the LSTM cell, determining whether the input should modify the cell content.&lt;SEP&gt;The LSTM incorporates new information via the input gate.&lt;SEP&gt;The input gate is a component of the LSTM cell.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791423777</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Input Gate" target="Tanh Activation Function">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The input gate generates the candidate memory state via the tanh activation function.&lt;SEP&gt;The candidate memory state g_t is generated with the tanh activation function.</data>
  <data key="d9">activation,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d11">CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791426408</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Input Gate" target="Candidate Memory State">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The input gate initiates generation of the candidate memory state g_t and determines which portions of it are retained via i_t.</data>
  <data key="d9">generation,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791423777</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Input Gate" target="Sigmoid Function">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The input state is computed as i_t = σ(W_ix x_t + W_ih h_{t-1} + b_i), which uses the sigmoid function.</data>
  <data key="d9">activation,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791423777</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Output Gate" target="LSTM">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The output gate is one of the three gates of the LSTM cell and is used in computing the final LSTM output.&lt;SEP&gt;The LSTM output is computed using the output gate activation.&lt;SEP&gt;The output gate is a component of the LSTM cell that generates the updated hidden state.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-285b07b80137f799fd1205a24fb418c4-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">AHybridApproachforSalesForecastingCombiningDeepLearningandTimeSeries.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791423777</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Output Gate" target="Sigmoid Function">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The output state is computed as o_t = σ(W_ox x_t + W_oh h_{t-1} + b_o), which uses the sigmoid function.</data>
  <data key="d9">activation,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791423777</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Output Gate" target="Tanh Activation Function">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The hidden state is computed as h_t = tanh(c_t) o_t, which applies tanh to the memory cell state.</data>
  <data key="d9">activation,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791423777</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Output Gate" target="Hidden State">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The output gate generates the updated hidden state from the memory cell state and the output state.</data>
  <data key="d9">generation,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b861a9335e2f8bb52dad6132b0acac1d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">CIST_171Edited_FV.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791423777</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Output Gate" target="Sigmoid Activation Function">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The output state o_t is computed using a sigmoid.</data>
  <data key="d9">activation,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d11">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
