<edge source="Mean Absolute Error" target="LSTM-Autoencoder">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The LSTM-AE learns from training data by minimizing reconstruction loss, defined as MAE between input x_t and output y_t.</data>
