<edge source="Mean Absolute Error" target="LSTM-AE">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The LSTM-AE is trained by minimizing the residual error between the input data and the reconstructed output, with MAE used as the reconstruction loss (equation 18).&lt;SEP&gt;The LSTM-AE aims for a low MAE and flags anomalies when the MAE exceeds the threshold of 0.04.</data>
  <data key="d9">error metric,reconstruction loss,related_to,uses_method</data>
