<edge source="Hyperledger Fabric" target="Endorsement Policy">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fabric validates transactions according to endorsement policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Fabric transactions are validated according to endorsement policies.&lt;SEP&gt;The endorsement policy is a configurable component of Hyperledger Fabric.&lt;SEP&gt;The channel's endorsement policy determines which endorsing peers receive transaction proposals.&lt;SEP&gt;During validation, peers verify endorsement signatures against the endorsement policy.&lt;SEP&gt;Fabric peers execute authorization and key-registry checks during endorsement.</data>
  <data key="d9">endorsing peers,related_to,transaction validation,validation,validation phase</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dfeceae54500e0aef047f46e66c1451b-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-013</data>
