<edge source="Hyperledger Fabric" target="Hybrid Post-Quantum Signatures for Hyperledger Fabric">
  <data key="d7">33.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Hybrid Post-Quantum Signatures for Hyperledger Fabric and Hyperledger Fabric is one of targeted integration and evaluation. The work, presented as both a paper and an article, aims to support the post-quantum and quantum-safe migration of signatures in Hyperledger Fabric deployments. It studies how post-quantum cryptography (PQC) and hybrid signature schemes can be adopted on the Hyperledger Fabric platform to protect against future quantum threats.

Architecturally, the work adds a PQC signature layer and a hybrid PQC signing workflow on top of Hyperledger Fabric 2.5.13. The integration operates at the application layer and uses unmodified Hyperledger Fabric binaries, so native and core components are left unchanged. The hybrid post-quantum signatures are nonetheless incorporated into the Hyperledger Fabric transaction pipeline, which allows different signature configurations to be assessed across the platform's processing flow.

For evaluation, the scheme is implemented and benchmarked on a real, deployed multi-organization Hyperledger Fabric 2.5.13 network. The experiments measure the behavior of Fabric peers and orderers under post-quantum and hybrid signature configurations. The multi-organization network was run as a single-host deployment, meaning the organizations shared one physical machine rather than being geographically or physically distributed.</data>
  <data key="d9">PQC integration,addresses,application-layer integration,blockchain platform,deployed evaluation platform,deployed network,evaluation platform,extends,permissioned blockchain,platform,post-quantum signatures,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-041</data>
