<edge source="Boukhryss" target="Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components">
  <data key="d7">15.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Boukhryss and "Intelligent Predictive Maintenance Using Fuzzy Bayesian Networks for Critical IT Components" is one of authorship. Boukhryss is the first and lead author of this paper (also called an article). The work is cited as "Boukhryss et al.," which indicates that Boukhryss wrote it together with co-authors.

The attribution "Boukhryss et al." also appears in the paper's running header, which confirms Boukhryss's primary role among the authors of this research on fuzzy Bayesian network approaches to predictive maintenance of critical IT components.</data>
  <data key="d9">authored_by</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-015</data>
