<edge source="CPU State" target="CPU Temperature">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">CPU temperature is one of the two inputs to the nine fuzzy rules that determine the CPU State node.&lt;SEP&gt;CPU Temperature is a parent node of CPU State. In Rule 6, CPU Temperature=Warning together with System Load Average=High gives P(CPU State=Critical)=0.95.&lt;SEP&gt;CPU Temperature is a parent node of CPU State in the causal graph.</data>
  <data key="d9">causal parent,fuzzy rule input,parent node,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-007</data>
