<edge source="CPU State" target="System Load Average">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">System load average is one of the two inputs to the fuzzy rules that determine the CPU State node.&lt;SEP&gt;System Load Average is a parent node of CPU State. In Rule 6, System Load Average=High together with CPU Temperature=Warning gives P(CPU State=Degraded)=0.048 and P(Normal)=0.002.&lt;SEP&gt;System Load Average is a parent node of CPU State. The CPs of CPU State are given as a function of its states in Table 5.</data>
  <data key="d9">causal parent,fuzzy rule input,parent node,related_to</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eafe46d984faf5ae72cd0cf550c6ec66-chunk-007</data>
