<edge source="Statistical Process Control" target="Hybrid Approach Integrating Deep Learning-Autoencoder With SPC Chart">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between the Hybrid Approach Integrating Deep Learning-Autoencoder With SPC Chart and Statistical Process Control (SPC) is foundational. SPC is one of the two core components of the hybrid approach. The paper integrates a deep learning autoencoder, specifically a Long Short-Term Memory Autoencoder (LSTM-AE), with SPC charts to detect anomalies. Its stated aim is to overcome the limitations of traditional SPC by pairing it with modern machine learning methods.

Within this approach, SPC builds the control charts that set the upper and lower control limits (ULC and LLC). These limits act as decision thresholds and define the different types of anomalies, so SPC supplies the statistical structure that turns the autoencoder's outputs into interpretable anomaly classifications.

The paper also uses the SPC framework to run process capability studies. These yield a process capability index (Cp) of 2.37 and an adjusted process capability index (Cpk) of 2.36, which indicate a highly capable and well-centered process. SPC therefore serves both as a monitoring and anomaly-classification tool and as a means of assessing process capability.</data>
  <data key="d9">SPC chart,SPC integration,addresses,control limits,extends,hybrid,hybrid approach,overcoming limitations,quality control,uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1920bb99aa33c3c871f9dc257956e3ca-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d11">Hybrid_Approach_Integrating_Deep_Learning-Autoencoder_With_Statistical_Process_Control_Chart_for_Anomaly_Detection_Case_Study_in_Injection_Molding_Process1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791426381</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
