<edge source="Design of Combined Ahp-Topsis Model for Optimizing Selection of Injection Molding Machines" target="Scenario-Based Validation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper validates the final model through three distinct scenarios, which show the influence of cost breakdown and scrap rate on the ranking.</data>
