<edge source="Design of Combined Ahp-Topsis Model for Optimizing Selection of Injection Molding Machines" target="Technical Characteristics-Based Machine Selection">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper identifies the limitation of traditional selection based on technical characteristics: a single product may be technically valid on multiple machines.</data>
