<edge source="Decentralized Authentication Mechanism for Mobile Ad hoc Networks" target="Decentralized Authentication Mechanism">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper proposes a decentralized authentication mechanism based on fog computing and blockchain.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper proposes and evaluates a decentralized authentication mechanism for MANET.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper proposes a blockchain-based mechanism to authenticate MANET nodes.</data>
  <data key="d9">MANET security,proposes,security</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d11">InfocomJ_2022_3_4_Khalfaoui.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791466863</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Decentralized Authentication Mechanism for Mobile Ad hoc Networks" target="Mobile Ad Hoc Network">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper addresses node authentication in MANETs.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper targets security of Mobile Ad hoc Networks.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aaf2c8f641e35f769c72ec556a34ec4b-chunk-002</data>
