<edge source="CNN Without Canny Filter" target="CNN With Canny Filter">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The two configurations were compared on the same 3000/470 train/test split. The Canny-filtered configuration had higher accuracy (99.57% vs 95.31%), precision (99.44% vs 94.24%) and F1-score (99.72% vs 97.03%). Recall was 100% for both.</data>
  <data key="d9">compares_with,performance comparison</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-5436254d7328f14e8f79864da9fef604-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">MVML_120 (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791467205</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
