<edge source="Microservices Architecture" target="FSMicroGenerator">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">FSMicroGenerator generates full-stack web applications based on a microservices architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;FSMicroGenerator structures applications into logical units inspired by microservices principles.&lt;SEP&gt;FSMicroGenerator addresses microservices complexities by automating service generation and infrastructure setup.&lt;SEP&gt;FSMicroGenerator generates microservice solutions built on proven microservices architecture patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;FSMicroGenerator has a measurable impact on optimizing software development within complete microservices architectures.&lt;SEP&gt;FSMicroGenerator automates development of complex microservice architectures and simplifies microservices adoption.&lt;SEP&gt;FSMicroGenerator generates microservices-based solutions.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses,architecture,automation,generated architecture,generation,inspired by,related_to,software development optimization</data>
