<edge source="FSMicroGenerator" target="Manual Implementation">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The two approaches were compared under identical conditions with an 8-hour limit and asymmetric teams.&lt;SEP&gt;FSMicroGenerator-based development is compared with manual implementation by a five-developer team.&lt;SEP&gt;The FSMicroGenerator implementation is benchmarked against the manual implementation across effort, codebase size, latency, throughput, and resource consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;FSMicroGenerator implementation is compared against a manual implementation of the same web application.&lt;SEP&gt;FSMicroGenerator's generated system (16 containers) is compared with the manual implementation (9 containers) on effort, performance, resources, and quality.&lt;SEP&gt;The FSMicroGenerator-based implementation scored 5/5 on consistency and maintainability, while the manual implementation scored poorly, e.g. 2/5 on maintainability.&lt;SEP&gt;FSMicroGenerator achieves Rf = 28/28 = 1.00 versus 17/28 = 0.61 for manual implementation, and 5/5 on non-functional requirements where manual implementation often scores 0/5.</data>
  <data key="d9">benchmark,benchmarking,comparative evaluation,compares_with,development efficiency,evaluation,exploratory comparison,qualitative evaluation</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4aa31c8531fdbc66868e8d96c0e0d18-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d11">Microservices-Driven_Automation_in_Full-Stack_Deve.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791467681</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
