<edge source="GPT-4 Turbo" target="Llama 3">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The two models are compared to select the best LLM for chatbot responses.&lt;SEP&gt;GPT-4 Turbo and Llama 3 are compared on answers and response time; GPT-4 Turbo averages 3.12 s versus 0.86 s for Llama 3.&lt;SEP&gt;Comparative evaluation highlighted differences in response time, faithfulness and relevance between the two models.&lt;SEP&gt;GPT-4 Turbo outperforms Llama 3 in fidelity (1 versus 0.84) and answer relevance (0.971 versus 0.79).&lt;SEP&gt;GPT-4 Turbo yields richer responses but is slower, while Llama 3 is faster with less depth in complex cases.</data>
  <data key="d9">LLM selection,compares_with,performance,performance comparison,performance evaluation,speed vs depth</data>
