<edge source="Sequential Generation Method" target="Parallel Generation Method">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Table 6 compares both methods on distribution fidelity, condition satisfaction, generation time and null rows; the parallel method is 449.5x faster.</data>
  <data key="d9">compares_with,fidelity,speedup</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d11">Vol.13.No.7.13.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791501879</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Sequential Generation Method" target="GPU-Based Parallel Generation Method">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The parallel method generates 1,000,000 rows in 20 s versus 8990 s for the sequential method, with the same distribution fidelity and constraint satisfaction and fewer null rows (77 vs 119).</data>
  <data key="d9">compares_with,performance</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d11">Vol.13.No.7.13.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791501879</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Sequential Generation Method" target="Generation Time">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The sequential method required 8990 s to generate 1,000,000 rows.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses,performance</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d11">Vol.13.No.7.13.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791501879</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Sequential Generation Method" target="GPU-Accelerated Parallel Generation Method">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The parallel method reduced generation time for one million rows from 8990 s to 20 s with comparable null rows.</data>
  <data key="d9">compares_with,speedup</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d11">Vol.13.No.7.13.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791501904</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Parallel Generation Method" target="GPU Parallelization">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The parallel method relies on GPU parallelization, demonstrating its effectiveness and scalability.</data>
  <data key="d9">uses_method</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-8a68f6918fb713b374b6980cb85c4169-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d11">Vol.13.No.7.13.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791501879</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
