<edge source="Toward Quantum-Safe Permissioned Blockchains: Evaluating Hybrid ML-DSA-65/ECDSA Signatures on Hyperledger Fabric" target="Hybrid ML-DSA-65/ECDSA Signature Architecture">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper presents and evaluates the hybrid ML-DSA-65/ECDSA signature architecture for Fabric.</data>
  <data key="d9">hybrid signatures,proposes</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-000</data>
