<edge source="Toward Quantum-Safe Permissioned Blockchains: Evaluating Hybrid ML-DSA-65/ECDSA Signatures on Hyperledger Fabric" target="FIPS 204">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The NIST post-quantum cryptography standardization process has resulted in standardized algorithms such as ML-DSA, specified in FIPS 204, for post-quantum digital signatures [4].</data>
  <data key="d9">cites,standardization</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-000</data>
