<edge source="Ref [3] (Quantum Vulnerability of Blockchain ECDSA)" target="Hybrid Post-Quantum Signatures for Hyperledger Fabric">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Since ECDSA remains a common classical signature baseline in many blockchain architectures, including permissioned and permissionless systems, its vulnerability under the quantum threat model motivates the transition toward post-quantum alternatives [3].</data>
