<edge source="Post-Quantum Cryptography" target="Hybrid Post-Quantum Signatures for Hyperledger Fabric">
  <data key="d7">16.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between "Hybrid Post-Quantum Signatures for Hyperledger Fabric" and Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC) is the paper's central focus. The paper studies how post-quantum signatures can be integrated into Hyperledger Fabric, a permissioned blockchain platform. It reviews post-quantum cryptography and applies it to blockchain signatures, addressing post-quantum security for blockchain signing in general and for Fabric document signing in particular. In doing so, it also addresses the broader post-quantum migration of Fabric.

The article integrates the post-quantum ML-DSA signature scheme into Hyperledger Fabric by adding a PQC layer to the platform, and it evaluates a hybrid PQC signature configuration. The paper also considers hybrid PQC deployments that combine off-chain cryptographic services with on-chain execution. Methodologically, it aims to isolate the specific impact of post-quantum signatures on Fabric. This approach bridges post-quantum cryptographic benchmarking and the performance analysis of permissioned blockchains.

The paper concludes that the main barriers to adopting PQC in Hyperledger Fabric are integration complexity and storage overhead, not computational cost.</data>
  <data key="d9">PQC,addresses,adoption barriers,quantum-resistant signatures</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-033</data>
