<edge source="Block-Size Overhead" target="Hybrid Post-Quantum Signatures for Hyperledger Fabric">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The paper measures block-size overhead caused by post-quantum signatures.&lt;SEP&gt;Section VI-G analyzes on-ledger block-size overhead.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper identifies block-size overhead as the primary trade-off of PQC hybrid signing.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper measures a 1.48x block-size overhead proportional to the number of SignDocument transactions per block.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses,evaluation metric,ledger growth,ledger overhead,primary trade-off</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3cdf7983d59d3aabda65b170e48426b0-chunk-036</data>
