<edge source="PQC Microservice" target="Hybrid Post-Quantum Signatures for Hyperledger Fabric">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">ML-DSA-65 signing time is reported by the PQC microservice.&lt;SEP&gt;Workloads invoke the PQC microservice to generate signatures.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper reports cryptographic primitive performance of its PQC microservice.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper's PQC microservice responds in under 22 ms at 20 concurrent requests.&lt;SEP&gt;The PQC signing is performed by a microservice accessed over HTTP.</data>
  <data key="d9">proposes,signing service,uses_method</data>
