<edge source="Hybrid Post-Quantum Signatures for Hyperledger Fabric" target="CreateDocument">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">CreateDocument workloads are evaluated under PQC and ECDSA configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;CreateDocument is benchmarked in the baseline workload and in the S3 stress test, with no significant throughput or latency differences.&lt;SEP&gt;Stress-test throughput was measured for CreateDocument at 10 TPS and 50 TPS submission rates.&lt;SEP&gt;The proposed chaincode's CreateDocument initializes metadata without storing PQC artifacts.&lt;SEP&gt;The proposed chaincode's CreateDocument operation stores no PQC artifacts.&lt;SEP&gt;The paper implements a CreateDocument transaction that stores no PQC artifacts. This affects how ledger growth behaves under mixed workloads.</data>
  <data key="d9">addresses,baseline workload,chaincode,chaincode function,non-signing transaction,proposes,stress test,uses_method,workload</data>
